<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">- Sankaran</book>
  <para style="h">Hɔrɔya Suran</para>
  <para style="toc3">EXO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hɔrɔya</para>
  <para style="toc2">HƆR</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hɔrɔya</para>
  <para style="mt2">Musa Ka Alla la Kuma Mɛn Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Tawureta Musa yɔrɔ filana le ten. A ye Isirayɛlikailu jɔnya ni ii hɔrɔya le la ko ɲabɔla Misiran jamana. Alla ka ii hɔrɔya kosa ii ye bɔ Misiran jamana. Ale ka ii kunka, wo le rɔ, ka ii kɛ a ta ri, ka a sariyailu di ii ma. Alla mɛn ka Isirayɛli jama kunka a kaninteya rɔ, wo le a fɔni jama yɛ ko ii ye ii la kaninteya yiraka a la a sariyailu mira la.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isirayɛlikailu ban kɔrɔ sii diya sɔrɔnna Misiran dɔ, san siyaman taminni, ii kɛra jama ba ri. Kɔni ii kɛra Ferawuna jɔnilu ri. Alla tɛ a kɔnkɔ donna Isirayɛlikailu jɔnya tɔrɔya, a ka cɛɛ do suwandi ii yɛ mɛn tɔɔ le ko Musa kosa a ye lɔ ii ɲɛfɛ. Alla ka Misirankailu diyagboya a fanka la kosa ii ye hɔrɔya di Isirayɛlikailu ma, ka ii bila ka wa. Musa ka a lɔ ii ɲakɔrɔ, ka wa ii ri Sinayi koyinkɛ ma kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ. Alla ka Isirayɛli kɛ a jama ri, ka teriya sidi ii tɛma Sinayi koyinkɛ kan. A ka a sariyailu fɔ ii yɛ. Musa ka koyinkɛ kan sariyailu laban diya waati mɛn ma, ka bɛn yɔrɔ sɛnimanni lɔ ko ma. Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin banni yɔrɔ sɛnimanni lɔ ko le ma, Alla nara a jɛrɛ lɛnkɛnɛmayala yɔrɔ mɛn.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s">Isirayɛlika siyayara Misiran jamana rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />Nba, Yakuba mɛn tɔɔ fanan ko Isirayɛli, wo wa mɛn kɛni Misiran jamana rɔ, a ni a dencɛilu wara, bɛɛ ni a la denbaya. A dencɛilu tɔɔ le ɲin di: <verse eid="EXO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Rubɛn, Simeyɔn, Lebi, Juda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />Isakari, Sabulɔn, Bɛniyaminu, <verse eid="EXO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />Daan, Nafitali, Kadi a ni Asɛri. <verse eid="EXO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />Yakuba la mɔɔilu bɛɛ ladɛnnin kɛra mɔɔ biwɔrɔnwula (70) le ri. A dencɛ Yusufu kelen de tɛrɛ ye Misiran.<verse eid="EXO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Nba, Yusufu a ni a dɔɔcɛ ni a kɔrɔcɛilu, a ni mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye a tɔrɔfɛ waati wo rɔ, woilu bɛɛ kɔrɔra ka sa. <verse eid="EXO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />Isirayɛlika jirira ka siyaya kosɛbɛ ii ka ban ka fanka ba sɔrɔn ka jamana lafa ii la mɔɔilu la.<verse eid="EXO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya damira waati Misiran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Nba, waati jan taminni kɔ rɔ, mansa kura do siira Misiran jamana kun na, mɛn tun ma foyi lɔn Yusufu la ko rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Mansa wo ka a fɔ a la mɔɔilu yɛ ko: «Ai ma a yen? Isirayɛlika ka siya an di. Ii la jama ka bon an na jama ri, a ni ii la fanka ka bon an na fanka ri. <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" />Wo rɔ, an ye ɲaɲinin ii la ko ma. Ni wo tɛ, ii ri to siyayala. Ni kɛlɛ nara lon mɛn na, ii ri la an juuilu kan ka an kɛlɛ, ka ban ka bɔ an na jamana rɔ.» <verse eid="EXO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" />Wo le rɔ, ii ka baara kuntiilu lasii Isirayɛlika kun na, ka ii tɔrɔ baara gbɛlɛn na. Wo bolo ma, Isirayɛlika ka Pitɔn so ni Ramɛsisi so lɔ. So woilu kɛra Ferawuna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Misirankailu ka ii la mansa bɛɛ tɔɔ kilili ko Ferawuna</char></note> la fen namara dinkirailu ri. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Misirankailu ka Isirayɛlika tɔrɔ kojuuya, kɔni Isirayɛlika tora siyayala ka jɛnsɛn. Wo le kɛra sababu ri, Isirayɛlika la ko jiitɔya donda Misirankailu la kojuuya. <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />Ii ka Isirayɛlika mira karagbɛlɛya la ka ii bila baara gbɛlɛn na. <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" />Ii ka ii tɔrɔ fɔɔ ka a dan natamin, ka ii bila baara gbɛlɛn bailu la. Ii ka ii lɔ diyagboya biriki gbasila, a ni bɔɔ bɔrɔnna, ka ii lɔ diyagboya sɛnɛ baara su bɛɛ kɛla. Ii ka ii lɔ diyagboya baara mɛnilu kɛla, woilu bɛɛ kɛra baara gbɛlɛn de ri.<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ferawuna ka mɛn natɛɛ Isirayɛlika kanma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Nba, lon do rɔ, Misiran mansa kumara Heburuilu la tinkɔrɔsila fila yɛ. Wo kelen tɔɔ le ko Sifira, do wo tɔɔ ko Puwa. <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />A ka a fɔ woilu yɛ ko: «Ai wa wa Heburu musoilu dɛmɛn den sɔrɔn diya tuma tuma, ai ye den dagbɛ. Ni a kɛra cɛɛ ri, ai ye a faa. Ni a kɛra muso ri, ai ye a kɛndɛ to.» <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" />Tinkɔrɔsilailu kɔnin silanda Alla yɛ. Misiran mansa ka mɛn fɔ, ii ma sɔn wo kɛla. Ii ka den cɛman kɛndɛ to. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Misiran mansa ka tinkɔrɔsilailu kili ka ii maɲininka ko: «Nfenna ai ka wo kɛ? Nfenna ai ra Heburuilu den cɛman to ye?»<verse eid="EXO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" />Tinkɔrɔsilailu ka a fɔ ko: «Heburu musoilu tɛ ikomin Misiran musoilu. Ii kaliman moyila. Sani an ye don ii kan, wo ri a tɛrɛn ii ra ban moyila.»<verse eid="EXO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20" />Awa, Isirayɛlika tora siyayala. Fanka ba kɛra ii la. Alla ka ɲumaya kɛ tinkɔrɔsila woilu yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21" />A ka denbaya di woilu fanan ma, ka a masɔrɔn ii silanda a yɛ.<verse eid="EXO 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Ferawuna ka a la mɔɔ bɛɛ jamari ko: «Heburu musoilu wa den cɛmanta mɛnilu sɔrɔn, ai ye wo bɛɛ mira ka ii lafili Nili Ba ji rɔ, kɔni ai ye den musomanta kɛndɛ to.»<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s">Musa sɔrɔn ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />Nba, waati wo la, Lebi kabila cɛɛ do ka Lebi kabila muso do furu. <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" />Muso wo ka kɔnɔ ta ka dencɛ sɔrɔn. A ka a yen tuma mɛn na ko den ka ɲin, a ka a dokon fɔɔ karo sawa. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Karo sawa taminnin kɔ rɔ, muso ma se den doonna butun. Wo rɔ, a ka see do ta, mɛn nadanni bin kala jan na. A ka wo mamun tulubɔ fasanin ni mananji la. A ka den ta ka a lala see wo kɔndɔ, ka wa wo sii jirɔbin kuruilu tɛma Nili Ba rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" />Den wo kɔrɔmuso wara i lɔ dinkira do rɔ, mɛn ma jan den na kosɛbɛ, sa a ri a lɔn ko mɛn kɛtɔ den sɔrɔn na.<verse eid="EXO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />Ferawuna denmuso nara a ko diya ba la. Jɔn sunkurun mɛnilu nani a malɔla, woilu wara ii mataama ba dala. Ferawuna denmuso ka see yen jirɔ binilu tɛma, ka a la jɔnmuso do lɔ a tala. <verse eid="EXO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />Jɔnmuso nani see ri, Ferawuna denmuso ka a da laka ka den yen a kɔndɔ. A hina ba donda a rɔ, baa den ye kasila. A ka a fɔ ko: «Heburu do dencɛ le ɲin di.»<verse eid="EXO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Den kɔrɔmuso nara ka Ferawuna denmuso maɲininka ko: «I ye a fɛ n ye wa Heburu muso do ɲinin wa, mɛn di den sɔ sin dɔ i yɛ?»<verse eid="EXO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Ferawuna denmuso ka a jabi: «Ale le wo ri. Wa.» Sunkurun wara ka den na le kili. <verse eid="EXO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Den na nani, Ferawuna denmuso ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye den ɲin ta ka a sɔ sin dɔ n yɛ. N di i sara.» Muso ka den ta ka a sɔ sin dɔ. <verse eid="EXO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />Den kunbayara dɔɔni tuma mɛn na, a na wara ka a di Ferawuna denmuso ma. Wo ka den kɛ a jɛrɛ dencɛ ri. A ka a fɔ ko: «N di den tɔɔ la ko <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Musa kɔrɔ le ko n da n bɔ fen ma ji kan</char></note>Musa, baa n ka a ta ba ji le kan.»<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa ka i bori ka wa Madiyan bɔnsɔn na jamana rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />Nba, Musa kunbayara. Lon do rɔ, a wara bɔ a badenma Heburuilu fɛ. A ka a yen ko Misirankailu tɛrɛ ye ii diyagboyala baara gbɛlɛnilu la. A ka Misiranka cɛɛ do yen Heburu cɛɛ do gbasila, mɛn ye Musa badenma do ri. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Musa ka a ɲalakalan fan bɛɛ rɔ, mɔɔ si tɛrɛ sa a laminin dɔ. A ka Misiranka cɛɛ wo gbasi ka a faa, ka a su dokon kiɲɛ rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Wo duu sa gbɛ, Musa wara bɔ a badenmailu tɔrɔfɛ ikɔ tuun. Sisɛn a ka Heburu cɛɛ fila tɛrɛn ye, ii ye kɛlɛla. Jo tɛ mɛn bolo, Musa ka a fɔ wo yɛ ko: «Nfenna i ye i badenma wo gbasila?»<verse eid="EXO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Wo ka a jabi: «Yon ka i kɛ an na kuntii ri a ni an na kititɛɛla ri? I ye a fɛ ka nde fanan faa wa, ikomin i ka Misiranka cɛɛ faa ɲa mɛn ma kunun?» Musa silanda. A ka i miri ko: «Sika tɛ a rɔ, n ka mɛn kɛ kunun, mɔɔilu ra wo lɔn.» <verse eid="EXO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" />Musa la mɔɔfaa ko fɔra Ferawuna yɛ tuma mɛn na, a tɛrɛ ye Musa ɲininna fɔɔ ka a faa, kɔni Musa ka i bori a kɔrɔ ka wa Madiyan bɔnsɔn na jamana rɔ. A se mɛn kɛni ye, a ka a sii kɔlɔn do tɔrɔfɛ ye.<verse eid="EXO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" />Awa, Madiyan bɔnsɔn na sarakalasela do tɛrɛ ye, denmuso wɔrɔnwula tɛrɛ ye mɛn bolo. Denmuso woilu nara ii fa la kolofen mɛsɛnilu ri ii lamin diya kɔlɔn na ye. Denmusoilu ka ji ta damira ka a kɛ kolofenilu minfen kɔndɔ. <verse eid="EXO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />Ka denmusoilu to baara wo la, saagbɛnbɛnna doilu nara ka ii gbɛn, kɔni Musa ka wuli ka denmuso woilu lakandan, ka ji layɛlɛ kɔlɔn kɔndɔ, ka denmusoilu la kolofenilu lamin.<verse eid="EXO 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />Denmusoilu ka i kɔsɛ ii fa Rewɛli wara tuma mɛn na, wo ka ii maɲininka ko: «Nfen de ka a kɛ ai ra na jonna bi?»<verse eid="EXO 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Misiranka cɛɛ do le ka an bɔ saa gbɛngbɛnnailu bolo. Ka a la wo kan, ka ban ka ji layɛlɛ kɔlɔn dɔ an yɛ ka an na kolofenilu lamin.»<verse eid="EXO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Rɛwɛli ka a denmusoilu maɲininka ko: «Cɛɛ wo ye min? Nfenna ai ka a to ai kɔma ye? Ai ye wa a kili. A ye na dɔɔnnin kɛ an tɔrɔfɛ.»<verse eid="EXO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Musa sɔnda ka a sii cɛɛ wo wara, mɛn ka a denmuso Sefora di Musa ma. <verse eid="EXO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" />Sefora ka kɔnɔ ta ka dencɛ sɔrɔn Musa yɛ. Musa ka den tɔɔ la ko <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kerisɔn kɔrɔ le ko londanya</char></note>Kerisɔn, baa a ka a fɔ ko a ye londan de ri jamana wo rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />Nba, san siyaman taminni kɔ rɔ, Misiran mansa wo sara. Isirayɛlika tɛrɛ ye ii kule kan nabɔla fɔlɔ, baa jɔnya baara tun da ii sɛɛ fɔɔ ka a dan natamin. Ii tɛrɛ ye ii makasila Alla yɛ ko a ye ii dɛmɛn. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" />Alla tolo tɛrɛ ye ii la makasila kan na. A jan tɛrɛ ye a la teriya rɔ, a tun ka mɛn sidi Iburahima ni Isiyaka ni Yakuba yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />A ka Isirayɛlika yen tuma mɛn na, ii hina donda a la.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s">Alla ka Musa kelaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />Nba, Musa tɛrɛ ye a birancɛ Rɛwɛli la kolofen mɛsɛnilu marala. A birancɛ tɛrɛ ye Madiyan bɔnsɔn na sarakalasela le ri. Awa, lon do rɔ, Musa wara kolofenilu ri kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ, fɔɔ ka wa se Horɛbu koyinkɛ kɔrɔ, mɛn tɔɔ le ko Alla la koyinkɛ. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" />Ka Musa to yɔrɔ wo rɔ, Allabatala la mɛlɛka ka a jɛrɛ yiraka a la jiri tunin tamɛlɛnama rɔ. Musa ka a ragbɛ. Ta ye jiri tunin na kɔni a tɛ janinna. <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Musa miri ko: «N ye n madon a la ka kabanan ko ɲin mafɛnɛ. Nfenna jiri tunin ɲin tɛ janinna?» <verse eid="EXO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />Allabatala ka a yen tuma mɛn na ko Musa ra madon ka a ragbɛ, a tora jiri tunin dɔ ka a kan nabɔ Musa ma ko: «Musa, Musa.» Musa ka a jabi: «Naamun.» <verse eid="EXO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" />Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «I kana i madon yan na. I la sanbara bɔ i sen dɔ, baa i lɔni yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ ɲin, yɔrɔ sɛniman de wo ri. <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" />N ye i fa la Alla le ri. N ye i benba Iburahima la Alla le ri, a ni i benba Isiyaka, a ni i benba Yakuba la Alla.» Musa ka a ɲakɔrɔ dokon ka a masɔrɔn a silanda ka Alla ragbɛ. <verse eid="EXO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «Misirankailu ye n na mɔɔilu tɔrɔla ɲa mɛn ma Misiran, n da wo yen. Ii la baara kuntiilu ye mɛn kɛla ii la, n da wo fanan yen ka ii kasi kan mɛn. N ka ii la tɔrɔya lɔn. <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" />N da jii ka ii bɔ Misirankailu bolo, ka ii labɔ Misiran jamana rɔ, ka wa ii ri jamana ba do rɔ, mɛn ka ɲin, a duman kosɛbɛ. Damununta duman ye bɔla jamana wo rɔ a ɲa jɛrɛ jɛrɛ ma, li ni nɔnɔ a ni jiri denta su bɛɛ ye bɔla ye. Kanaanka siinin ye le, a ni Hɛti bɔnsɔn ni Amɔrikailu ni Peresikailu ni Hifikailu ni Jebusikailu. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />Isirayɛlika kasi kan da se n ma yan. Misirankailu karagbɛlɛman ii ɲa mɛn ma, n da wo bɛɛ yen. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />Nba, sisɛn n ye i lawala ka kuma Ferawuna yɛ. Wa! I ye i lɔ n na mɔɔilu ɲɔrɔ ka ii labɔ Misiran jamana kɔndɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />Musa ka Alla jabi: «Nde wa? N tɛ foyi ri! N di se n lɔla Ferawuna ɲakɔrɔ di, ka n lɔ Isirayɛlika ɲɔrɔ ka ii labɔ Misiran?» <verse eid="EXO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" />Alla ka a fɔ ko: «N di kɛ i kɔfɛ. I wa n na mɔɔilu labɔ Misiran jamana rɔ tuma mɛn na, ai ri na n bato koyinkɛ ɲin kan yan. Wo ri kɛ tɔɔmasere ri i yɛ ko nde le ka i kelaya.» <verse eid="EXO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: «Ni n di wa Isirayɛlika tɛrɛn ye, n di a fɔ ii yɛ ko ii benbailu Maari ra n kelaya ii ma. Ii wa n maɲininka i tɔɔ ma don? N ye nfen fɔ ii yɛ wo rɔ?»<verse eid="EXO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" />Alla ka Musa jabi: «Mɛn Ye Ye, nde le wo ri. I ye a fɔ Isirayɛlika yɛ ko ‹Mɛn Ye Ye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mɛn Ye Ye </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɛn Ye Ye a tɔɔ ye kilila fanan Allabatala</char></note> a jɛrɛ ka n lawa ai ma.› <verse eid="EXO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />I ye wa a fɔ Isirayɛlika yɛ ko ‹Allabatala le ka n kelaya ai ma, ale mɛn ye ai benba Iburahima Maari Alla ri, a ni ai benba Isiyaka ta, a ni ai benba Yakuba ta. A tɔɔ ye ten de haan ka wa habadan. Mɔɔilu kɛtɔ a kilila tɔɔ wo le la tuma bɛɛ.› <verse eid="EXO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" />I ye wa Misiran. I wa se ye, i ye Isirayɛlika la mɔɔbakɔrɔilu ladɛn ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: ‹Maari Allabatala ra a jɛrɛ yiraka n na. Ko a ye ai benbailu Maari Alla le ri, Iburahima ta a ni Isiyaka ta ni Yakuba ta kɔnin. A fɔ ko: «Mɛn bɛɛ ye kɛla ai la Misiran, ko n da wo yen. <verse eid="EXO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />Ko wo le rɔ, n ka a fɔ ko n di ai labɔ tɔrɔya rɔ Misiran, ka wa ai ri jamana do rɔ, Kanaankailu ni Hɛti bɔnsɔnilu ni Amɔrikailu ni Peresikailu ni Hifikailu ni Jebusikailu siini jamana mɛn kɔndɔ, dɔɔnninta duman ye bɔla jamana wo rɔ a ɲa jɛrɛ jɛrɛ ma, li ni nɔnɔ a bɛɛ ye bɔla ye.»›<verse eid="EXO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />«Isirayɛlika di la i la kuma la ka wo mira. I ni Isirayɛlika la mɔɔbakɔrɔilu ri wa Misiran mansa tɛrɛn ye, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: ‹Heburuilu Maari Allabatala ra an nabɛn. Ko wo rɔ, ko an ye Ferawuna madiyala ko i ye an bila, kosa an di tele sawa kɛ taamana kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ ka wa ka saraka bɔ an Maari Allabatala ma.› <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />N ka a lɔn fewu ko a ti nala sɔnna ka ai bila na n ma diyagboya fanka la a kan. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" />Wo le rɔ, n di n wuli Misirankailu kanma ka n na sebaya yiraka ii la. N di kabannakoilu kɛ, mɛnilu ri tɔrɔya su bɛɛ la ii kan. N wa ban woilu kɛla, Ferawuna ri ai bila sa ai ri wa. <verse eid="EXO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" />N jɛrɛ ri a kɛ, Misirankailu ri ai bonya. Wo rɔ, ai bɔtɔla ye, ai bolokolon ti nala bɔla ka wa. <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" />Isirayɛlika muso kelen kelenna bɛɛ ri a siiɲɔɔ muso Misiranka matara a ni Misiranka muso mɛn siini a la bon kɔndɔ fen mɛnilu dannin sanin ni wodigbɛ la, a ni faaninilu la. Aile, Isirayɛlika ri faanin ni masidifen woilu bila ai dencɛilu ni ai denmusoilu kan na. Ai ye Misirankailu bolokolonyala wo ɲa ma.»<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s">Alla ka tɔɔmasere kabannakoilu yiraka Musa la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Musa ka Allabatala jabi: «Ni ii ma la n na ka sɔn n na kuma ma don? Ni ii ka a fɔ ko ‹Allabatala ma a jɛrɛ yiraka i la,› n ye nfen kɛla wo rɔ?» <verse eid="EXO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />Allabatala ka a maɲininka ko: «Nfen de ye i bolo ye?» Musa ka a fɔ ko: «N na gbeleke le n bolo.» <verse eid="EXO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «A lafili duu ma.» A ka a lafili duu ma tuma mɛn na, gbeleke yɛlɛmanda ka kɛ duuma sa ri. Musa ka a bori a kɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «I bolo rasɔmɔn ka sa wo mira a ko ma.» A ka a bolo rasɔmɔn ka a mira a ko ma. Sa yɛlɛmanda ka kɛ gbeleke ri a bolo ikɔ tuun. <verse eid="EXO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" />Allabatala ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ri wo kɛ, sa ii ri la a la ko Allabatala a ra a jɛrɛ yiraka i la, Allabatala mɛn ye ii benbailu Maari ri, Iburahima Maari Alla a ni Isiyaka Maari Alla a ni Yakuba fanan Maari Alla kɔnin.»<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />Allabatala ka a fɔ a yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «I bolo ladon i la duruki kɔrɔ ka a la i sisi kan.» A ka a bolo ladon a la duruki kɔrɔ ka a la a sisi kan. A ka a labɔ tuma mɛn na, a gbɛni tɛrɛ fɛfɛ, baa kuna tun da a mira. <verse eid="EXO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" />Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «I bolo ladon i la duruki kɔrɔ ikɔ tuun.» Musa ka a bolo ladon a la duruki kɔrɔ ikɔ tuun. A ka a labɔ tuma mɛn na, a bolo kɛndɛyara ikomin a tɛrɛ ye ɲa mɛn ma fɔlɔ. <verse eid="EXO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «I la gbeleke wa yɛlɛman ka kɛ sa ri tuma mɛn na, ni Isirayɛlikailu ma sɔn fɔlɔ ka la i la ka i la kuma jate, i ye tɔɔmasere kabannako filana ɲin yiraka ii la. Ii ri la i la wo rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Ni ii ma la tɔɔmasere kabannako fila ɲin na ka sɔn i la kuma ma, i ye ji do ta Nili Ba rɔ ka a labɔn duu ma. Wo ri yɛlɛman ka kɛ jeli ri duu ma.»<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Allabatala ka Haruna kɛ Musa dɛmɛnba ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />Musa ka a fɔ Allabatala yɛ ko: «Faama, i ri hakɛ to. N ma kusan kumala. Sani i ye kuma n yɛ fɔlɔ, n tun ma kusan kumala. I ra kuma n yɛ bi fanan, hali bi n ma kusanya kumala fɔlɔ. N da a radiyani tɛ fewu. N nɛn sidinin le.» <verse eid="EXO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />Allabatala ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Yon de ka mɔɔ da ladan? Yon de ye mɔɔ kɛla bobo ri, wala tolo gbɛdɛn? Yon ka a kɛ mɔɔ ɲa ye fen yenna, wala ka a ɲa funyen? Nde Allabatala de woilu kɛla. <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" />I ye wa sisɛn. I wa kɛ kumala, n jɛrɛ ri kɛ i tɔrɔfɛ ka i dɛmɛn. I ka kan ka mɛn fɔ, n di wo yiraka i la.» <verse eid="EXO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: «Ee Allabatala, i jaandi, i ye mɔɔ gbɛrɛ lawa.»<verse eid="EXO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />Allabatala mɔnɛra Musa kanma ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I kɔrɔcɛ Haruna don, mɛn ye Lebi kabila mɔɔ le ri? N ka a lɔn ko wo kusan kumala a ɲa ma. A ye sila kan sisɛn ka na i labɛn. A wa i yen tuma mɛn na, a jusu ri sɛwa kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" />I ri kuma a yɛ ka kuma don a da rɔ, a ka kan ka mɛn fɔ. N di ai mɔɔ fila dɛmɛn kumala. Ai ka kan ka mɛnilu kɛ, n di ai karan woilu la. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" />A ri kuma jama yɛ i nɔ rɔ. A ri kɛ i la kumafɔba ri. A ri i la kuma fɔ ikomin i ye Alla la kuma fɔla ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />I la gbeleke ye wa i bolo, baa i ri tɔɔmasere kabannakoilu kɛ wo la.»<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa ka a kɔsɛ Misiran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Nba, Musa bɔra ye ka a kɔsɛ a birancɛ Jɛtiro<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jɛtiro mɛn fanan tɔɔ ko Rɛwɛli</char></note> wara, ka wa a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye sila di n ma, sa n di n kɔsɛ n badenmailu ma Misiran. N ye a fɛ ka a lɔn ni ii kɛndɛ le.» Jɛtiro ka a fɔ ko: «I ye wa fasayi! Alla ye jususuma don i yɛ.» <verse eid="EXO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" />Ka Musa to Madiyan, Allabatala ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye i kɔsɛ Misiran, baa mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye i faa ko rɔ, woilu ra sa.» <verse eid="EXO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" />Wo rɔ, Musa ka a muso ni a dencɛilu ta, ka ii layɛlɛ fali do kan, ka Misiran sila mira. Alla la gbeleke tɛrɛ ye a bolo.<verse eid="EXO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «N da sebaya di i ma ka ko makabanin kɛ. I wa i kɔsɛ Misiran tuma mɛn na, i ye woilu bɛɛ kɛ Ferawuna ɲakɔrɔ, kɔni nde le ri a kɛ a jusu ri a ragbɛlɛya. A ti nala sɔnna ka Isirayɛlikailu bila kɔma. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" />I ye a fɔ Ferawuna yɛ ko: ‹Nde Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «Isirayɛlikailu ye n dencɛ fɔlɔ le ri. <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />N ka a fɔ i yɛ ko i ye a bila sa a ri wa n bato, kɔni i ra i ban a bila ko ma. Wo rɔ, n di i dencɛ fɔlɔ faa.»›»<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />Nba, Musa watɔla Misiran, a ni a la denbaya sira sila la yɔrɔ do rɔ. Allabatala wulira Musa kanma ye ko a kɛtɔ a faala. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Kɔni Musa muso Sefora ka kaba lɛsɛnin do ta ka a dencɛ a la faaninta kɛ wo la. A ka a dencɛ ɲɔɔrɔ gbolo wo maa a sen na ii tɛma, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ra kɛ n furucɛ jelitii ri.» <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />Allabatala ka Musa to ye wo rɔ. Sefora tun ka a fɔ Musa ma ko «n furucɛ jelitii» ka a masɔrɔn faaninta kɛ ko wo le fɛ.<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haruna ka Musa labɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />Nba, Allabatala ka a fɔ Haruna yɛ ko: «I ye wa Musa labɛn kiɲɛ fufu rɔ.» Haruna ka a wuli ka wa. A wara Musa tɛrɛn Alla la koyinkɛ kɔrɔ, ka a sunbu tuwali rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Allabatala ka kuma mɛnilu fɔ Musa yɛ a la kelaya tuma, Musa ka woilu bɛɛ fɔ Haruna yɛ. Allabatala ka tɔɔmasere kabannako mɛnilu yiraka Musa la ko a ye woilu kɛ Misiran, Musa ka woilu fanan ɲafɔ Haruna yɛ.<verse eid="EXO 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Musa ni Haruna wara ka Isirayɛlikailu la mɔɔbakɔrɔilu bɛɛ ladɛn. <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />Allabatala tun ka kuma mɛnilu bɛɛ fɔ Musa yɛ, Haruna ka woilu fɔ mɔɔbakɔrɔilu yɛ. A ka tɔɔmasere kabannakoilu kɛ Isirayɛlikailu ɲakɔrɔ fanan. <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />Isirayɛlikailu lara kuma ni tɔɔmasere kabannako woilu la. Ii ka a mɛn tuma mɛn na ko Allabatala a ra ii la tɔrɔya yen ka na ii dɛmɛn kanma, ii ka ii ɲakɔrɔ bɛn duu ma ka a bato.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s">Baara gbɛlɛnyara ka tamin a fɔlɔma kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Nba, wo kɔ rɔ, Musa ni Haruna wara Ferawuna wara, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Isirayɛlika Maari Allabatala ka a fɔ ko i ye a la mɔɔilu bila sa ii ri wa ka sali ba kɛ kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ ale bato kanma.» <verse eid="EXO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" />Ferawuna ka a fɔ ko: «Yon ye Allabatala wo ri? Nfenna n ye a kan mirala ka Isirayɛlika bila? Nde ma Allabatala wo lɔn fewu. N ti nala Isirayɛlika bilala.» <verse eid="EXO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Musa ni Haruna ka a jabi: «Heburuilu Maari Alla a ra a jɛrɛ yiraka an na. An ye i madiyala, i ye an bila. An ye tele sawa kɛ taamanna kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ, ka wa saraka doilu bɔ an Maari Allabatala yɛ, sa Allabatala kana an gbasi jankarɔ la, wala fanmuru la.» <verse eid="EXO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Misiran mansa ka a fɔ ko: «Ai, Musa ni Haruna, nfenna ai ye mɔɔilu labanna ii la baara ma? Ai ye i kɔsɛ baara diya! <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Heburuilu ra siyaya bakɛ sisɛn jamana kɔndɔ yan. Nfenna ai ye ii la baara lalɔla?»<verse eid="EXO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Wo lon kelen dɔ Ferawuna ka baara kɔrɔsilabailu ni baara kuntiilu jamari ko: <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />«Heburuilu ye bin mɛn kɛla bɔɔ rɔ ka birikiilu gbasi, ai ye wo da boloka. Ii ye wa bin wo ɲinin ii jɛrɛ yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Hali wo, ii dorini biriki jate mɛn gbasila, ai ye a fɔ ii yɛ ko ii ye wo ɲɔɔn jate gbasi fɔlɔ fasayi. Ai kana foyi bɔ wo la, baa ii ra kɛ salabatɔilu ri. Wo le kosɔn, ii ye a fɔla ko: An ye wa saraka bɔ an Maari Alla ma. <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />Ai ye baarala siyaya ii ma, ka ii ɲagba kosɛbɛ. Wo wa kɛ, ii tɛ ii tolo malɔ wuyafɔla kuma la butun.»<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Nba, baara kɔrɔsilabailu ni baara kuntiilu wara kuma wo fɔ Isirayɛlika yɛ ko: «Ferawuna ka a fɔ ko a ti nala bin dila ai ma butun. <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />Ko ai ye wa bin ɲinin ai jɛrɛ yɛ yɔrɔ yɔrɔ rɔ. Wo bɛɛ ni a ta, ai tɛrɛ ye biriki jate mɛn gbasila kɔrɔman na, fɔɔ ii ye wo jate gbasi fɔlɔ. Fen ti nala bɔla jate wo la.» <verse eid="EXO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />Wo le rɔ, Isirayɛlika jɛnsɛnda Misiran jamana fan bɛɛ rɔ, ka wa bin wo ɲinin. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Baara kuntiilu tɛrɛ ye ii latuntunna, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai dorini tɛrɛ biriki jate mɛn gbasila tele kelen kɔrɔ ka a tɛrɛn an ye bin dila ai ma, ai ye wo ɲɔɔn jate gbasi lon lon.» <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />Ferawuna la baara kuntiilu wulira ka baara Isirayɛlika kɔrɔsibailu gbasi, baara kuntiilu tun ka Isirayɛlika mɛnilu lasii mɔɔ tɔilu kun na baara kɔrɔsi kanma kɔnin. Baara kuntiilu ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai dorini tɛrɛ biriki jate mɛn gbasila, nfenna ai ma wo ɲɔɔn jate gbasi kunun ni bi?»<verse eid="EXO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Nba baara kɔrɔsiba woilu wara Ferawuna wara ka ii makasi. Ii ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Nfenna i ye ɲin ɲɔɔn kɛla i la jɔnilu la? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />Bin tɛ dila an ma, kɔni baara kuntiilu ye an jamarila ko an ye biriki gbasi. Ka a la wo kan, ii ye an gbasila. Jo tɛ i la mɔɔilu bolo la.»<verse eid="EXO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Ferawuna kɔni ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye salaba jɛrɛ jɛrɛilu le ri. Wo le rɔ, ai ye a fɔla tuma bɛɛ ko: ‹An ye wa saraka bɔ Allabatala yɛ.› <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Ai ye wa baara kɛ sisɛn. Bin ti nala dila ai ma butun, kɔni ai dorinin tɛrɛ biriki jate mɛn gbasila kɔrɔman, ai ye biriki jate wo gbasi fanan.» <verse eid="EXO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Nba, a fɔra baara kɔrɔsilabailu yɛ tuma mɛn na ko ii dorini tɛrɛ biriki jate mɛn gbasila kɔrɔman, ko ii ye wo jate gbasi lon lon, ii ka a yen ko ii ni Isirayɛlika bɛɛ a ra tɔrɔya ba sɔrɔn. <verse eid="EXO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />Ii bɔtɔla Ferawuna wara, ii bɛnda Musa ni Haruna ri. Woilu tɛrɛ ye ii makɔnɔla ye. <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" />Ii ka a fɔ Musa ni Haruna yɛ ko: «Ai ka ko mɛn kɛ, Allabatala ye wo ragbɛ ka wo hakɛ bɔ ai rɔ. Ai ra an magboya Ferawuna ni a la mɔɔilu ɲakɔrɔ. A kɛni ikomin ai ka fan de di Ferawuna ma ko a ye an faa fanmuru la.»<verse eid="EXO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" />Awa, Musa bɔra ye ka wa Allabatala matara, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N Maari Alla, nfenna i ka kojuu kɛ i la mɔɔilu la? Nfenna i ka n kelaya ka n nana yan? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" />Kɛbi n wara ka kuma Ferawuna yɛ i tɔɔ rɔ, a ra kojuu kɛ i la mɔɔilu la. Ile fanan ma foyi kɛ ka ii bɔ a bolo.»<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="s">Allabatala ka a fɔ ko a ri Isirayɛlika kisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «N kɛtɔ mɛn kɛla Ferawuna la, i jɛrɛ ri wo yen i ɲa la sisɛn. N di a diyagboya n na sebaya a la fɔɔ a ri Isirayɛlika bila. Ɔɔn, n di a diyagboya n na sebaya a la fɔɔ a ri ii gbɛn ka ii labɔ a la jamana kɔndɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Alla ka a fɔ Musa yɛ fanan ko: «Nde le Allabatala ri. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" />N ka n jɛrɛ yiraka Iburahima ni Isiyaka ni Yakuba la, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko n ye Alla Sebɛɛtii le ri, kɔni n tɔɔ mɛn ye Allabatala ri, ii ma n lɔn tɔɔ wo la. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" />N ka teriya sidi ii yɛ ko n di Kanaan jamana di ii ma, ii siini tɛrɛ londanya la jamana mɛn dɔ. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Nba, sisɛn n da Isirayɛlika kurun kan mɛn, baa ii bilanin jɔnya rɔ Misirankailu bolo. N ka teriya mɛn sidi, n hankili ye wo rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" />«Wo le rɔ, i ye wa a fɔ Isirayɛlika yɛ ko: ‹Nde le Allabatala ri. Misirankailu ra diyagboya baara mɛn la ai kan, ko n kɛtɔ ai bɔla wo rɔ. Ko n di ai labɔ Misirankailu bolo, sa ai kana to woilu la jɔnya wo rɔ butun. Ko n di ai kunka n na sebaya ba la, ka Misirankailu la kɛwaliilu hakɛ bɔ ii rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />Ko n di Isirayɛlika kɛ n na mɔɔilu ri. Ko n di kɛ ai Maari Alla ri. Ko ai ri a lɔn ko n ye ai Maari Allabatala de ri, mɛn ye ai labɔla diyagboya baara rɔ Misirankailu bolo. <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />Ko n ka n kali Iburahima ni Isiyaka ni Yakuba yɛ n bolo layɛlɛnin, ko n di jamana mɛn di ii ma, ko n di ai ladon jamana wo kɔndɔ. Ko n di jamana wo kɛ ai ta ri. Nde le Allabatala ri.›» <verse eid="EXO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Nba, Musa wara kuma wo fɔ Isirayɛlika yɛ, kɔni woilu jiitɛɛni tɛrɛ kojuuya ii la jɔnya gbɛlɛnya bolo ma. Wo rɔ, ii ma sɔn lala a la kumakan na.<verse eid="EXO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />Awa, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />«I ye wa a fɔ Misiran mansa yɛ ko a ye Isirayɛlika bila sa ii ri bɔ a la jamana rɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" />Musa ka Allabatala jabi: «Ni Isirayɛlika ti nala sɔnna n na kuma ma. Ferawuna ri sɔn n na kuma ma wo rɔ wa? Wo kuma tɛ, baa nde ma kusan kumala.» <verse eid="EXO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />Allabatala kɔnin kumara Musa ni Haruna yɛ Isirayɛlika ni Misiran mansa Ferawuna la ko rɔ. A ka a fɔ ko ii ye Isirayɛlika labɔ Misiran.<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haruna ni Musa buruju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />Isirayɛlika denbaya la kuntiilu tɔɔ le ɲin di.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 6:14">Isirayɛli dencɛ fɔlɔ tɔɔ le ko Rubɛn. Rubɛn dencɛilu tɔɔ le ten: Hanɔki, Palu, Hɛsirɔn, a ni Karimi. Nba, Rubɛn bɔnsɔn de ɲin di.<verse eid="EXO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />Simeyɔn dencɛilu tɔɔ le ten: Jɛmuwɛli, Jamin, Owadi, Jakin, Sohari, a ni Sawuli. Sawuli na tɛrɛ ye Kanaanka le ri. Nba, Simeyɔn bɔnsɔn de ɲin di.<verse eid="EXO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Isirayɛli dencɛ Lebi ka san kɛmɛ ni san bisawa ni san wɔrɔnwula (137) le sɔrɔn. Wo dencɛilu tɔɔ le ko Kerisɔn ni Kohati ni Merari.<verse eid="EXO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />Kerisɔn dencɛilu tɛrɛ ye Libini ni Simeyi ri, wo bɛɛ ni a denbayala. <verse eid="EXO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />Kohati dencɛilu tɔɔ le ɲin di: Amuramu, Isehari, Heburɔn, a ni Usiyɛli. Kohati ka san kɛmɛ ni san bisawa a ni san sawa (133) le sɔrɔn.<verse eid="EXO 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />Merari dencɛilu tɛrɛ ye Mahali ni Musi ri. Nba, woilu bɛɛ tɛrɛ ye Lebi kabila mɔɔ le ri.<verse eid="EXO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" />Amuramu ka a tɛnɛnmuso Jokebɛdi furu. Wo ka dencɛ fila sɔrɔn a yɛ, mɛnilu ye Haruna ni Musa ri. Amuramu ka san kɛmɛ ni san bisawa ni san wɔrɔnwula (137) le sɔrɔn.<verse eid="EXO 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />Isehari dencɛilu tɛrɛ ye Kora ni Nɛfɛki ni Sikiri ri.<verse eid="EXO 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />Usiyɛli dencɛilu tɛrɛ ye Misayɛli ni Elisafan ni Sitiri ri.<verse eid="EXO 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Haruna ka Aminadabu denmuso Eliseba le furu, mɛn ye Nasɔn dɔɔmuso ri. Eliseba ka dencɛ naanin sɔrɔn Haruna yɛ. Woilu tɔɔ ko Nadabu ni Abihu ni Elasari a ni Itamari.<verse eid="EXO 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Kora dencɛilu tɛrɛ ye Asiri ni Elakana ni Abiyasafu ri. Kora la bɔnsɔn le ɲin di.<verse eid="EXO 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Haruna dencɛ Elasari ka Putiyɛli denmuso do furu. Wo ka dencɛ sɔrɔn a yɛ, mɛn tɔɔ ko Finehasi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 6:25">Nba, mɔɔ mɛnilu a ra madan ɲin, woilu ye Lebi kabila mɔɔ la denbayala kuntiilu le ri, a bɛɛ ni a la mɔɔilu.<verse eid="EXO 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" />Allabatala kumara Haruna ni Musa woilu le yɛ, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko ii ye Isirayɛlika labɔ Misiran ikomin tɛsidi dɛkuru. <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Musa ni Haruna le wara ka a fɔ Misiran mansa Ferawuna yɛ ko a ye Isirayɛlika bila sa ii ri bɔ a la jamana rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla ka baara mɛn di Musa ni Haruna ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28" />Nba, Allabatala kumara Musa yɛ Misiran tuma mɛn na, <verse eid="EXO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29" />a ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Nde le Allabatala ri. N kɛtɔ fen fen fɔla i yɛ, i ye wa wo fɔ Misiran mansa Ferawuna yɛ.»<verse eid="EXO 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Wo tuma, Musa ka Allabatala jabi: «Nde ma kusan kumala. Nfenna Ferawuna ri a tolo malɔ nde la wa?»<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />Allabatala ka Musa jabi: «N di ile kɛ Ferawuna ɲana ikomin Alla. I kɔrɔcɛ Haruna ri kɛ ikomin i la keladen fisamante. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />N wa fen fen fɔ i yɛ, i ye wo fɔ i kɔrɔcɛ Haruna yɛ. Ale ri wo lase Ferawuna ma. Haruna ri a fɔ a yɛ ko a ye Isirayɛlika bila sa ii ri bɔ a la jamana rɔ, <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3" />kɔni nde le a kɛla Ferawuna jusu ri a ragbɛlɛnya. N di n na tɔɔmasere ni kabannakoilu siyaya Misiran jamana rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4" />Hali wo, Ferawuna ti nala sɔnna ai la kuma ma. Wo rɔ, n di n wuli Misirankailu kanma ka n na sebaya ba yiraka ii la, ka ko latɔn ii la kojuuya. N di n na jama Isirayɛlika labɔ Misiran ikomin tɛsidi kuru. <verse eid="EXO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" />N wa n wuli Misirankailu kanma ka n na sebaya yiraka ii la, ka ban ka Isirayɛlika labɔ ii tɛma, Misirankailu ri a lɔn ko nde le ye Allabatala ri.»<verse eid="EXO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Musa ni Haruna ka Allabatala kan mira ka a kɛ ikomin a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" />Musa ni Haruna wara kuma Ferawuna yɛ tuma mɛn na, Musa sɔrɔn tun da san biseyin (80) bɔ. A kɔrɔcɛ Haruna sɔrɔn tun da san biseyin ni san sawa (83) bɔ.<verse eid="EXO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gbeleke yɛlɛmanda ka a kɛ sa ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />Nba, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa ni Haruna yɛ ko: <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" />«Ferawuna a wa a fɔ ai yɛ tuma mɛn na ko ai ye tɔɔmasere kabannako do kɛ, ile Musa, i ye a fɔ Haruna yɛ ko a ye a la gbeleke lafili duu ma Ferawuna ɲakɔrɔ. Gbeleke ri yɛlɛman ka kɛ sa ri.»<verse eid="EXO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Musa ni Haruna wara ii lɔ Ferawuna ɲakɔrɔ. Allabatala tun ka mɛn fɔ ii yɛ, ii ka wo kɛ. Haruna ka a la gbeleke lafili duu ma Ferawuna ni a la mɔɔilu ɲakɔrɔ. Gbeleke yɛlɛmanda ka kɛ sa ri ii ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" />Ferawuna ka Misiran ko lakɔrɔsilailu ni suwailu kili. Woilu fanan ka ko wo ɲɔɔn kɛ ii la daliluilu la. <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />Ii bɛɛ ka ii la gbelekeilu lafili duu ma. Woilu fanan yɛlɛmanda ka kɛ sailu ri, kɔni Haruna ta ka ii tailu lakunun. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Wo bɛɛ ni a ta, Ferawuna jusu a ragbɛlɛyanin de tɛrɛ fɔlɔ. A ma sɔn Musa ni Haruna la kuma ma ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ a yɛ ɲa mɛn ma fɔlɔ.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya fɔlɔ: Ji yɛlɛmanda ka kɛ jeli ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />Nba, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «Ferawuna jusu a ragbɛlɛyanin. A banni mɔɔilu bila ko ma. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Sini sɔɔma Ferawuna ri bɔ ka wa Nili Ba da la. I ye wa a tɛrɛn ye a wa tumana. Gbeleke mɛn yɛlɛmanda ka kɛ sa ri, i ye wo ta i bolo ka wa a ɲɔɔnbɛn ba da la ye. <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />I ye a fɔ a yɛ ko: ‹Allabatala mɛn ye Heburuilu Maari Alla ri, a ka n lawa i ma. Ko a ka a fɔ i yɛ ko: «N na mɔɔilu bila sa ii ri wa n bato kanma kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ.» Ko kɔni haan bi, i ma sɔn kuma wo ma fɔlɔ. <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17-18" />Ko Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «I ye i ɲa lɔ! Ko n di Nili Ba ji gbasi n na gbeleke la, gbeleke mɛn ye n bolo. Ko ba ri yɛlɛman ka kɛ jeli ri wo rɔ. Ko jɛɛ mɛnilu ye ba ji rɔ, ko woilu ri faa. Ko ba ri toli ka a suma bɔ. Ko Misirankailu ti nala sela Nili Ba ji minna. Ko ka a la wo kan, ko ale Ferawuna ri a lɔn ko nde le Allabatala ri.»›»<verse eid="EXO 7:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «I ye a fɔ Haruna yɛ ko a ye a la gbeleke ta ka a rasɔmɔn Misiran jiilu kun na, bailu wo, kɔilu wo, dalailu wo, a ni denka jimanilu wo. Ji wo bɛɛ ri yɛlɛman ka kɛ jeli ri. Ji ye yɔrɔ yɔrɔ rɔ, hali mɛn ye jiri fɛilu ni kaba daailu kɔndɔ, wo bɛɛ ri yɛlɛman ka kɛ jeli ri.»<verse eid="EXO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" />Allabatala ka mɛn fɔ Musa ni Haruna yɛ, ii ka wo mira ka a kɛ. A ka a la gbeleke kɔrɔta ka Nili Ba ji gbasi a la Ferawuna ni a la mɔɔilu ɲakɔrɔ. Ji wo bɛɛ yɛlɛmanda ka kɛ jeli ri. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Jɛɛilu faara. Ba tolira ka a suma bɔ. Wo rɔ, Misirankailu ma se ba ji minna. Ji yɛlɛmanda ka kɛ jeli ri Misiran yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Misiran senkolailu kɔnin wo fanan ka wo ɲɔɔn kɛ ii la daliluilu la. Wo rɔ, Ferawuna jusu a ragbɛlɛyanin tora ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ a yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. A ma sɔn Musa ni Haruna la kuma ma. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />A ka a kɔ don ii la ka a kɔsɛ a wara. Musa ni Haruna tun ka mɛn kɛ, a ma wo jate. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />Misirankailu bɛɛ ka denkailu sen Nili Ba dafɛ min ji ɲinin kanma, baa ii tun ti se ba ji minna.<verse eid="EXO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya filana: Todilu ka Misirankailu tɔrɔya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Nba, Allabatala ka Nili Ba ji yɛlɛman ka a kɛ jeli ri. Wo ka tele wɔrɔnwula le kɛ. Wo dafara. <verse eid="EXO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 7:26" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «Ai ye wa a fɔ Ferawuna yɛ ko: ‹Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «N na mɔɔilu bila sa ii ri wa n bato kanma. <verse eid="EXO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 7:27" />Ko ni i ma sɔn ka ii bila sa ii ri wa, ko n di todiilu lasiyaya ka i la jamana yɔrɔ bɛɛ lafa. Ko woilu ri kɛ tɔrɔya ba ri. <verse eid="EXO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 7:28" />Ko Nili Ba ji ri lafa todilu la. Ko ii ri bɔ ba ji rɔ ka wa i jɛrɛ la bon kɔndɔ, ka don i sibon kɔndɔ, ka yɛlɛ hali i la lafen kan, ka don i la jamana ɲɛmɔɔilu ni i la mɔɔilu bɛɛ la bonilu kɔndɔ. Ko todilu ri don hali buru gbasi diyailu rɔ, a ni buru gbasi muranilu kɔndɔ. <verse eid="EXO 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 7:29" />Ko todilu ri yɛlɛ ile ni i la jamana ɲɛmɔɔilu ni i la mɔɔilu bɛɛ kan.»›»<verse eid="EXO 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye a fɔ Haruna yɛ ko a ye a la gbeleke ta ka wo rasɔmɔn bailu ni kɔilu ni denka jiman yɔrɔilu kun na ka todilu lana Misiran jamana rɔ.» <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" />Wo rɔ, Haruna ka a la gbeleke rasɔmɔn Misiran jiilu kun na. Todilu bɔra ji rɔ wo rɔ, ka Misiran jamana yɔrɔ bɛɛ fa. <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />Ferawuna la senkolailu kɔnin fanan ka wo ɲɔɔn kɛ ii la daliluilu la. Ii fanan ka todilu lana Misiran jamana rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />Ferawuna ka Musa ni Haruna kili ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye Allabatala madiya ko a ye todi ɲinilu bɔ nde ni n na mɔɔilu kan. Ni wo kɛra, n di Isirayɛlika bila sa ii ri wa saraka bɔ Allabatala yɛ.» <verse eid="EXO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />Musa ka a fɔ Ferawuna yɛ ko: «N fa, bonya ye i bolo sisɛn ka a waati latɛɛ. I ye a fɛ n ye Allabatala madiya ile ni i la ɲɛmɔɔilu ni i la jamana kɔndɔ mɔɔilu yɛ waati ɲuman na, sa todilu ri mabɔ ai ni ai la bonilu la? N wa Allabatala madiya, todilu tɛ kɛ yɔrɔ si rɔ butun fɔɔ Nili Ba rɔ.» <verse eid="EXO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" />Ferawuna ka a fɔ ko: «I ye madiyali kɛ n yɛ sini.» Musa ka a fɔ ko: «I ka mɛn fɔ, a ri kɛ ten, sa i ri a lɔn ko an Maari Allabatala ɲɔɔn si tɛ. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Todilu ri mabɔ i ni i la bonilu la, a ni i la jamana ɲɛmɔɔilu ni i la mɔɔilu bɛɛ la. Todilu tɛ kɛ yɔrɔ si butun fɔɔ Nili Ba rɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />Musa ni Haruna bɔra Ferawuna wara ka wa. Musa ka Allabatala madiya kosɛbɛ todilu la ko rɔ, Allabatala tun ka mɛnilu lana Ferawuna tɔrɔya diya. <verse eid="EXO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Musa ka Allabatala madiya mɛn na, Allabatala ka wo kɛ. Todilu bɛɛ faara bonilu kɔndɔ, a ni bondailu kɔndɔ, a ni sɛnɛilu rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" />Misirankailu ka todi suilu ton nadɛn ii ɲɔɔn kan. Woilu tolira ka ii suma bɔ jamana yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Ferawuna ka a yen tuma mɛn na ko tɔrɔya wo ra bɔ a kan, a ka a jusu nagbɛlɛya ikɔ tuun kosɛbɛ, ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma. A tun tɛ sɔnna Musa ni Haruna la kuma ma.<verse eid="EXO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya Sawana: Wolowoloniilu ka Misirankailu tɔrɔya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" />Nba, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye a fɔ Haruna yɛ ko a ye a la gbeleke kɔrɔta ka duu buuri gbasi a la. Buuri ri yɛlɛman ka kɛ wolowoloniilu ri Misiran jamana fan bɛɛ rɔ.» <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />Musa ni Haruna ka Allabatala kan mira ka wo kɛ. Haruna ka a la gbeleke kɔrɔta ka duu buuri gbasi a la. Buuri yɛlɛmanda ka kɛ wolowoloniilu ri Misiran jamana fan bɛɛ rɔ. Wolowoloniilu tɛrɛ ye mɔɔilu ni niimafen bɛɛ kan. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />Ferawuna la senkolailu tɛrɛ ye a tɔrɔfɛ ii ka buuri yɛlɛman ka a kɛ wolowoloniilu ri ii la daliluilu la, kɔni ii ma se wo kɛla. Wolowoloniilu tora mɔɔilu ni niimafenilu tɔrɔla. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" />Ferawuna la senkolailu ka a fɔ Ferawuna yɛ ko: «Ko ɲin kɛni Alla le bolo de!» Ferawuna kɔnin a jusu a ragbɛlɛyanin de tɛrɛ. A ma sɔn Musa ni Haruna la kuma ma ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya Naaninna: Sitenilu ka Misirankailu tɔrɔya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />Nba, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye i wuli sɔɔma da la jonna ka wa Ferawuna kunbɛn. A wa kɛ wala ji da la tuma mɛn na, i ye wa a tɛrɛn ye. I ye a fɔ a yɛ ko: ‹Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «N na mɔɔilu bila sa ii ri wa n bato. <verse eid="EXO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Ko ni i ma sɔn n na mɔɔilu bila ko ma, n di siten siyaman siyaman ba lana, siten mɛnilu ye mɔɔilu cinna. Ko woilu ri wara i ni i la ɲɛmɔɔilu ni i la jamana mɔɔilu ma. Ko sitenilu ri don i jɛrɛ la bonilu la, ka Misirankailu la bonilu fanan fa. Ko sitenilu ri siyaya ka duu lafin. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" />Ko kɔni n wa sitenilu lana lon mɛn, n di Kosɛni jamana wo mara ka ii latanka woilu ma, n na mɔɔilu siini yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ kɔnin. Ko sitenilu ti se yɔrɔ wo rɔ muumɛ. Ko n di wo kɛ sa i ri a lɔn ko nde Allabatala ye Misiran jamana rɔ yan. <verse eid="EXO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" />Ko i la mɔɔilu ri tɔrɔya mɛn sɔrɔn sitenilu bolo, n di n na mɔɔilu latanka wo ma. Ko tɔɔmasere kabannako wo ri kɛ sini.»›»<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />Nba, Allabatala tun ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma, a ka a kɛ wo ɲa. Sitenilu siyaman siyaman ba nara don Ferawuna la bon na, a ni a la ɲɛmɔɔilu la bonilu la. Misiran jamana yɔrɔ bɛɛ tiɲanda sitenilu bolo. <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />Ferawuna ka Musa ni Haruna kili, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye wa saraka bɔ ai Maari Alla ma, kɔni ai ye to jamana kɔndɔ yan.»<verse eid="EXO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: «Wo ti se kɛla, baa an di saraka mɛnilu bɔ an Maari Allabatala yɛ, saraka woilu ye Misirankailu tana le ri. Fen mɛn ye ii tana do ri, ni an ka wo kɛ saraka di ii ɲana, ii ti an mabon kaba la wa? <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />An Maari Allabatala da an jamari ko an ye tele sawa kɛ taamanna ka wa kiɲɛ fufu rɔ. Ko a wa saraka mɛn fɔ an yɛ ye, ko an ye wo bɔ a yɛ ye.»<verse eid="EXO 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />Ferawuna ka a fɔ ko: «Awa, n di ai bila sa ai ri wa kiɲɛ fufu rɔ ka saraka bɔ ai Maari Allabatala yɛ, kɔni ai kana wa yɔrɔ jan de. Ai ye madiyali kɛ n yɛ.»<verse eid="EXO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: «N wa bɔ i wara yan, n di Allabatala madiya i kɔrɔ. Wo rɔ, sitenilu ri bɔ ile ni i la ɲɛmɔɔilu ni i la jamana mɔɔilu kan sini, kɔni i kana janfa kɛ ikɔ tuun, ka i ban Isirayɛlika bila ko ma sa ii ri wa saraka bɔ Allabatala yɛ.»<verse eid="EXO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Musa bɔra Ferawuna tɔrɔfɛ ka wa Allabatala madiya. <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />Allabatala ka a kɛ ikomin Musa ka a madiya ɲa mɛn ma. A ka sitenilu bɔ Ferawuna ni a la ɲɛmɔɔilu ni a la jamana mɔɔilu kan. Hali siten kelen ma to ye. <verse eid="EXO 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" />Ferawuna kɔnin a ka a jusu ragbɛlɛya ikɔ tuunni. A ma sɔn Isirayɛlika bila ko ma.<verse eid="EXO 8:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya Looluna: Misirankailu la kolofenilu faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />Wo tamin kɔ rɔ, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye wa a fɔ Ferawuna yɛ ko: ‹Heburuilu Maari Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «N na mɔɔilu bila sa ii ri wa n bato. <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" />Ko ni i ka i ban ii bila ko ma ka ii to i bolo, <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" />ko i la kolofen mɛnilu ye sɛnɛ rɔ, ko nde Allabatala ri i wuli woilu kanma n na sebaya la. Ko n di jankarɔ juu bila i la sooilu la, a ni i la faliilu, a ni i la ɲɔɔmɛilu, a ni i la nisiilu, a ni i la saailu ni baailu. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />Ko kɔni nde Allabatala n di dannafarabɔ kɛ Isirayɛlika la kolofenilu ni Misirankailu la kolofenilu tɛma. Isirayɛlika la kolofen si tɛ faa.»›»<verse eid="EXO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />Nba, Allabatala ri ko wo kɛ lon mɛn, a ra ban wo latɛɛla, baa a ka a fɔ ko: «Nde Allabatala n di ko wo kɛ jamana kɔndɔ sini.» <verse eid="EXO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" />Wo duu sa gbɛ, Allabatala ka a kɛ ikomin a tun ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma. Misirankailu la kolofenilu bɛɛ faara, kɔni foyi ma faa Isirayɛlika la kolofenilu rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Ferawuna ka mɔɔilu lawa ko wo lakɔrɔsi kanma. Woilu wara ko wo lakɔrɔsili diya ka na a fɔ a yɛ ko foyi ma faa Isirayɛlika la kolofenilu rɔ. Wo bɛɛ ni a ta kɔnin, Ferawuna jusu a ragbɛlɛyanin de tɛrɛ. A ma sɔn ka Isirayɛlika bila sa ii ri wa.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya Wɔɔrɔna: Sumunin bɔra mɔɔilu ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />Wo kɛ mɛn kɛra, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa ni Haruna yɛ ko: «Ai ye wa bolo ɲa dɔndɔ ta buurigbɛ rɔ fen janin diya. Musa ye wa buurigbɛ wo lasadi san ma Ferawuna ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" />Wo ri jɛnsɛn Misiran jamana fan bɛɛ rɔ ikomin gbangban, ka sumuni bɔ mɔɔilu ni kolofenilu ma. Sumuninilu ri kɛ dailu ri mɔɔilu ni kolofenilu fariilu ma Misiran jamana fan bɛɛ rɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" />Nba, Musa ni Haruna wara buurigbɛ do ta fen janin diya ka wa ii lɔ Ferawuna ɲakɔrɔ. Musa ka buurigbɛ wo lasadi san ma. Buurigbɛ wo ka sumuni bɔ mɔɔilu ni kolofenilu ma. Sumuniilu kɛra dailu ri woilu fari ma. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Ferawuna la senkolailu ma se nala ii lɔla Musa ɲakɔrɔ, baa sumuniilu tun da bɔ ii fari fan bɛɛ ma, ikomin Misiranka tɔilu bɛɛ. <verse eid="EXO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" />Allabatala le ka a kɛ Ferawuna jusu gbɛlɛnyani tɛrɛ. Ferawuna ma sɔn Musa ni Haruna la kuma ma ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya Wɔrɔnwulana: Allabatala ka sancikolo lajii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />Wo tamin kɔ rɔ, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye i wuli sɔɔma da la jonna ka wa Ferawuna tɛrɛn ye. I ye a fɔ a yɛ ko: ‹Allabatala, Heburuilu Maari Alla kɔnin, wo ka a fɔ ko: «N na mɔɔilu bila sa ii ri wa n bato. <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" />Ko sisɛn, ko n di tɔrɔya lase ile ma, tɔrɔya mɛn di juuya kosɛbɛ. Ko tɔrɔya wo ri se i la ɲɛmɔɔilu ni i la mɔɔilu fanan ma. Ko n di tɔrɔya wo lase ii bɛɛ ma sa ile ri a lɔn ko n ɲɔɔn si tɛ dunuɲa ɲin dɔ. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />Ko n tun di se ka n bolo lawuli i ni i la mɔɔilu kanma, ka jankarɔ fitinna ba la ii kan. Ko ni n tun ka a kɛ ten, sa ii ra ban latununna ka bɔ duɲa rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" />Ko kɔni n da i kɛndɛ to kosa n di n na sebaya yiraka i la. Ko ka a la wo kan, ko n da i kɛndɛ to sa n tɔɔ ri bonya dunuɲa fan bɛɛ rɔ fanan. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Ko kɔni jɛrɛdabaya ye i rɔ fɔlɔ, baa i bannin n na mɔɔilu bila ko ma. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Ko ale le wo ri. Ko ɲin tuma sini, ko n di sancikoloilu lajii. Ko sancikoloilu wo ri juuya fɔɔ ka a dan natamin. Ko wo ɲɔɔn ma jii Misiran kɛbi Misiran jamana siira. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />Ko wo rɔ, ko i ye i la mɔɔilu jamari sisɛn ko ii ye wa ii la kolofenilu ni ii bolofenilu bɛɛ ta ka wa woilu ri yɔrɔ lakandannin do rɔ, sa sancikolo kana se ii ma. Ko mɔɔ ni kolofen mɛnilu wa to gbɛ rɔ sɛnɛ rɔ, mɛnilu ma ladon yɔrɔ lakandannin do rɔ, sancikolo di jii woilu kan ka woilu kelen kelenna bɛɛ faa.»›»<verse eid="EXO 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Nba, Ferawuna la ɲɛmɔɔ mɛnilu silanda Allabatala la kuma yɛ, woilu borimantɔ wara ii la jɔnilu ni ii la kolofenilu ladon yɔrɔ lakandannin doilu rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />Mɛnilu kɔnin ma Allabatala la kuma jate, woilu ka ii la jɔnilu ni ii la kolofenilu to sɛnɛ rɔ ye.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye i bolo kɔrɔta san ma sa sancikolo a ri jii Misiran jamana bɛɛ kan. A ri jii mɔɔilu ni kolofenilu ni sɛnɛfenilu bɛɛ kan Misiran fan bɛɛ rɔ.» <verse eid="EXO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" />Awa, Musa ka a la gbeleke kɔrɔta san ma tuma mɛn na, Allabatala ka bandakan nabɔ ka sancikoloilu lajii, ka ta lajii fɔɔ duu ma. Allabatala ka sancikoloilu lajii Misiran jamana kan ikomin sanci ba. <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />Sancikoloilu tɛrɛ ye jiila. Ta tɛrɛ ye jiila yɔrɔ bɛɛ. Kɛbi Misiran jamana siira, sancikoloilu wo ɲɔɔn tun ma jii fɔlɔ, baa a juuyara kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Sancikoloilu ka mɔɔilu ni kolofenilu halaki Misiran jamana fan bɛɛ rɔ, mɔɔ ni kolofen mɛnilu tora gbɛ ma sɛnɛilu rɔ kɔnin. A ka sɛnɛfenilu bɛɛ tiɲan fanan, ka jiriilu bɛɛ kadi kadi. <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" />Wo kɛra fan bɛɛ rɔ fo Kosɛni mara kelen, Isirayɛlika siini yɔrɔ mɛn kɔnin. Sancikoloilu ma se ye le.<verse eid="EXO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />Ferawuna ka Musa ni Haruna kili ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N da kojuu kɛ siɲa ɲin dɔ. Jo ye Allabatala de bolo. Jo tɛ nde ni n na mɔɔilu le bolo. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" />Ai ye Allabatala madiya, baa Alla la bandakan ni a la sancikoloilu ii ra an bɔ. N di ai bila. N tɛ ai lalɔla butun.»<verse eid="EXO 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" />Musa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N wa bɔ so kɔndɔ tuma mɛn na, n di n boloilu kɔrɔta Allabatala yɛ. Bandakan ni sancikoloilu ri i lɔ, sa i ri a lɔn ko dunuɲa ye Allabatala ta le ri, <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" />kɔni n ka a lɔn ko ile ni i la ɲɛmɔɔilu ma silan Allabatala Alla yɛ fɔlɔ fewu!»<verse eid="EXO 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />Nba, gbaasa tun da fɛrɛn. Mɛn tɔɔ ko sɔɲɔ, wo tun da a kisɛ. Sancikoloilu ka wo fila bɛɛ tiɲan, <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />kɔni sɛnɛfen mɛn tɔɔ ko binbiriba, wo su fila ma tiɲan sancikolo bolo baa woilu tɛ fɛrɛnna jonna.<verse eid="EXO 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Nba, Musa bɔra Ferawuna wara ka wa so kɔkan. A ka a bolo lawuli Allabatala yɛ ka a madiya. Bandakan ni sancikolo tɛɛra. Sanci tɛɛra. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />Ferawuna ka a yen tuma mɛn na ko sanci ni sancikolo ni bandakan a ra lalɔ, a ka kojuu kɛ ikɔ tuunni, baa a ni a la ɲɛmɔɔilu ka ii jusu gbɛlɛnya. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Ferawuna jusu a ragbɛlɛyanin de tɛrɛ. A ma sɔn ka Isirayɛlikailu bila sa ii ri wa. Wo kɛra ikomin Allabatala a tun ka a fɔ ka fara Musa la.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya Seyinnan: Tɔɔnkasailu ka Misirankailu tɔrɔya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1" />Sancikolo ban kɔ jii la Misirankailu kan wo kɛ, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye wa Ferawuna tɛrɛn ye. Nde le ka a kɛ a ni a la ɲɛmɔɔilu jusu gbɛlɛnyani, sa n di se n na tɔɔmasere kabannako ɲinilu kɛla ii ɲana. <verse eid="EXO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2" />Ka a la wo kan, nde le ka wo kɛ sa ai ri a fɔ ai denilu ni ai mamarenilu yɛ n ka tɔɔmasere kabannako mɛnilu kɛ Misirankailu tɛma ka ii dɔɔya ɲa mɛn ma. Ai bɛɛ ri a lɔn ko Allabatala le nde ri.»<verse eid="EXO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" />Musa ni Haruna wara Ferawuna tɛrɛn ye, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Heburuilu Maari Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: ‹I ri sɔn ka i fanmajii nde yɛ lon ɲuman? Ko i ye n na mɔɔilu bila sa ii ri wa n bato. <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" />Ko ni i ka i ban n na mɔɔilu bila ko ma, ko n di tɔɔnkasailu lana i la jamana kɔndɔ sini. <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" />Ko woilu ri siyaya ka yɔrɔ bɛɛ mira fɔɔ ka duu fin. Ko wo rɔ, ko mɔɔilu ti nala sela ka duu yen butun. Ko sancikoloilu ma sɛnɛfen mɛnilu tiɲan, tɔɔnkasailu ri wo bɛɛ dɔɔn. Ko jiri jiri ye sɛnɛ rɔ, tɔɔnkasailu ri wa firailu bɛɛ dɔɔn. <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />Ko ii ri i la bonilu fa, ka i la ɲɛmɔɔilu ni Misirankailu bɛɛ la bonilu fa. Ko n di kɛ tɔɔnkasa siyaman ba ri, i failu ni i benbailu ma mɛn ɲɔɔn yen kɛbi ii ka ii sii jamana kɔndɔ yan.›» Musa banni wo fɔla, a bɔra Ferawuna wara ka wa.<verse eid="EXO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />Ferawuna la ɲɛmɔɔilu ka a fɔ Ferawuna yɛ ko: «An fa, cɛɛ wo ri an tɔrɔ haan waati ɲuman? I ti sɔn ka ii la mɔɔilu bila wa, sa ii ri wa ii Maari Allabatala bato? Misiran da tiɲan, i ma wo ɲayen fɔlɔ wa?» <verse eid="EXO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Wo rɔ, Ferawuna ka Musa ni Haruna kili ikɔ tuun, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye wa ai Maari Allabatala bato, kɔni yon ni yon watɔ?» <verse eid="EXO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" />Musa ka a jabi: «An bɛɛ ri wa, den mɛsɛnilu wo, mɔɔbakɔrɔilu wo, cɛɛilu wo, musoilu wo, an bɛɛ ri wa. An na kolofenilu bɛɛ ri wa an bolo fanan, baa an watɔ sali ba le kɛla Allabatala yɛ.» <verse eid="EXO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Ferawuna ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ka ai ni ai musoilu ni ai denilu bɛɛ bila sa ai ri wa, n ti sɔn wo ma habadan! Ai ye n janfa ko le rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Ɛɛn de! Cɛɛilu dɔrɔn ye wa Allabatala bato, baa ai ka wo le maɲininka.» Ferawuna ka Musa ni Haruna gbɛn wo rɔ, ka ii labɔ a wara.<verse eid="EXO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye i bolo kɔrɔta Misiran jamana kun na sa tɔɔnkasailu ri na jamana kɔndɔ. Ii ri na jamana kɔndɔ sɛnɛfen ni bin bɛɛ dɔɔn, mɛnilu tora ye sancikolo bolo kɔnin.» <verse eid="EXO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Musa ka a la gbeleke kɔrɔta Misiran jamana kun na. Allabatala ka fɔɲɔ ba do lana ka bɔ telebɔ fan fɛ. Fɔɲɔ ka tele ni su bɛɛ kɛ tɛɛla. Wo duu sa gbɛ da ka a tɛrɛn fɔɲɔ a ra tɔɔnkasailu lana. <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />Tɔɔnkasailu jɛnsɛnda ka Misiran yɔrɔ bɛɛ mira, ka i sii fan bɛɛ rɔ. Ii ka siya tɛrɛ kojuuya. Misirankailu tun ma wo ɲɔɔn yen fɔlɔ fewu. Ii ti nala wo ɲɔɔn yenna butun. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" />Tɔɔnkasailu ka duu bɛɛ mira fɔɔ ka a bɛɛ fin. Ii ka sɛnɛfenilu ni binilu bɛɛ dɔɔn, a ni jiridenilu bɛɛ. Sancikolo tun ma mɛnilu tiɲan, ii ka wo bɛɛ dɔɔn. Ii ma fira si to jiriilu la. Ii ma sɛnɛfen ni bin si to sɛnɛilu rɔ, mɛn ma dɔɔn. A kɛra wo ɲa le ma Misiran jamana yɔrɔ bɛɛ.<verse eid="EXO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />Ferawuna ka Musa ni Haruna kili i kɔrɔ, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Nde le ra kojuu kɛ ai Maari Allabatala la. N da kojuu kɛ ai fanan na. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" />Ai jaandi, ai ye yafa n ma mɛn fanan dɔ. Ai ye ai Maari Allabatala madiya n yɛ, sa a ri tɔrɔya juu ɲin mabɔ n na.» <verse eid="EXO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />Musa bɔra Ferawuna wara wo rɔ, ka wa Allabatala madiya. <verse eid="EXO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" />Wo rɔ, Allabatala ka fɔɲɔ ba lana ka bɔ telebe rɔ. Fɔɲɔ wo ka tɔɔnkasailu ta ka wa ii lafili Kɔɔji Fararɔbin dɔ. Tɔɔnkasa kelen ma to Misiran jamana kɔndɔ. <verse eid="EXO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" />Kɔni, Allabatala le ka Ferawuna jusu a ragbɛlɛya. A ma sɔn ka Isirayɛlikailu bila, sa ii ri wa.<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya Kɔnɔndɔna: Dibi donda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ikɔ tuunni ko: «I ye i bolo kɔrɔta san ma sa dibi ri don Misiran jamana kɔndɔ. Dibi wo ri bonya ka kɛ ikomin mɔɔ ri se a bolo maala a la.» <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Musa ka a bolo kɔrɔta san ma. Dibi fin juu donda Misiran jamana bɛɛ rɔ ka tele sawa kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />Tele sawa wo kɔrɔ, Misirankailu ma se ii ɲɔɔn yenna muumɛ. Ii si ma se bɔla bon na, kɔni Isirayɛlikailu siini tɛrɛ yɔrɔ yɔrɔ, kɛnɛya tɛrɛ ye yɔrɔ wo rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" />Ferawuna ka Musa kili ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Nba, ai ye wa Allabatala bato. Ai musoilu ni ai den mɛsɛnilu ri wa ai kɔfɛ, kɔni ai la kolofenilu ye to ai kɔma yan.» <verse eid="EXO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: «Wo tɛ bɛn. Fɔɔ i ye a to an na kolofenilu ye wa an bolo, baa an di wo doilu kɛ sarakailu a ni doilu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">saraka janintailu kɔrɔ ye ko a ri wo janin ka a kɛ buurigbɛ ri</char></note>saraka janintailu ri an Maari Allabatala yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />Fɔɔ an na kolofenilu ye wa an bolo. Hali an na kolofen kelen pe tɛ to an kɔma yan, baa an kɛtɔ doilu le kɛla saraka ri an Maari Allabatala yɛ, kɔni an di mɛn kɛ saraka ri a yɛ, an ti nala wo lɔnna fɔɔ an wa se ye tuma mɛn na.» <verse eid="EXO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Allabatala kɔnin ka a kɛ Ferawuna jusu a ragbɛlɛyanin de tɛrɛ. Ferawuna ma sɔn ka Isirayɛlika bila, sa ii ri wa. <verse eid="EXO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Ferawuna ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «Bɔ n ɲakɔrɔ! I kana i lɔ n ɲakɔrɔ butun. I wa na i lɔ n ɲakɔrɔ lon lon, i ri faa wo lon!» <verse eid="EXO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: «Ale le wo ri. N da wo mɛn. N tɛ i lɔ i ɲakɔrɔ butun.»<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔya tannan: Allabatala ka a fɔ ko dencɛ fɔlɔilu ri sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />Nba, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «A ra to tɔrɔya kelen ma, n di mɛn la Ferawuna ni Misirankailu bɛɛ kan. N wa wo la Ferawuna kan, a ri ai bila sa ai ri wa. Wo tuma a ri i gbɛn fewu. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" />I ye wa a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ ko ii bɛɛ ye ii siiɲɔɔ Misirankailu tara fen mɛnilu dannin sanin ni wodigbɛ la.» <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" />Allabatala ka Isirayɛlika la ko diya Misirankailu yɛ kosɛbɛ. Ferawuna la ɲɛmɔɔilu ni a la jamana kɔndɔ mɔɔilu bɛɛ tɛrɛ ye Musa bonyala kosɛbɛ fanan.<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: «Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: ‹Su tala waati, n di tamin Misiran jamana kɔndɔ. <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />Dencɛ fɔlɔilu bɛɛ ri sa Misiran jamana kɔndɔ. Ale mɛn ye mansayala, a dencɛ fɔlɔ ti nala tola ye. Hali jɔnmuso mɛn ye kɔlɔn tuu kɛla ye, wo fanan dencɛ fɔlɔ ti nala tola ye. Ii bɛɛ ri sa. Ii la kolofenilu fanan den fɔlɔ cɛmanta wo fanan ti nala tola. <verse eid="EXO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />Mɔɔilu ri ii kule kan nabɔ kojuuya Misiran jamana fan bɛɛ rɔ. Wo ɲɔɔn ma kɛ fɔlɔ. A ɲɔɔn ti nala kɛla butun. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" />Kɔni a mankan tɛ kɛ Isirayɛlikailu wara. Hali wulu tɛ wonwon ii ma, wala ii la kolofenilu ma. Ai ri a lɔn wo rɔ ko Allabatala a ra dannafarabɔ don Misirankailu ni Isirayɛlika tɛma.›» <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />Musa ka a fɔ Ferawuna yɛ ko: «Ko wo wa kɛ, i la ɲɛmɔɔilu ri na ka ii la n kɔrɔ ka n madiya ko n ye bɔ Misiran jamana rɔ yan, nde ni n na mɔɔilu bɛɛ. Wo wa kɛ, n di bɔ jamana ɲin dɔ yan.» Musa banni wo fɔla, a mɔnɛni ba le bɔra Ferawuna wara ka wa.<verse eid="EXO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «Ferawuna tɛ sɔn ai la kuma ma. Wo ri kɛ sababu ri sa n di doilu la n na kabannakoilu kan Misiran jamana kɔndɔ.» <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Musa ni Haruna ka kabannako woilu bɛɛ kɛ Ferawuna ɲakɔrɔ, kɔni Allabatala ka a kɛ Ferawuna jusu a ragbɛlɛyanin de tɛrɛ. A ma sɔn ka Isirayɛlikailu bila, sa ii ri bɔ a la jamana kɔndɔ.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />Nba, ka Musa ni Haruna to Misiran jamana kɔndɔ, Allabatala ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" />«Ai ye karo ɲin jate ai la karo fɔlɔ ri. A ri kɛ ai la san damira karo ri. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />Ai ye a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ yɛ ko: ‹Karo ɲin tele tan, cɛɛ bɛɛ ye saaden wala baden mira a la denbaya yɛ, denbaya kelen kolofen kelen, <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />kɔni ni denbaya mɛn mɔɔilu ma siya, ii ni ii siiɲɔɔilu ye dɛn kolofen kelen na, siiɲɔɔ mɛnilu sudunman ii la kɔnin. Ii ye kolofen do faa, mɛn di mɔɔilu bɛɛ bɔ. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" />Kolofen wo ye kɛ san kelen saaji wala bakɔrɔn di, fɛɛ tɛ mɛn na. <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />Ii ye kolofen wo lamara fɔɔ karo ɲin tele tan ni naanin. Wo lon, Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ ye ii ta faa fitiri waati. <verse eid="EXO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" />Ii kɛtɔ kolofenilu sobo dɔɔnna bon mɛnilu kɔndɔ, ii ye kolofenilu jeli do ta ka a susa bonda fodufɛla filaman ni ii da kankun kan. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" />Ii ye sobo wo janin ka a dɔɔn su wo jɛrɛ rɔ. Ii ye wo ni buru fununbali ni fira kunanin dɔɔn kelen di. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />Ai kana a kɛndɛ dɔɔn. Ai kana a tibi ji la ka a dɔɔn. Ai ye a gbunturun de janin, hali a kun, ni a gbɛlɛn, ni a kɔndafen bɛɛ. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" />Ai kana sobo a tɔ si lasii. Ni a tɔ tora sɔɔma, ai ye wo janin ka a kɛ buuri ri. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Ai ka kan ka sobo wo dɔɔn ɲa mɛn ma, wo le ɲin di: ai ye ai tɛ sidi taama kanma, ka ai la sanbara don. Ai ye ai la gbeleke mira ai bolo. Ai ye ai kaliya sobo wo dɔɔnna. Allabatala la Taminkunna Sali le wo ri.<verse eid="EXO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" />«‹Baa n di tamin Misiran jamana yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ su wo jɛrɛ rɔ ka Misiran jamana dencɛ fɔlɔilu ni kolofen den cɛmanta fɔlɔilu bɛɛ faa. N di jahadi la Misirankailu la batofenilu bɛɛ kan. Allabatala le nde ri. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" />Kɔni jeli mɛn susani bondailu la, wo ri kɛ tɔɔmasere ri ka a yiraka n na ko ai ye bon woilu le kɔndɔ. N wa jeli wo yen, n di tamin ai kun na. Wo rɔ, ka n to Misirankailu gbasila, kojuu si ti nala sela ai ma. <verse eid="EXO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />Lon ɲin ye kɛ ai bolo hankilijii lon ba ri kadawu. Ni wo lon sera san san, ai ye sali ba kɛ ka nde Allabatala bonya. Sali ko wo ye kɛ sariya banbali ri ai bolo, a ni ai bɔnsɔnilu bolo, mɛnilu natɔ ai kɔ.›»<verse eid="EXO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buru Fununbali Sali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" />Allabatala ka a fɔ ikɔ tuun ko: «Ai ye buru fununbali dɔɔn tele wɔrɔnwula kɔrɔ. Wo tele fɔlɔ, ai ye lɛbɛn bɛɛ labɔ ai la bonilu la. Ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ka buru lɛbɛnman dɔɔn tele wɔrɔnwula wo kɔrɔ, wo tii ri gbɛn ka bɔ Isirayɛlikailu rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />A tele fɔlɔ, ai ye ai ladɛn ka nde Allabatala bato. A tele wɔrɔnwulana fanan, ai ye ai ladɛn ka nde Allabatala bato. Ai kana baara si kɛ tele woilu rɔ. Ka tibili kɛ ai jɛrɛ yɛ, n ma a fɔ wo ma.<verse eid="EXO 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" />«Ai ye Buru Fununbali Sali wo kɛ san san, baa wo lon jɛrɛ le rɔ, n ka ai labɔ Misiran ikomin tɛsidi kuru. Wo le rɔ, ni wo lon sera san san, ai ye sali wo kɛ. Sali ko wo ye kɛ sariya banbali ri ai bolo, a ni ai bɔnsɔnilu bolo, mɛnilu natɔ ai kɔ. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />San karo fɔlɔ ɲin, ka bɔ tele tan ni naanin fitiri waati ka wa se tele muwan ni kelen (21) fitiri waati, ai kana buru lɛbɛnniman dɔɔn, fo buru fununbali. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" />Tele wɔrɔnwula woilu bɛɛ kɔrɔ, lɛbɛn si kana yen ai la bonilu la. Ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ka buru lɛbɛnman dɔɔn, wo tii ri gbɛn ka bɔ Isirayɛlikailu la dɛkuru rɔ. Ni a kɛra londan di, ni a kɛra duuren di, a ri gbɛn ka bɔ Isirayɛlikailu la dɛkuru rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />Ai kana buru si dɔɔn, lɛbɛn ye mɛn dɔ. Ai wa ai sii yɔrɔ yɔrɔ rɔ, ai ye buru fununbali dɔɔn.»<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa ka Taminkunna Sali ɲafɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />Musa ka Isirayɛlikailu la mɔɔbakɔrɔilu bɛɛ kili ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai bɛɛ ye wa sisɛn ka kolofen mɛsɛn mira ai la denbayailu yɛ ka a kannatɛɛ ka Taminkunna Sali kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />Ai ye kolofen wo jeli kɛ yagbawara do kɔndɔ. Jiri mɛn tɔɔ ko hisopi, ai ye wo bolon do sun jeli wo rɔ, ka jeli susa bonda lamininilu rɔ, a da kankun kan ni a bonda fodufɛla fila ma kɔnin. Mɔɔ si kana bɔ a la bon na fɔɔ sɔɔma. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" />Allabatala ri tamin Misiran jamana kɔndɔ ka Misirankailu dencɛ fɔlɔilu faa su rɔ. Ni a ka jeli yen a da kankun kan ni a da lɔ jirila fila ma, a ri tamin bon wo kun na. A ti nala sɔnna niitɛɛ mɛlɛka ye don ai la bon woilu la ka ai dencɛ fɔlɔilu faa.<verse eid="EXO 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />«Ai ni ai bɔnsɔnilu ye to sali ɲin kɛla san san haan kadawu. A ye sariya banbali le ri. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />Allabatala ka lahidi ta ko a ri jamana mɛn di ai ma, ai wa se ye tuma mɛn na, ai ye sali ɲin kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" />Ni ai denilu ka sali ɲin kɔrɔ maɲininka ai la, <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />ai ye a fɔ ii yɛ ko: ‹An ye kolofen wo kɛla Taminkunna Sali saraka de ri ka Allabatala bonya. Ko ka an to Misiran, Allabatala nara ka Misirankailu dencɛ fɔlɔilu faa. Ko wo tuma, a taminda an na bonilu kun na ka an na denbayailu to ye.›» Nba, Musa banni wo bɛɛ fɔla, Isirayɛlikailu ka ii ɲakɔrɔ bɛn duu ma ka Allabatala bato. <verse eid="EXO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Wo kɔ rɔ, ii bɔra ye ka wa a kɛ ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ Musa ni Haruna yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dencɛ fɔlɔilu faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />Nba, duu talaman, Allabatala ka dencɛ fɔlɔilu bɛɛ faa Misiran jamana rɔ. Ka a damira Ferawuna jɛrɛ dencɛ fɔlɔ ma ka wa se fɔɔ kasodenilu dencɛ fɔlɔ ma, dencɛ fɔlɔ bɛɛ faara. Kolofenilu den fɔlɔ cɛmanilu bɛɛ faara fanan. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" />Ferawuna ni a la baaradenilu ni Misiran jamana mɔɔ bɛɛ kununda su wo rɔ. Mɔɔilu kule kan bɔra kojuuya Misiran yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ, baa bon si ma to saya ma kɛ yɔrɔ mɛn na.<verse eid="EXO 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayɛlikailu bɔra Misiran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Su kelen wo rɔ, Ferawuna ka Musa ni Haruna kili ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye ai wuli ka bɔ n na mɔɔilu tɛma, ai ni Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ. Ai ye wa Allabatala bato ikomin ai ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Ai ye ai la kolofenilu bɛɛ fanan ta ikomin ai ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma. Ai ye wo bɛɛ ta ka wa! Ai ye duwawu kɛ n yɛ fanan.»<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />Misirankailu gbɛdɛnda Isirayɛlikailu la ko ii ye bɔ Misiran jamana rɔ jonna, baa Misirankailu ka a fɔ ko: «Ni ii ma bɔ yan, an bɛɛ ri faa.» <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Wo rɔ, Isirayɛlikailu ka buru janinbaliilu ta ka wo la buru gbasi muranilu rɔ, kɔni ii ma lɛbɛn si kɛ buru wo rɔ. Ii ka muran woilu lasidi faanin dɔ ka woilu sii ii kanbankun kan. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />Isirayɛlikailu ka Misirankailu tara fen mɛnilu dannin sanin ni wodigbɛ la a ni faaninilu la ikomin Musa tun ka a fɔ ii yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" />Allabatala ka Isirayɛlikailu la ko diya Misirankailu yɛ. Wo rɔ, Isirayɛlikailu ka fen fen tara Misirankailu la, woilu dira ii ma. Isirayɛlikailu ka Misirankailu bolokolonya ten de fewu!<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />Isirayɛlikailu bɔra Ramɛsisi so kɔndɔ ka wa Sukɔti so kɔndɔ. Mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye ii sen ma, woilu tun di mɔɔ waa kɛmɛ wɔɔrɔ (600,000) ɲɔɔn bɔ. Musoilu ni den mɛsɛnilu ma dan. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Ii wara ii la kolofenilu ri ii bolo, saailu ni bailu ni nisiilu kɔnin. Woilu ka siya tɛrɛ. Siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔ siyaman wara ii fɛ fanan. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" />Isirayɛlikailu seni yɔrɔ do rɔ, ii tun bɔra Misiran buru janinbali mɛnilu ri, ii ka woilu wusu ka a kɛ buru fununbali ri ka a dɔɔn. Lɛbɛn tun tɛ buru woilu rɔ, ka a masɔrɔn Misirankailu tun ka Isirayɛlikailu labɔ Misiran jonna. Wo le ka a kɛ, ii tun ma fɛrɛ sɔrɔn ka lɛbɛn kɛ buru wo rɔ, wala ka dɔɔnnifenilu rabɛn ii la taama kanma.<verse eid="EXO 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />Nba, Isirayɛlikailu tun ka san kɛmɛ naanin ni san bisawa (430) le kɛ Misiran jamana rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />San kɛmɛ naanin ni san bisawa (430) wo dafara lon mɛn na, wo lon kelen Allabatala a la mɔɔilu bɔra Misiran ikomin tɛsidi kuru. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />Allabatala ka a janto ii rɔ su wo rɔ, ka ii labɔ Misiran jamana rɔ. Wo rɔ, san san haan kadawu, Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ ye si ɲana su wo rɔ baa su wo bilanin a dan na Allabatala yɛ.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taminkunna Sali dɔɔnnin sariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa ni Haruna yɛ ko: «Taminkunna Sali dɔɔnnin sariya le ɲin di. Londan si kana wo saraka dɔɔn. <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />Ai ye jɔn mɛnilu sanna, woilu ri se a dɔɔnna ni ai ka ii faaninta kɛ fɔlɔ, <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" />kɔni londan taminbatɔilu ni baaraden mɛnilu ye sarala, woilu si kana a dɔɔn.<verse eid="EXO 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" />«Ai wa saraka sobo wo rabɛn bon mɛn na, ai ye a dɔɔn bon wo kɔndɔ. Mɔɔ si kana bɔ sobo ri kɛnɛma. Ai wa sobo wo dɔɔn, ai kana a kolo si kadi. <verse eid="EXO 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ ye Taminkunna Sali wo kɛla. <verse eid="EXO 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />Ni londan do siini ai tɛma, mɛn ye a fɛ ka Taminkunna Sali kɛ ka Allabatala bonya, fo wo tii ni a wara cɛɛilu bɛɛ ye faaninta kɛ fɔlɔ. Ni wo kɛra, a ri se Taminkunna Sali kɛla ikomin Isirayɛlikailu. Cɛɛ mɛn ma faaninta kɛ, wo si kana Taminkunna Sali saraka dɔɔn. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" />Sariya kelen wo le ye Isirayɛlikailu ni londanilu bɛɛ kan.»<verse eid="EXO 12:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />Awa, Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ ka a kɛ ikomin Allabatala ka Musa ni Haruna jamari ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" />Wo lon kelen, Allabatala ka Isirayɛlikailu labɔ Misiran ikomin tɛsidi kuru.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s">Den fɔlɔilu ye Alla ta le ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" />«Den fɔlɔ mɛnilu ye ai bolo, ai ye woilu bɛɛ di n ma ka ii kɛ n ta ri. Ni a kɛra muso muso dencɛ fɔlɔ ri, ni a kɛra kolofen kolofen den cɛmanta fɔlɔ ri, woilu bɛɛ ye kɛ n ta ri.»<verse eid="EXO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buru Fununbali Sali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Nba, Musa ka a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ ko: «Ai ye ai hankili to lon ɲin dɔ, ai bɔra Misiran jɔnya rɔ lon mɛn dɔ, baa Allabatala ka ai labɔ yɔrɔ wo rɔ a la sebaya ba la. Wo le kosɔn, ai kana buru lɛbɛnman dɔɔn wo lon. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" />Ai bɔni bi le Abibu karo la. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" />Allabatala ka a kali ai benbailu yɛ ale jɛrɛ tɔɔ la ko a ri jamana do di ii ma, dɔɔnninta duman ye bɔla jamana wo rɔ a ɲa jɛrɛ jɛrɛ ma, li ni nɔnɔ a bɛɛ ye bɔla ye. Kanaankailu siini jamana wo kɔndɔ, a ni Hɛti bɔnsɔnilu ni Amɔrikailu ni Hifikailu ni Jebusikailu. Allabatala wa ai ladon ye tuma mɛn na, karo ɲin ɲɔɔn wa se san san ai ye sali ɲin kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />Ai ye buru fununbali dɔɔn tele wɔrɔnwula kɔrɔ. A tele wɔrɔnwulana lon, ai ye sali kɛ ka Allabatala bonya. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Ai ye buru fununbali dɔɔn tele wɔrɔnwula kɔrɔ. Buru lɛbɛnman a kana kɛ ai bolo. Lɛbɛn kana kɛ ai la jamana yɔrɔ si fanan dɔ. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Ai ye a ɲafɔ ai dencɛilu yɛ wo lon ko: ‹Allabatala ka ko ba kɛ n yɛ n bɔtɔla Misiran. Wo le ka a kɛ, n ye sali ɲin kɛla.› <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" />A ri kɛ i la tɔɔmasere ri ikomin bololafen mɛn bilanin i bolo la wala mɛn sidinin i tin na ka kɛ hankili bila fen di, ka ban ka Allabatala a la sariya kuma a ye to i da rɔ waati bɛɛ, ka a masɔrɔn Allabatala ka i labɔ Misiran a la sebaya bolo la. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />Wo le rɔ, ai ye tola sali ɲin kɛla a waati wo la san san.»<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dencɛ fɔlɔilu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />Musa ka a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «Allabatala ka a kali ai benbailu yɛ ko a ri ai ladon Kanaan na duu kɔndɔ. A wa jamana wo kɛ ai ta ri tuma mɛn na, <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />ai ye ai dencɛ fɔlɔilu bɛɛ di Allabatala ma ka ii kɛ a ta ri. Ai la kolofenilu den cɛmanta fɔlɔilu bɛɛ ri kɛ Allabatala ta ri fanan. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Ni fali den de, ai ye saaden wala baden saraka wo nɔ rɔ ka fali den kunka. Ni ai tɛ a fɛ ka fali den wo kunka, ai ye wo kan kadi ka a faa. A fɛrɛ tɛ fo ai ye ai dencɛ fɔlɔilu bɛɛ kunka.<verse eid="EXO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />«Ai dencɛilu ri ai maɲininka lon do rɔ ko ai ye ko mɛn kɛla ɲin, ko wo kɛ kun a ye nfen di? Ii wa ai maɲininka wo ma, ai ye a fɔ ii yɛ ko: ‹Allabatala ka an nabɔ jɔnya rɔ Misiran jamana rɔ a la sebaya bolo la. <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />Ko Ferawuna jusu a ragbɛlɛnyanin de tɛrɛ. Ko a ma sɔn ka an bila. Ko wo rɔ Allabatala ka Misirankailu dencɛ fɔlɔilu bɛɛ faa, ka Misirankailu la kolofenilu den cɛmanta fɔlɔilu bɛɛ fanan faa. Ko wo le rɔ, n ye kolofenilu den cɛmanta fɔlɔilu bɛɛ kɛla sarakafenilu ri Allabatala yɛ, ka n jɛrɛ dencɛ fɔlɔilu bɛɛ kunka.›» <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />Musa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «Sali ɲin ye tɔɔmasere le ri, ikomin mɔɔ ye mɛn bilala a bolo la a ni a tin na sa a kana ɲina. Sali ɲin sababu la, an tɛ ɲinala ko Allabatala ka an nabɔ Misiran jamana rɔ a la sebaya bolo la.»<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayɛlikailu bɔra Sukɔti ka wa Etan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />Nba, Ferawuna ka Isirayɛlikailu bila sa ii ri wa tuma mɛn na, Alla ma ii lawa Filisitiilu la jamana sila kan. Sila wo sudunman, kɔni Alla ka a yen ko ni ii wara sila wo kan ka ye mɔɔilu wulitɔla yen ii kanma, ii ri silan ka ii hankili yɛlɛman ka ii kɔsɛ Misiran. <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Wo rɔ, Alla ka ii lawa kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ la sila le kan, mɛn ye taminna ka wa Kɔɔji Fararɔbin fan fɛ. Isirayɛlikailu bɔra Misiran tuma mɛn na, ii rabɛnni tɛrɛ kɛlɛkɛ kanma.<verse eid="EXO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" />Ii bɔtɔla, Musa wara Yusufu a kolo ri a bolo, baa sani Yusufu ye sa, a ka a fɔ a badenmailu yɛ ko sika tɛ a rɔ Alla ri na ii dɛmɛn. Ko a badenmailu ye ii kali a yɛ ko Alla wa ii labɔ Misiran jamana rɔ tuma mɛn na, ii ye a kolo ta ka wa woilu ri ii bolo.<verse eid="EXO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Nba, Isirayɛlikailu bɔra Sukɔti ka wa ii daa makɛ kiɲɛ fufu tɔrɔfɛ, yɔrɔ mɛn tɔɔ ko Etan. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" />Allabatala tɛrɛ ye wala ii ɲɛfɛ tuma bɛɛ. Tele rɔ, Allabatala bilara ii ɲɛfɛ duru munuɲa rɔ ka sila yiraka ii la. Su rɔ, Allabatala tamɛlɛnnama a ri bila ii ɲɛfɛ ka mɛlɛn bɔ ii ɲɛfɛ. Wo rɔ, ii sera taamanna su ni tele. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />Tele tele, duru munuɲa tɛrɛ ye mɔɔilu ɲɛfɛ tuma bɛɛ. Su su, a tamɛlɛnnama tɛrɛ ye mɔɔilu ɲɛfɛ tuma bɛɛ.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="s">Isirayɛlikailu taminda Kɔɔji Fararɔbin a rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />«I ye a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ ko ii ye ii kɔsɛ ka wa ii daa makɛ Pihahirɔti so dala, Mikidɔli so ni kɔɔji tɛma. Ii ye wa ii daa makɛ ye le, ka ii ɲabɛn Bahali-Sɛfɔn so la kɔɔji dala. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" />Ni ii ka wo kɛ, Ferawuna ri a fɔ ko: ‹Ii ra kɔndafili kiɲɛ fufukɔndɔ, wa diya tɛ ii la wo kɔ.› <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" />N di a kɛ Ferawuna jusu ri a ragbɛlɛya. A ri wuli wo rɔ ka ii kɔsaran, kɔni n di se Ferawuna ni a la tɛsidiilu la. Mɔɔilu ri n tando wo rɔ. N wa se woilu la, Misirankailu ri a lɔn ko nde le Allabatala ri.» Isirayɛlikailu ka a kɛ ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ ii yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Awa, a fɔra Misiran mansa yɛ tuma mɛn na ko Isirayɛlikailu ra wa, a ni a la ɲɛmɔɔilu miriya yɛlɛmanda. Ii ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «An da nfen de kɛ ɲin di? Nfenna an sɔnda ii ye wa? Ii tɛ an bolo jɔnya la butun wo rɔ.» <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Ferawuna ka a la sowontoroilu ni a la tɛsidiilu rabɛn Isirayɛlikailu kɔsaran kanma. <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" />A ka sowontoro ɲuma kɛmɛ wɔɔrɔ (600) ta ka woilu la Misiran sowontoro tɔilu bɛɛ kan. A ka tɛsidi kuntii lasii sowontoroilu kelen kelenna bɛɛ kɔndɔ. <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" />Allabatala ka a kɛ Ferawuna jusu a ragbɛlɛyanin de tɛrɛ. Wo rɔ, a ka Isirayɛlikailu kɔsaran. Wo tuma, ii ye bɔla Misiran jusulatɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" />Misirankailu la sowontoroilu ni soo laborilailu ni tɛsidiilu bɛɛ wara Isirayɛlikailu kɔ, ka woilu kɔsaran fɔɔ ka wa sudunya ii daa makɛ diya rɔ i kɔrɔ kɔɔji dala. Yɔrɔ wo ye Pihahirɔti so tɔrɔfɛ, ka ɲabɛn Bahali-Sɛfɔn so ma.<verse eid="EXO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />Isirayɛlikailu ka ii ɲa lɔ ka Ferawuna ni a la tɛsidiilu natɔla yen ii kanma. Woilu tun da sudunya ii la i kɔrɔ! Wo rɔ, Isirayɛlikailu silanda kojuuya ka ii makasi Allabatala yɛ ko a ye ii dɛmɛn. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" />Ii ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «An su don yɔrɔ le tun tɛ sɔrɔnna Misiran wa? I nani an di an faa diya le kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ yan wo rɔ wa? Ni wo tɛ, i ka an nabɔ Misiran nfenna? <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Ka an to Misiran, an ma a fɔ i yɛ ba ko ni an bɔra ye, ko su ɲin di an sɔrɔn? An ka a fɔ i yɛ ko i ye an to ten, ko an di to Misiran ye ka kɛ Misirankailu la jɔnilu ri, baa jɔnya wo ka fisa an na saya ri kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ yan.»<verse eid="EXO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" />Musa ka ii jabi: «Ai kana silan. Ai ye makɔnɔni kɛ ikɔ tuun! Allabatala ri ai kisi ɲa mɛn ma bi, ai ri wo yen. Ai ɲa ye Misiranka mɛnilu la ɲin, ai tɛ woilu yen butun fewu. <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" />Allabatala ri woilu kɛlɛ ai nɔ rɔ. Ai ye i sabari ka wo ragbɛ ikɔ tuun.»<verse eid="EXO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />Awa, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye i makasila n yɛ nfenna, ko n ye ai dɛmɛn? I ye a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ ko ii ye i wuli ka wa. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />I ye i la gbeleke kɔrɔta kɔɔji kun na ka kɔɔji fara i ɲɔɔnna, sa Isirayɛlikailu ri tamin duu jaran ma kɔɔji nɔ rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" />Nde ri a kɛ Misirankailu jusu ri a ragbɛlɛya. Wo rɔ, ii ri don ai kɔ. Wo wa kɛ, n di se Ferawuna ni a la tɛsidiilu ni a la sowontoroilu ni a la soo laborilailu bɛɛ la. Mɔɔilu ri n tando wo rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />N wa se Ferawuna ni a la sowontoroilu ni a la soo laborilailu bɛɛ la, ka n na gbiliya yiraka, Misirankailu a ri a lɔn ko nde le Allabatala ri.»<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Alla la mɛlɛka mɛn ye wala Isirayɛlikailu ɲɛfɛ, wo taminda ii kɔfɛ. Duru nunuɲa fanan bɔra ii ɲɛfɛ ka tamin ii kɔfɛ. <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />Wo bilara Misirankailu ni Isirayɛlikailu tɛma. Su wo bɛɛ rɔ, dibi donda Misirankailu wara fan fɛ, kɔni kɛnɛ bɔra Isirayɛlikailu wara fan fɛ. Wo rɔ, Misirankailu ni Isirayɛlikailu ma ii madon i ɲɔɔn na su wo rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />Musa ka a bolo kɔrɔta kɔɔji kun na. Allabatala ka fɔɲɔ ba lana ka bɔ telebɔ fan fɛ. Wo tɛɛra su muumɛ rɔ. Fɔɲɔ wo ka kɔɔji ta fɔɔ ka a tɛɛfara fila ri ka duu jaran bɔ a tɛma. <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" />Isirayɛlikailu taminda ji tɛɛfaranin wo tɛma duu jaran kan. Ji layɛlɛnin tɛrɛ i ɲɔɔn kan ka kɛ ikomin jin ii bolokinin fan fɛ ni ii bolomaran fan fɛ.<verse eid="EXO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Misirankailu ka ii kɔsaran. Ferawuna a la soo laborilailu ni a la sowontoroilu bɛɛ donda kɔɔji tɛfaranin tɛma ka wa Isirayɛlikailu kɔ. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Suba ma, Allabatala tora tamɛlɛnnama ni duru munuɲa rɔ ka a ɲa lɔ Misiran tɛsidiilu rɔ. Ale ka a kɛ Misiran tɛsidiilu kɔndafilira piripara fɔɔ ka ii silan! <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />A ka ii la sowontoroilu sen bɔla. Ii wa ko gbɛlɛnyara wo rɔ. Misirankailu ka wo yen tuma mɛn na, ii ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «Allabatala ye an kɛlɛla Isirayɛlikailu yɛ. An ye an bori ka an bɔ yan, an ye ii to ye.»<verse eid="EXO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye i bolo kɔrɔta kɔɔji kun na, sa ji ri kadi ka jii Misirankailu ni ii la sowontoroilu ni ii la soo laborilailu kan.» <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" />Musa ka a bolo kɔrɔta kɔɔji kun na. Bandakada le tɛrɛ, kɔɔji ka a kɔsɛ a nɔ rɔ. Misirankailu tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka ii bori ji ɲɔ rɔ, kɔni Allabatala ka a kadi ii kan. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" />Kɔɔji ka a kɔsɛ a nɔ rɔ ka sowontoroilu ni soo laborilailu bɛɛ mira, Ferawuna a la tɛsidiilu bɛɛ kɔnin. Mɛnilu bɛɛ donda kɔɔji rɔ Isirayɛlikailu kɔ, woilu bɛɛ tora ji rɔ. Hali mɔɔ kelen pe ma bɔ a rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" />Isirayɛlikailu kɔnin tun ka ii taama duu jaran kan ka tamin kɔɔji tɛɛfaranin tɛma. Ji tun nayɛlɛra i ɲɔɔn kan ka kɛ ikomin jin de ii bolokinin fan fɛ a ni ii bolomaran fan fɛ. <verse eid="EXO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" />Nba, Allabatala ka Isirayɛlikailu kisi Misirankailu ma wo lon. Isirayɛlikailu ka Misirankailu fureilu lani yen kɔɔji da la ye. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" />Allabatala ka fanka ba mɛn be Misirankailu kan, Isirayɛlikailu ka wo yen ii ɲa la. Wo rɔ, ii silanda Allabatala yɛ. Ii lara ale la, ka la a la jɔncɛ Musa fanan na.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s">Musa ni Isirayɛlikailu ka Alla tando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Nba, Musa ni Isirayɛlikailu ka kalaman bɔ kɛ Allabatala yɛ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">«An di kalaman bɔ kɛ Allabatala yɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">baa a ra se a juuilu la fewu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">A ra sooilu ni tɛsidiilu bɛɛ lafili kɔɔji rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />Allabatala ye fanka dila n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">N ye kalaman ɲin bɔla ale le kosɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">Ale le ra n kisi n juuilu ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">N Maari Alla le; n di a bato.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">N fa Maari Alla le; n di a bonya.<verse eid="EXO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />Allabatala ye ikomin kɛlɛkɛla fadiman.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:3">A tɔɔ le ko Allabatala.<verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />Ale ra Ferawuna a la tɛsidiilu ni wo la sowontoroilu lafili kɔɔji rɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:4">Hali Ferawuna a la tɛsidi jalabatii fisamantɛilu tora Kɔɔji Fararɔbin wo rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Ji dunba wo ka woilu latunun fewu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:5">Ii jiira ji kɔrɔ ikomin kabakudun.<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />Ee Allabatala, fanka jɛrɛ jɛrɛ ye i bolo la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:6">I ra i juuilu mɔɲɔnkɔ fewu i bolo la!<verse eid="EXO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />I ra se i juuilu la ka ii halaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:7">ka bonya ba sɔrɔn wo rɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:7">I mɔnɛra ka ii halaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:7">ikomin ta ye bin jaran janinna ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />I ka fɔɲɔ labɔ i nun dɔ fanka la tuma mɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">jiilu ka ii ladɛn i ɲɔɔn kan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">Ji mɛn tun ye woyenna, wo ka i lɔ ka kɛ ikomin jin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">Ji dunba wo ka i lɔ kɔɔji tɛma ka a raja.<verse eid="EXO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />An juuilu ka a fɔ ko: ‹n di ii kɔsaran fɔɔ ka ii mira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">Ko n di ii bolofenilu rafara an ɲɔɔn tɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">Ko fen fen lɔɔ ye n na, ko n di wo bɛɛ ta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">Ko n ni n na fanmuruilu sɔmɔn n laa wo rɔ ka ii halaki.›<verse eid="EXO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Kɔni Allabatala, i ka i dafɔɲɔ fɛ kɔɔji kan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:10">Ji ka ii bɛɛ latunun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:10">Ii jiira ji fankama wo kɔrɔ ikomin nɛɛfinboo.<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />Ee batofen gbɛrɛ ɲuman di kɛ ikomin Allabatala, mɛn ye i ɲɔɔn di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Ɛɛn de, i ɲɔɔn tɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Yon sɛniman wa ikomin ile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Nɔɔrɔ ye yon na ikomin ile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Yon ye kabannakoilu kɛla ikomin ile?<verse eid="EXO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />I ka i bolo rasɔmɔn dɔrɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:12">dunuɲa ka an juuilu lakunun.<verse eid="EXO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />I ra i la mɔɔilu kunka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:13">I ri i lɔ an ɲɔrɔ i la kaninteya la a ni i la sebaya la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:13">ka wa i sii diya sɛniman dɔ.<verse eid="EXO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14" />Siya tɔilu ka wo kibaro mɛn tuma mɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:14">ii silanda fɔɔ ka yɛrɛyɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:14">Silan ba wo ka Filisitiilu mira.<verse eid="EXO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15" />Edɔmukailu la kuntiilu silanda kojuuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:15">Mowabukailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu yɛrɛyɛrɛra silan bolo ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:15">Kanaankailu jiitɛɛra fewu.<verse eid="EXO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />Ii silanda kojuuya fɔɔ ka yɛrɛyɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">Allabatala, ii ka i la sebaya yen tuma mɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">ii tora ii nɔ rɔ ikomin farakolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">Ii ma se foyi kɛla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">fɔɔ i la mɔɔilu banda taminna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">i ka mɔɔ mɛnilu kunka jɔnya rɔ kɔnin.<verse eid="EXO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />Allabatala, i ye i la mɔɔilu ladonna i la jamana kɔndɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">ka i lasii i la koyinkɛ lahidi kan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">i ka mɛn suwandi ka a kɛ i jɛrɛ sii diya ri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">i, Allabatala, i ka bon mɛn lɔ i jɛrɛ bato kanma.<verse eid="EXO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />Allabatala ri a la mansaya kɛ kadawu.<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />Baa, Ferawuna la sooilu ni sowontoroilu ni a la tɛsidiilu bɛɛ donda kɔɔji tɛɛfaranin tɛma tuma mɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:19">Allabatala ka kɔɔji kadi ka a jii ii kan ka ii bɛɛ latunun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:19">Kɔni Isirayɛlikailu ka ii taama duu jaran kan ka tamin kɔɔji tɛɛfaranin tɛma.»<verse eid="EXO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" />Keladen fisamante Miriyamu, Haruna kɔrɔmuso, wo ka sɛsɛ do ta a bolo. Isirayɛli muso tɔilu bɛɛ fanan ka doilu ta ka ii bila Miriyamu kɔ, ka sɛsɛilu fɔ ka don kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />Miriyamu ka kalaman bɔ kɛ ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 15:21" />
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">«Ai ye kalaman bɔ kɛ Allabatala yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">baa a ra se a juuilu la fewu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">A ra sooilu ni soo laborilailu bɛɛ lafili kɔɔji rɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Ji Kunanin ko rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Nba, Musa ka Isirayɛlikailu ta ka bɔ Kɔɔji Fararɔbin dɔ. A lɔra ii ɲɔrɔ ka wa se Suri wula kɔndɔ. Ii ka tele sawa taama kɛ kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ, ii ma ji tɛrɛn ye. <verse eid="EXO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" />Ii sera yɔrɔ do rɔ, mɛn tɔɔ ko Mara, kɔni ii ma se wo ji minna, baa a kunanin tɛrɛ. Wo le kosɔn, yɔrɔ wo tɔɔ lara ko Mara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mara wo kɔrɔ ye Heburu kan dɔ ko kunanin </char></note>. <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Isirayɛlikailu wulira ka ii makasi Musa kan. Ii ka a fɔ ko: «An di nfen minna yan?»<verse eid="EXO 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" />Musa ka a makasi Allabatala yɛ, ko a ye a dɛmɛn. Allabatala ka jiri do yiraka a la. Musa ka jiri kunkundun wo ta ka a bila ji rɔ. Ji diyara kosɛbɛ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 15:25">Ka ii to ye, Alla ka sariyailu di ii ma, ii ka kan ka taama ka bɛn mɛnilu ma. A ka ii kɔrɔbɔ ye fanan. <verse eid="EXO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ni ai ka i raja ka nde Allabatala kan natelen, ka taama ka bɛn n sawo ma, ka n na jamariliilu ni n na sariyailu bɛɛ labato, n ka jankarɔ mɛnilu la Misirankailu kan, n ti nala wo si lala ai kan, baa n ye Allabatala le ri, mɛn ye ai lakɛndɛyala.»<verse eid="EXO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Nba, Isirayɛlikailu bɔra Mara ka wa se Elimu. Tenke tan ni fila (12) ni tamaroju biwɔrɔnwula (70) tɛrɛ ye yɔrɔ wo rɔ. Ii ka ii daa makɛ ji da la ye.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ bɔra Elimu ka wa se Sin wula kɔndɔ. Yɔrɔ wo ye Elimu ni Sinayi koyinkɛ tɛ. Ii sera ye ka a tɛrɛn ii bɔ karo filana ni tele tan ni loolu ka bɔ Misiran. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" />Ka ii to kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ ye, Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ wulira ka Musa ni Haruna makuma. <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" />Ii ka a fɔ Musa ni Haruna yɛ ko: «Ni Allabatala tun ka an faa Misiran jamana rɔ, wo ka fisa ko ɲin di paaɔn, baa an tɛrɛ ye sobo sɔrɔnna Misiran, ka suman dɔɔn fɔɔ ka an wasa, kɔni ai ra na an di kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ yan sa an bɛɛ ri faa kɔnkɔ bolo.» <verse eid="EXO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «N di dɔɔnnifen najii ai ma. Lon lon, bɛɛ ri wa a la telenfen ta a rɔ. N di ii kɔrɔbɔ wo rɔ, ka a yen ni ii ri n kumakan natelen, wala ni ii tɛ a latelen. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Tele wɔɔrɔna wa se lɔɔkun lɔɔkun, ii ye wa dɔɔnnifen wo do ta ka na a tibi, ii ye wo siyaya ka a kɛ lon tɔilu ta ɲɔɔn fila ri.» <verse eid="EXO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" />Musa ni Haruna ka a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ yɛ ko: «Bi wura fɛ, ai ri a lɔn ko Allabatala de ka ai labɔ Misiran jamana rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" />Sini sɔɔma, ai ri Allabatala la nɔɔrɔ yen ai ɲa la, baa ai ka kuma mɛnilu fɔ Allabatala ma, a ka woilu mɛn. Nfenna ai ye ai kuma mɛsɛn kɛla nde ni Haruna ma? Andeilu tɛ foyi ri.» <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: «Allabatala a ri sobo di ai ma wura la, ai ri wo dɔɔn. Sɔɔma, a ri dɔɔnnin gbɛrɛ di ai ma, ai ri wo dɔɔn fɔɔ ka ai fa, baa ai ka kuma mɛsɛn mɛnilu fɔ a ma, a ka wo bɛɛ mɛn. Ai ye mɛn fɔla, ai tɛ wo fɔla andeilu ma, baa andeilu tɛ foyi ri. Ai ye wo fɔla Allabatala de ma.»<verse eid="EXO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Musa ka a fɔ Haruna yɛ ko: «I ye a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ yɛ ko ii ye na ii ladɛn yɔrɔ kelen dɔ Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ, baa ii ra kuma mɛsɛn mɛnilu fɔ ale ma, a ra wo bɛɛ mɛn.» <verse eid="EXO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />Nba, ka Haruna to kumala jama rɔ, ii ka ii ɲa lɔ ka Allabatala nɔɔrɔ yen duru munuɲa rɔ kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ. <verse eid="EXO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" />«Isirayɛlikailu ra kuma mɛsɛn mɛnilu bɛɛ fɔ n ma, n da wo mɛn. I ye a fɔ ii yɛ ko: ‹Ai ri sobo dɔɔn wura la. Ko sɔɔma, ko ai ri fa dɔɔnnin gbɛrɛ la. Ko ai ri a lɔn wo rɔ ko nde le ai Maari Allabatala ri.›» <verse eid="EXO 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />Nba, wura fɛ, wɔlɔ siyaman ba jiira ka i sii Isirayɛlikailu daa makɛ diya. Sɔɔma konbi lara duu ma daa makɛ diya laminin fan bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" />Konbi wo jara tuma mɛn na, fen doilu buruburuni tora duu ma. A mɛsɛnman, a gbɛni. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" />Isirayɛlikailu ka wo yen tuma mɛn na, ii ka i ɲɔɔn maɲininka ko: «Nfen de ɲin di?» Baa ii ma a lɔn ko fen mɛn ye wo ri. Musa ka ii jabi: «Dɔɔnninfen de wo ri, Allabatala ka mɛn di ai ma. <verse eid="EXO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />Allabatala ka mɛn fɔ dɔɔnnifen ɲin na ko rɔ, wo le ɲin di. A ka a fɔ ko ai bɛɛ ye wa do ta, mɛn di ai la dɔɔnninta bɔ. Mɔɔ mɛn jate ye ai bolo bon na, ai ye wo sumanifen ɲa fila jate ta.»<verse eid="EXO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Isirayɛlikailu ka a kɛ ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma. Doilu ka siyaman ta, doilu ma siyaman ta. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" />Ii ka wo suman sumanifen na tuma mɛn na, ii ka a yen ko mɛnilu ka siyaman ta, woilu ta to ma to, mɛnilu ma siyaman ta, woilu ta ma dɛsɛ. Mɔɔ kelen kelenna tun ka jate mɛn ta, wo ka a la dɔɔnninta bɔ.<verse eid="EXO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: «Mɔɔ si kana dɔɔnnifen wo tɔ lasii.» <verse eid="EXO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Kɔni doilu ma ii tolo malɔ Musa la kuma wo la. Ii ka ii ta tɔ lasii. Tunbuilu donda wo rɔ. A suma bɔra kojuuya. Musa mɔnɛra ii kanma.<verse eid="EXO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />Nba, sɔɔma sɔɔma mɔɔilu ri wa dɔɔnnifen wo do ta, mɛn di ai la dɔɔnninta bɔ. Tele wa bɔ kosɛbɛ tuma mɛn na, dɔɔnnifen mɛn wa to duu ma, wo ri yelen ka tunun. <verse eid="EXO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />A tele wɔɔrɔna lon, mɔɔilu wara tele fila ta ta dɔɔnnifen wo rɔ. Mɔɔ kelen kelenna ta kɛra sumanifen ɲa naanin di. Jama ɲɛmɔɔilu wara wo ɲafɔ Musa yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" />Musa ka ii jabi: «Allabatala ka wo le fɔ. Sini, ai ye baara bila fewu. Ɲɔɲɔ Lon de wo ri, mɛn bilanin a dan na Allabatala yɛ. Ni ai ye a fɛ ka dɔɔnnifen mɛn wusu, ai ye woilu wusu bi. Ni ai ye a fɛ ka mɛn tibi, ai ye woilu tibi bi. Ai ye bi ta bɔ a la ka a tɔ kɛ sinin ta a ri.» <verse eid="EXO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Ii ka a tɔ kɛ sinin ta ri ikomin Musa tun ka a fɔ ii yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. Wo duu sa gbɛ, wo suma tun tɛ bɔla, tunbu tun ma don a rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Musa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ka mɛn bila ye kunun, ai ye woilu dɔɔn bi, baa bi ye Ɲɔɲɔ Lon de ri, mɛn bilanin a dan na Allabatala yɛ. Ai ti nala dɔɔnnifen wo yenna duu ma bi. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" />Tele wɔɔrɔ kɔrɔ, ai ri dɔɔnnifen wo do ta, kɔni tele wɔrɔnwulana lon ye Ɲɔɲɔ Lon de ri. Ai ti nala foyi yenna duu ma wo lon.» <verse eid="EXO 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Wo bɛɛ ni a ta, doilu bɔra ka wa dɔɔnnifen wo ɲinin diya tele wɔrɔnwulana lon. Ii ma foyi tɛrɛn ye. <verse eid="EXO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «Ai ri ai ban n na sariya a ni n na tɔn mafɛnɛ la haan waati ɲuman? <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Ai ye ai hankili to a rɔ ko nde le ka Ɲɔɲɔ Lon di ai ma. Wo le rɔ, tele wɔɔrɔna lon wa se, n di tele filana dɔɔnnin di ai ma. Tele wɔrɔnwulana lon wa se, bɛɛ ye to a wara. Mɔɔ si kana bɔ.» <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />Wo rɔ, ii bɛɛ ka baara bila ka i ɲɔɲɔ tele wɔrɔnwulana lon ma.<verse eid="EXO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Isirayɛlikailu ka dɔɔnnifen wo tɔɔ la ko mana. A bɔni binkisɛ do le la, mɛn gbɛni. A duman ikomin dɛba mɛn nabɛnni li la. <verse eid="EXO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Musa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: ‹ai ye dɔɔnnifen ɲin sumanifen ɲa fila lamara ai bɔnsɔnilu yɛ, mɛnilu natɔ ai kɔ. Ko n ka ai labɔ Misiran ka ai balo dɔɔnnifen mɛn na kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ, kosa ai bɔnsɔnilu ri wo yen ii ɲa la.›» <verse eid="EXO 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" />Musa ka a fɔ Haruna yɛ ko: «I ye daa do ta ka dɔɔnnifen wo sumanifen ɲa fila kɛ a kɔndɔ ka woilu bila Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ. A ri a lamara ka a kɛ sereya ri an bɔnsɔnilu yɛ.» <verse eid="EXO 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" />Haruna ka a kɛ ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. A ka mana kɛ daa kɔndɔ ka a sii tɔɔmasere kankira ɲɛfɛ a lamara kanma. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" />Isirayɛlikailu ka san binaanin (40) kɛ mana wo dɔɔnna. Ii ka wo dɔɔn haan ii sera Kanaan jamana dan na, ii kɛtɔ ii siila jamana mɛn dɔ kɔnin. <verse eid="EXO 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />Nba, ii tɛrɛ ye mana sumanna sumanifen mɛnilu ma, wo ɲa tan bɛnda sumanifen ba ɲa kelen de ma. Sumanifen ba wo tɔɔ le ko ɛfa. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sumanifen ba mɛn tɔɔ ko ɛfa wo bɛnna litiri muwan ni fila (22) le ma.</char></note><verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s">Ji bɔra farakolo rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Nba, Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ bɔra Sin wula kɔndɔ ka wa ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ ii yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. Ii ka i mataama dɔɔnin dɔɔnin fɔɔ ka wa se yɔrɔ do rɔ, mɛn tɔɔ ko Refidima. Ii ka ii daa makɛ ye, kɔni ii ma minninji tɛrɛn ye. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" />Wo le ka a kɛ mɔɔilu wulira ka Musa makuma ko: «Ai ye ji di an ma.» Musa ka ii jabi: «Ai ye nde makumala nfenna? Ai ye i tɛɛla Allabatala rɔ nfenna ka a kɔrɔbɔ?» <verse eid="EXO 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Kɔni ji lɔɔ tɛrɛ ye ii la kojuuya. Wo rɔ, ii wulira ka a kɛ Musa makuma ri. Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Nfenna i ka an nabɔ Misiran ka an ni an denilu ni an na kolofenilu bɛɛ faa ji lɔɔ bolo wa?» <verse eid="EXO 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" />Musa ka a dalakasi Allabatala yɛ ko: «N ka kan ka nfen kɛ mɔɔ ɲinilu yɛ? A ra to dɔɔnin ii ri n ton kaba la.» <verse eid="EXO 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />Allabatala ka Musa jabi: «I ye Isirayɛlikailu la mɔɔbakɔrɔ doilu ta ka wa jama ɲɛfɛ. I la gbeleke ye wa i bolo, i ka Nili Ba gbasi gbeleke mɛn na. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" />N di n lɔ i ɲɛfɛ Horɛbu koyinkɛ farakolo do kan. I ye farakolo wo gbasi i la gbeleke la. Ji ri bɔ wo rɔ, mɔɔilu ri ji wo min.» Musa ka a kɛ wo ɲa kelen ma Isirayɛlikailu la mɔɔbakɔrɔilu ɲana.<verse eid="EXO 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" />Musa ka yɔrɔ wo tɔɔ la ko Meriba, ka a masɔrɔn Isirayɛlikailu ka sɔsɔli kɛ ye. A ka tɔɔ gbɛrɛ fanan la a la ko Masa, ka a masɔrɔn Isirayɛlikailu ka Allabatala kɔrɔbɔ ye le, ka a fɔ ko: «Allabatala ye an tɛma wa, wa a tɛ an tɛma?»<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amalɛkikailu ka Isirayɛlikailu kɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />Nba, Amalɛkikailu wulira ka na Isirayɛlikailu kɛlɛ Refidima. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Wo rɔ, Musa ka a fɔ Josuwe yɛ ko: «I ye mɔɔ doilu suwandi, mɛnilu ri kɛlɛ kɛ an yɛ. Ai ye wa Amalɛkikailu kɛlɛ. Sini n di wa n lɔ tindi kan ye. Alla la gbeleke ri kɛ n bolo.» <verse eid="EXO 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Musa ka mɛn fɔ, Josuwe ka wo kɛ. A ni a la tɛsidiilu wara ka Amalɛkikailu kɛlɛ. Wo waati kelen, Musa ni Haruna ni Huri yɛlɛra tindi wo kan. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" />Musa wa a boloilu kɔrɔtani to tuma mɛn na, Isirayɛlikailu la tɛsidiilu ri nɔ sɔrɔn. Kɔni a wa a boloilu lajii tuma mɛn na, Amalɛkikailu ri nɔ sɔrɔn. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />Kɔni Musa bolo fila bɛɛ ra kunda. Wo rɔ, Haruna ni Huri nara kabakudun do ri. Musa ka a sii wo kan. Ka a siini to, Haruna ni Huri ka a boloilu mira ka ii kɔrɔta. Do ka a bolokinin mira, do ka a bolomaran mira. Wo rɔ Musa boloilu kɔrɔtani tora haan tele be waati. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Wo le ka a kɛ, Josuwe ni a la mɔɔilu sera Amalɛkikailu la a la fanmuru la fewu.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye ko ɲin sɛbɛ kitabu lamininnin dɔ sa mɔɔilu kana ɲina wo rɔ. I ye a karan Josuwe ɲana sa a ri a mɛn, baa n di Amalɛkikailu halaki fɔɔ dunuɲa mɔɔilu ri ɲina ii la ko la fewu.» <verse eid="EXO 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Musa ka saraka bɔ diya lɔ ka a tɔɔ la ko: «Allabatala ra se di n ma.» <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: «Amalɛkikailu wulira Allabatala la mansaya kanma. Wo le rɔ, Allabatala ri ii kɛlɛ kadawu.»<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s">Musa birancɛ Jɛtiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Nba, Allabatala Alla tun ka mɛn bɛɛ kɛ Musa ni Isirayɛlikailu yɛ ka ii labɔ Misiran, wo fɔra Musa birancɛ Jɛtiro yɛ, mɛn ye Madiyankailu la sarakalasela ri. <verse eid="EXO 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Musa muso Sefora tɛrɛ ye a fa Jɛtiro bolo a wara, baa Musa tun ka a lawa ko a ye waati do kɛ ye. <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />Sefora dencɛ fila fanan tɛrɛ ye Jɛtiro bolo ye. Musa tun ka a dencɛ kelen tɔɔ la ko Kerisɔn, baa a ka a fɔ ko: «N ye londan de ri.» <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />A ka dencɛ do fanan tɔɔ la ko Eliyɛsɛri, baa a ka a fɔ ko: «N fa Maari Alla ra n dɛmɛn ka n bɔ Ferawuna bolo, mɛn tɛrɛ ye fɛrɛ ɲininna n ma ka n faa fanmuru la.»<verse eid="EXO 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Musa birancɛ Jɛtiro ka Musa muso ni a dencɛilu ta ka wa Musa tɛrɛn kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ. Wo tuma Musa ni Isirayɛlikailu daa makɛni Alla la koyinkɛ kɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />Jɛtiro ka kela lawa Musa ma ko: «Nde, i birancɛ Jɛtiro, natɔ bɔla i tɔrɔfɛ. I muso ni a dencɛ fila natɔ a kɔfɛ.»<verse eid="EXO 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />Wo rɔ, Musa wara a birancɛ kunbɛn diya. A seni ye, a ka i majii ka a fo, ka ban ka a sunbu. Ii ka foli di i ɲɔɔn ma. Ii banni wo la, ii wara don Musa la faaninbon na. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Allabatala ka ko mɛn bɛɛ kɛ Ferawuna ni a la mɔɔilu la Isirayɛlikailu dɛmɛn ko rɔ, Musa ka wo bɛɛ ɲafɔ a birancɛ yɛ. Isirayɛlikailu ka tɔrɔya mɛn bɛɛ sɔrɔn sila la, a ni Allabatala ka ii kisi ɲa mɛn ma, Musa ka wo fanan ɲafɔ a birancɛ yɛ.<verse eid="EXO 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Allabatala ka koɲuma mɛn bɛɛ kɛ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ, ka ii bɔ Misirankailu bolo ɲa mɛn ma ka ii kisi, Jɛtiro sɛwara wo bɛɛ la kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="EXO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Jɛtiro ka a fɔ ko: «Tandoli ye Allabatala yɛ, mɛn ka ai bɔ Ferawuna bolo, ka a la mɔɔilu labɔ Misirankailu la fanka kɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" />N ka a lɔn sisɛn ko Allabatala ka bon batofen tɔilu bɛɛ ri, baa Misirankailu tɛrɛ jɛrɛdabayani Isirayɛlikailu ma; wo le kosɔn Alla ka Misirankailu halaki.» <verse eid="EXO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Musa birancɛ Jɛtiro nara saraka ni saraka janinta di Alla ma. Haruna ni Isirayɛlikailu la mɔɔbakɔrɔilu bɛɛ nara ka dɔɔnnin kɛ Musa birancɛ fɛ Alla ɲakɔrɔ.<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jɛtiro ka Musa lali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Wo duu sa gbɛnin, Musa wara i sii ka a kɛ mɔɔilu la kititɛɛ ri. Ka bɔ sɔɔma ma haan ka se wura la, jama lɔni tɛrɛ a laminin dɔ ka makɔnɔni kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />Musa tɛrɛ ye mɛn bɛɛ kɛla mɔɔilu yɛ ɲin, a birancɛ ka wo yen. Wo rɔ, a ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye nfen kɛla ɲin di? Nfenna kosɔn ile kelen pe siini mɔɔilu la kititɛɛla yan? Ka bɔ sɔɔma ma haan wura la, jama bɛɛ lɔni i laminin dɔ ka makɔnɔni kɛ.» <verse eid="EXO 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Musa ka a birancɛ jabi: «N ye wo kɛla ka a masɔrɔn mɔɔilu ye nala n ma ka Alla diyanan ko lɔn. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />Ni sɔsɔli wulira doilu tɛ, ii ri na wo fɔ n yɛ, n di wo kititɛɛ ii tɛma. N di ii lalɔnniya Alla la jamariliilu ni a la sariyailu la.»<verse eid="EXO 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Jɛtiro ka a fɔ ko: «I ye baarala ɲa mɛn ma, wo ma ɲin de. <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" />I ri i jɛrɛ sɛɛ fewu, ka mɔɔilu fanan sɛɛ. Baara wo ka bon i kelen ma. I kelen ti se wo kɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />I tolo malɔ n na kumakan na, n ye i lalila. Alla ye i dɛmɛn ka n na lalilikan mira. Ile ka kan ka kuma mɔɔilu tɔɔ rɔ Alla yɛ, ka ii la sɔsɔliilu lase a ma. <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" />I ye ii karan Alla la jamariliilu ni a la sariyailu la. Ii ka kan ka sila taama ɲa mɛn ma, a ni ii ka kan ka ko mɛnilu kɛ, i ye woilu bɛɛ yiraka ii la. <verse eid="EXO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" />Ka a la wo kan, i ye mɔɔ doilu suwandi jama bɛɛ tɛma, mɛnilu ri se ko la, mɛnilu fanan silanni Alla ɲɛ. Woilu ye kɛ mɔɔilu ri, jama lani mɛnilu la, mɛnilu sidinin tuɲa la, dibirafen mira ma di mɛnilu yɛ. I ye mɔɔ woilu sii jama kun na. I ye doilu sii mɔɔ waa kelen kelen (1,000) kun na, ka doilu sii mɔɔ kɛmɛ kɛmɛ (100) kun na, ka doilu sii mɔɔ biloolu loolu (50) kun na, ka doilu fanan sii mɔɔ tan tan (10) kun na. <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" />Woilu ye mɔɔilu la sɔsɔliilu kititɛɛ lon lon. Ni kiti mɛn bonyara ii ma, ii ri na wo ri ile ma, kɔni ii ri sɔsɔli mɛsɛnilu kititɛɛ ye. Wo rɔ, i ri i lafɛrɛn dɔɔni, baa ii ri i dɛmɛn baara ba wo la. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />Alla ye i jamarila mɛn na, ni i ka wo kɛ i ri se wo baara la. Mɔɔ bɛɛ la sɔsɔliilu ri ɲanabɔ wo rɔ, ii ri kɔsɛ ii wara jususuma dɔ.» <verse eid="EXO 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Nba, Musa ka a tolo malɔ a birancɛ la lalilikan na ka wo bɛɛ mira. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" />A ka mɔɔilu suwandi Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ tɛma, mɛnilu ri se ko la, ka woilu sii jama kun na. A ka doilu lasii mɔɔ waa kelen kelen (1,000) kun na, ka doilu lasii mɔɔ kɛmɛ kɛmɛ (100) kun na, ka doilu lasii mɔɔ biloolu loolu (50) kun na, ka doilu fanan nasii mɔɔ tan tan (10) kun na. <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" />Woilu le tɛrɛ ye mɔɔilu la sɔsɔliilu kititɛɛla lon lon. Ni kiti mɛn gbɛlɛnyara ii ma, ii ri na wo ri Musa ma, kɔni ii ri sɔsɔli mɛsɛnilu kititɛɛ ye.<verse eid="EXO 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" />Nba, wo kɔ, Musa ka sila di a birancɛ ma. Wo ka i kɔsɛ ka wa a la jamana rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1-2" />Nba, Isirayɛlikailu bɔra Refidima ka wa se Sinayi kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ. A karo sawana bɔra lon mɛn ii bɔni kɔ rɔ Misiran jamana rɔ, wo lon kelen ii sera Sinayi kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ. Ii ka ii daa makɛ koyinkɛ kɔrɔ kiɲɛ fufu kɔndɔ ye. <verse eid="EXO 19:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />Musa yɛlɛra koyinkɛ kan, ka wa Alla labɛn. Allabatala tora koyinkɛ kun tɛma ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye kuma ɲin fɔ Yakuba bɔnsɔnilu yɛ, Isirayɛlikailu kɔnin. Ko: <verse eid="EXO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" />‹Ai jɛrɛ ka a yen ko n ka ai labɔ Misiran ɲa mɛn ma ka ai ta ikomin bibi ye a denilu tala a kawa na ɲa mɛn ma, n ka ai Isirayɛlikailu ta wo ɲa le ma ka na ai ri n ma yan. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" />Sisɛn, ni ai ka ai raja ka n kumakan natelen ka n na teriya bonya, n ka mɛn sidi an tɛma, ai ri kɛ n na mɔɔilu ri, mɛnilu duman n yɛ ka tamin siya tɔilu bɛɛ kan. Hali wo dunuɲa bɛɛ ye n ta le ri, <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" />Aile, Isirayɛlikailu, ai ri kɛ mansaya sarakalaselailu ri, jamana sɛniman mɛn ye nde yɛ.› I ye wa kuma wo fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ.»<verse eid="EXO 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Musa jiira koyinkɛ la ka wa Isirayɛlikailu la mɔɔbakɔrɔilu kili. Allabatala ka kuma mɛnilu jamari a la, a ka wo bɛɛ lase ii ma. <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" />Mɔɔ woilu bɛɛ ladɛnnin ka Musa jabi: «Allabatala ka mɛnilu fɔ, an di wo bɛɛ labato.» Musa wara mɔɔilu la jabili di Allabatala ma. <verse eid="EXO 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «N di na i ma duru munuɲa do rɔ, sa n wa kuma i yɛ tuma mɛn na, mɔɔilu ri n kumakan mɛn ka la i la tuma bɛɛ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 19:9">Jama tun ka mɛn fɔ, Musa ka wo dantɛɛ Allabatala yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye jii ka i kɔsɛ mɔɔilu ma, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko bi a ni sini ii ye ii jɛrɛ sɛninya. I ye a fɔ ii yɛ ko ii ye ii la faanin fanan ko. <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />Ii ye ban ii rabɛnna sani sinikɛndɛ tɛ, baa sinikɛndɛ n di jii Sinayi koyinkɛ kun na mɔɔ bɛɛ ɲana. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" />I ye dan bila koyinkɛ laminin fan bɛɛ rɔ, ka a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ ko ii ye a kɛ koɲuma, ii kana yɛlɛ koyinkɛ kan. Ii kana se koyinkɛ ma muumɛ. Mɔɔ mɔɔ wa se koyinkɛ ma, a ri faa! <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />Mɔɔ si kana a bolo maa mɔɔ wo la. Ii ye a ton kaba la ka a faa. Ni wo tɛ, ko ii ye a bon biɲɛ la ka a faa. Mɔɔ wo, kolofen wo, ni mɛn ka tɔn wo tiɲan, ii kana wo tii kɛndɛ to. Ii wa buru fɛ kan ba mɛn tuma mɛn na, ii ri se i madonna koyinkɛ la.»<verse eid="EXO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Musa jiira ka bɔ koyinkɛ kan ka wa a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ ko ii ye ii jɛrɛ sɛninya. Ii ka ii la faaninilu fanan ko. <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" />Musa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ikɔ tuunnin ko: «Ai ye ban ai jɛrɛ rabɛnna sani sinikɛndɛ. Ai ni ai musoilu kana dɛn tele fila ɲin kɔrɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />Nba, lon mɛn fɔni, wo lon telebɔ mɛn kɛnin, banda kulunkan bɔra, sanfɛrɛnilu jiira fanan. Duru munuɲa jiini tɛrɛ koyinkɛ kun dɔ. Buru fɛ kan ba do bɔra. Wo kɛnin, mɔɔilu bɛɛ silanda kojuuya fɔɔ ka yɛrɛyɛrɛ daa makɛ diya ye. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Musa lɔra jama bɛɛ ɲɔrɔ ka bɔ daa makɛ diya ka wa Alla labɛn. Ii wara i lɔni koyinkɛ wo kɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" />Sinayi koyinkɛ fan bɛɛ kɛra sisi ri, baa Allabatala tun ni ta le jiira i ɲɔɔn fɛ koyinkɛ kun tɛma. Sisi ba tɛrɛ ye yɛlɛla ikomin fuuru. Koyinkɛ yɔrɔ bɛɛ yɛrɛyɛrɛra kojuuya. <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />Buru fɛ kan tora bonyala. Musa tɛrɛ ye kumala a ni Alla fanan tɛrɛ ye a jabila a kan na.<verse eid="EXO 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />Allabatala jiira Sinayi koyinkɛ kun tɛma. A tora koyinkɛ kun tɛma ye ka Musa kili. Musa yɛlɛra. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" />A seni ye, Allabatala ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye jii ka i jaseremala mɔɔilu yɛ, sa ii kana tamin dan wo la ka na nde Allabatala ragbɛ. Ni wo tɛ, ii siyaman di faa. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" />Hali Alla sarakalasela mɛnilu ye ii madonna nde Allabatala la, fo ii ye ii jɛrɛ sɛninya le fɔlɔ. Ni wo tɛ, n di ii faa.» <verse eid="EXO 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Musa ka Allabatala jabi: «Mɔɔilu tɛ sɔnna yɛlɛla Sinayi koyinkɛ kan yan, baa i jɛrɛ ka i jaseremala an yɛ ko an ye dan kɛ koyinkɛ laminin dɔ ka koyinkɛ bɛɛ kɛ yɔrɔ sɛniman di.» <verse eid="EXO 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />Allabatala ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye jii ka wa Haruna ta ka na a ri yan, kɔni Alla sarakalaselailu ni mɔɔ tɔilu kana tamin dan kan, ka yɛlɛ, ka na nde Allabatala ma de! Ni wo tɛ, n di ii faa.» <verse eid="EXO 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Musa jiira wo rɔ, ka wa mɔɔilu tɛrɛn ye ka kuma wo fɔ ii yɛ.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s">Alla la sariya tan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Alla ka kuma ɲin bɛɛ fɔ ko:<verse eid="EXO 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />«Nde le i Maari Allabatala ri. Nde le ka ai labɔ Misiran ai tɛrɛ ye jɔnya la yɔrɔ mɛn.<verse eid="EXO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />«Ai kana batofen gbɛrɛ si bato nde kɔ.<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />«Ai kana bisiki si lɛsɛ ai jɛrɛ yɛ ka a bato. Fen mɛnilu ye sankolo rɔ wo, fen mɛnilu ye duu kan wo, fen mɛnilu ye ji rɔ wo, ai kana woilu si bisiki ladan. <verse eid="EXO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />Ai kana i majii wo si kɔrɔ ka a bato, baa nde le ai Maari Allabatala ri. N ye Alla keleyatɔ le ri. N ti sɔn ai ye fen gbɛrɛ si bato. Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka n nagboyaɲɛ ka a ban n dɔ, n di wo hakɛ bɔ wo tii rɔ, a ni a denilu a ni a mamarenilu a ni a tolomirailu rɔ, a ni woilu fanan denilu rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" />Kɔni ni mɔɔ mɛn ka n kanin ka n na jamariliilu sila taama, n di n na kaninteya yiraka wo la haan ka wa se a bɔnsɔn farɔkɛ waa kelenna (1,000) ma.<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />«Ai kana ai Maari Allabatala tɔɔ fɔ fuu. Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka n tɔɔ fɔ fuu, nde Allabatala n di ko latɔn wo tii la.<verse eid="EXO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />«Ai ye ai hankili to Ɲɔɲɔ Lon dɔ, ka wo bila a dan na nde Alla yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" />Ai ye baara kɛ tele wɔɔrɔ kɔrɔ, ka ai la ko bɛɛ kɛ, <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" />kɔni tele wɔrɔnwulana ye Ɲɔɲɔ Lon de ri, mɛn bilanin nde ai Maari Allabatala yɛ. Ai kana baara si kɛ wo lon. Ai jɛrɛ, ai dencɛilu, ai denmusoilu, ai la jɔncɛilu, ai la jɔnmusoilu a ni ai la kolofenilu, woilu si kana baara kɛ wo lon. Hali londan mɛnilu siini ai wara, woilu kana baara si kɛ wo lon, <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" />baa nde Allabatala le ka san dan ni duu dan ni kɔɔji fanan dan, a ni ii kɔndɔfenilu bɛɛ. N ka wo bɛɛ dan tele wɔɔrɔ le kɔrɔ, ka ɲɔɲɔ tele wɔrɔnwulana lon. Wo le rɔ, n ka tele wɔrɔnwulana baraka, ka a bila n yɛ ka a kɛ tele sɛniman di.<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />«Ai ye ai fa ni ai na bonya, sa ai ri si jan sɔrɔn jamana rɔ, ai Maari Allabatala ye jamana mɛn dila ai ma.<verse eid="EXO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />«Ai kana mɔɔ faa.<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />«Ai kana kaninkɛ.<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />«Ai kana suɲali kɛ.<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />«Ai kana kɛ sere juu ri, mɛn ye wuya lala a mɔɔɲɔɔ la.<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />«Ai kana ai nata la ai mɔɔɲɔɔ la bon fɛ. Ai kana ai nata la ai mɔɔɲɔɔ la muso fɛ, wala a la jɔncɛ, wala a la jɔnmuso, wala a la nisi, wala a la fali, wala a bolofen si.»<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />Awa, mɔɔilu tɛrɛ ye kulunkan ni buru fɛ kan mɛnna. Ii tɛrɛ ye sanfɛrɛnilu yenna jiila koyinkɛ kan, ka sisi wulitɔ fanan yen koyinkɛ kan. Ii ka wo bɛɛ yen tuma mɛn na, ii silanda fɔɔ ka yɛrɛyɛrɛ. Wo rɔ, ii lɔni tora yɔrɔ jan. <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />Ii ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I jaandi, i jɛrɛ ye kuma an yɛ, an di an tolo malɔ i la, kɔni Alla kana kuma an yɛ, ni wo tɛ an bɛɛ ri faa.» <verse eid="EXO 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" />Musa ka ii jabi: «Ai kana silan, baa Alla ra na ka ai kɔrɔbɔ. A ye a fɛ ai ye kɛ Alla ɲɛsilanɲɛbailu ri sa ai kana kojuu kɛ.»<verse eid="EXO 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Nba, ka ii lɔni to wula jan na ye, Musa ka i madon sanfin wo la, Alla tɛrɛ ye sanfin mɛn dɔ. <verse eid="EXO 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ ko: ‹ai ra a yen ai jɛrɛ ɲa la ko n tora san dɔ ka kuma ai yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />Ai kana wodigbɛ jooilu wala sanin jooilu ladan ai jɛrɛ yɛ, ka woilu bato nde kɔ. <verse eid="EXO 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" />Ai ye banku ta ka saraka bɔ diya lɔ n yɛ. Ai ye ai la saa ni baa ni nisi mɛnilu kɛla saraka janintailu ni jususuma sarakailu ri, ai ye woilu kannatɛɛ ka ai di n ma saraka bɔ diya wo kan. N wa yɔrɔ yɔrɔ suwandi sa ai ri n bato ye, n di na ai tɛrɛn ye ka baraka don ai la ko rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" />Ni ai ka n na saraka bɔ diya do lɔ kaba la, ai kana a lɔ kaba malɛsɛninilu la, baa kaba malɛsɛnin di n na saraka bɔ diya manɔɔ. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />Ai kana yɛlɛ yɛlɛdiyailu kan ka wa saraka bɔ, sani mɔɔ mɛnilu lɔni duu ma kana ai la fari makolonna yen ai la faanin ju kɔrɔ.›»<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="s">Sariya mɛnilu siira jɔnilu kosɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ikɔ tuun ko: «I ye sariya ɲinilu fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" />Ni ai ka Heburu jɔncɛ san, a ye baara kɛ ai yɛ san wɔɔrɔ kɔrɔ. Kɔni a san wɔrɔnwulana wa se, ai ye a bila sa a ri wa. A ma kan ka foyi sara a bila ko rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />Ni ai ka a san ka a tɛrɛn muso tɛ a kun, ai ye a kelen bila. Ni ai ka a san ka a tɛrɛn muso tii le a ri, ai ye a ni a muso bila. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />Kɔni ni jɔncɛ wo muso ka denilu sɔrɔn a yɛ ka a tɛrɛn a jɔntii le ka muso wo di a ma, muso ni a denilu ri to jɔntii bolo. Jɔncɛ kelen di wa.<verse eid="EXO 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" />«Kɔni ni jɔncɛ ka a fɔ ko a jɔntii ni a muso ni a denilu duman a yɛ, ko wo le kosɔn a tɛ a fɛ a jɔntii ye a bila, <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" />jɔntii ri wa jɔn di Alla ɲakɔrɔ. A ri wa jɔn di wo rɔ ka a lalɔ bonda la, wala bonda la jiri la, ka a tolo sɔɔ sɔɔlifen na. Wo rɔ jɔncɛ ri to baarala jɔntii yɛ a si bɛɛ kɔrɔ.<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />«Nba, ni cɛɛ do ka a denmuso feere ka a kɛ jɔnmuso ri, denmuso tɛ hɔrɔya ikomin jɔncɛilu ye hɔrɔyala ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />Ni denmuso ma diya a jɔntii yɛ, mɛn ka a san a furu kanma, jɔntii ye a to denmuso fa ye a kunka. Jɔntii kana denmuso feere siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔ ma. Wo sariya tɛ a bolo, janfa le wo ri. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />Ni jɔntii ka denmuso wo di a dencɛ ma, fɔɔ a ye a mira ikomin a denmuso. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />Ni jɔntii ka jɔnmuso kɛ a muso ri, ka ban ka muso gbɛrɛ furu ka a la jɔnmuso kan, fo a ye jɔnmuso balo, ka a feriyabɔ, ka la a fɛ ikomin a dorini a kɛla ɲa mɛn ma kɔrɔman na. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />Ni jɔntii ma ko sawa wo kɛ jɔnmuso yɛ, jɔnmuso ri kanhɔrɔya ka wa, a tɛ a sɔnkɔ lasɛ.»<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kojuu mɛnilu ni saya ka kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />«Mɔɔ mɛn wa mɔɔ gbasi ka a faa, wo tii ye faa. <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" />Kɔni ni mɔɔ ka mɔɔ faa ka a tɛrɛn a miriya tun tɛ a la ka a faa, kɔni Alla le ka a kɛ wo kɛra a bolo, mɔɔfaala wo ye i bori ka wa a makandan yɔrɔ do rɔ, n kɛtɔ mɛn yirakala ai la. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" />Ni mɔɔ do ka a lawuli a ma ka a mɔɔɲɔɔ faa kewuya la, ai ye wo tii mira ka a faa, hali ni a ra i bori ka wa a makandan n saraka bɔ diya rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />«Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka a fa gbasi, wala a na gbasi, wo tii ye faa.<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />«Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka mɔɔ do suɲa ka wa a ri, wo tii ye faa. Ni ai ka mɔɔ wo tɛrɛn a bolo, wala ni ai ka a tɛrɛn a ra mɔɔ wo feere, wo tii ye faa.<verse eid="EXO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" />«Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka a fa wala a na danka, wo tii ye faa.<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18-19" />«Ni mɔɔ do ka a mɔɔɲɔɔ madimin kaba la wala a bolokudu la sɔsɔli rɔ, ka a kɛ sababu ri a mɔɔɲɔɔ wo lanin ri to a la lafen kan ka mɛn, ai kana ko kɛ wo tii la fɔlɔ, fɔɔ ka makɔnɔnnin kɛ. Kɔ fɛ, ni madiminbatɔ ka gbeleke ta ka i wuli ka taama damira lu ma, a gbasila kana jalaki butun. Kɔni madiminbatɔ la baara lalɔ mɛn kɛra, a gbasila ye wodi bɔ ka wo sara madiminbatɔ yɛ. Ka a la wo kan, a ye a janto madiminbatɔ rɔ haan a wa kɛndɛya fewu.<verse eid="EXO 21:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />«Mɔɔ wa a la jɔncɛ wala a la jɔnmuso gbasi gbeleke la, ni jɔn wo faara wo kosɔn, ko ye latɔn jɔntii la. <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" />Kɔni ni jɔn wo ka tele kelen wala tele fila kɛ a ma faa, ko kana latɔn jɔntii la, baa a ta le jɔn di fasayi!<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />«Cɛɛ fila wa to kɛlɛla ka se muso kɔnɔma do ma, ka a kɛ sababu ri a moyira jonna, ni muso ma madimin ba kɛ, mɛn sera a ma wo ri wodi bɔ. A ka kan ka wodi jate mɛn bɔ, muso tii ri wo fɔ, kɔni fɔɔ kititɛɛlailu wa sɔn jate wo ma. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Kɔni ni kojuu ka muso sɔrɔn, ai ye wo ta sara, nii ye sarala nii de la, <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" />ɲa ye sarala ɲa le la, ɲin ye sarala ɲin de la, bolo ye sarala bolo le la, sen ye sarala sen de la. <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />Mɛn wa do majanin, ai ye wo fanan majanin. A wa do madimin, ai ye a fanan madimin. Mɛn wa mɔɔ gbasi ka yɔrɔ do funu, ai ye wo tii fanan gbasi ka yɔrɔ do funu.<verse eid="EXO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />«Ni mɔɔ do ka a la jɔncɛ wala a la jɔnmuso gbasi ka se wo ɲa ma ka a ɲa funyen, fo a ye jɔn wo kanhɔrɔya. Wo ri kɛ ɲa wo sara ri. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />Ni a ka a la jɔncɛ wala a la jɔnmuso gbasi ka wo ɲi bɔ a da rɔ, fo a ye jɔn wo kanhɔrɔya. Wo ri kɛ ɲi wo sara ri.<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />«Ni tora do ka cɛɛ wala muso sɔɔ ka a faa, ai ye tora wo bon kaba la ka a faa. Mɔɔ kana tora wo sobo dɔɔn. Kɔni ai ti nala tora tii jalakila wo rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Ni tora wo dorini mɔɔilu sɔɔla, ka a tɛrɛn mɔɔilu ra wo fɔ a tii yɛ kɔni a ma sɔn ka a janto a rɔ, ni tora wo ka mɔɔ do sɔɔ ka a faa, ai ye tora wo bon kaba la ka a faa ka a tii fanan faa. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Kɔni ni sayabatɔ la denbaya ka a fɔ ko tora tii ye wodi bɔ sa a kana faa, tora tii ri wodi bɔ ka a nii kunka. Kɔni wodi jate mɛn fɔni, fo a ye wo bɛɛ sara le fasayi. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />Ni tora ka mɔɔ do dencɛ wala denmuso sɔɔ, sariya kelen ɲin ye mɛn fɔla, ai ye wo kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />Ni tora ka jɔncɛ wala jɔnmuso sɔɔ, tora tii ye wodi gbanan bisawa (30) bɔ ka a di jɔn tii ma. Kɔni ai ri tora wo bon kaba la.<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33" />«Ni mɔɔ do ka ji lamara denka sen ka a da lakani to, ni wo tɛ a ka ji lamara denka kɔrɔ da lakani to, ni tora wala sofali nara be wo kɔndɔ, <verse eid="EXO 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34" />denka tii ri kolofen sɔnkɔ lasɛ kolofen tii ma. Kɔni kolofen wo sobo ri kɛ denka tii ta ri.<verse eid="EXO 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />«Ni mɔɔ do la tora ka mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ta madimin fɔɔ a sara, nisi tii fila woilu ye dɛ ka tora kelen wo feere ka a sɔnkɔ wodi rafara ii ɲɔɔn tɛ. Ii ri tora faani sobo fanan ratala ii ɲɔɔn tɛ. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Ni mɔɔilu tun ka a lɔn kɔrɔman ko tora wo dorini torailu sɔɔla, kɔni a tii ma sɔn a jantola a rɔ, tora tii wo ye tora faani ɲɔɔn bɔ ka a di tora tii do wo ma. Tora faani wo ri kɛ a ta ri. <verse eid="EXO 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 21:37" />Ni mɔɔ do ka nisi wala saa suɲa ka a faa, wala ka a feere, a ye nisi loolu sara nisi kelen nɔ rɔ. Ni saa le, a ye saa naanin lasɛ saa kelen nɔ rɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 21:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />«Ni mɔɔ do ka son dontɔla yen bon na su rɔ ka a gbasi ka a faa, wo tii tɛ jalaki mɔɔ faa ko rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2" />Kɔni ni mɔɔ do ka son dontɔla yen ka a gbasi ka a faa ka a tɛrɛn tele ra bɔ, wo tii ri jalaki mɔɔ faa ko rɔ. Awa, ni son mirara, a ra fen mɛnilu suɲa, fo a ye woilu bɛɛ sara le fewu. Ni wodi tɛ a bolo, fo a jɛrɛ ye feere ka a sɔnkɔ lasɛ fen tii ma. <verse eid="EXO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3" />Son wa nisi wala sofali wala saa suɲa, ni mɔɔilu ra son mira ka a tɛrɛn kolofen kɛndɛ wo ye a bolo fɔlɔ, fo a ye wo ɲɔɔn fila lasɛ.<verse eid="EXO 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4" />«Ni mɔɔ do ka a la kolofen bila sɛnɛ rɔ, wala rɛsɛnfɛ rɔ, ni kolofen wara a kun fɛ ka wa mɔɔ do la sɛnɛfen do dɔɔn, kolofen tii ye wo sara. Kolofen ka fen fen dɔɔn, kolofen tii ri wo ɲɔɔn sara ka bɔ a la sɛnɛfen ɲuma ɲumailu rɔ, wala a la rɛsɛn ɲuma ɲumailu rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />«Mɔɔ mɛn wa ta su a wara, ni ta wo ka bin wɔninmanilu mira ka wa do la sɛnɛ rɔ ka sumansidi doilu janin, wala suman mɛnilu ma ka fɔlɔ, wala sɛnɛ bɛɛ, ta sula ye fen woilu bɛɛ sara.<verse eid="EXO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />«Ni mɔɔ do ka a la wodi wala a la bolofen doilu karifa a siiɲɔɔ la kɔni woilu sonyara a siiɲɔɔ na bon na, ni son mirara, son ye wo ɲɔɔn fila lasɛ. <verse eid="EXO 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />Kɔni ni ii ma son yen, fo bon tii ye wa i lɔ Alla ɲana ka a kali ko a ma a siiɲɔɔ na bolofen wo suɲa.<verse eid="EXO 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />«Ni mɔɔ doilu ka sɔsɔli kɛ fen do kan, a kɛra nisi ri wo, a kɛra sofali ri wo, a kɛra saa ri wo, a kɛra faanin di wo, a kɛra fen fen di mɛn tununnin, ni ii fila ye a fɔla ko a ta le ye fen wo ri, ii ye wa i lɔ Alla ɲakɔrɔ. Alla wa mɛn jalaki ko a jo tɛ, wo ri fen wo ɲɔɔn fila lasɛ a duɲɔɔ ma.<verse eid="EXO 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" />«Mɔɔ wa a la sofali wala a la nisi wala a la saa wala a la kolofen gbɛrɛ karifa a siiɲɔɔ do la, ni kolofen wo sara wala a madiminda, ni wo tɛ tiɲanninnailu nara fo a kɔ ma, <verse eid="EXO 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />fo siiɲɔɔ wo ye wa ka a kali Allabatala ɲana ko a ma ko si kɛ kolofen na. Kolofen tii ye diɲɛ wo ma. A siiɲɔɔ ti nala kolofen wo ɲɔɔn sarala wo rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11" />Kɔni ni mɔɔ le tun ka kolofen suɲa siiɲɔɔ wara, fo siiɲɔɔ ye kolofen wo ɲɔɔn nasɛ kolofen tii ma. <verse eid="EXO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12" />Ni waa rɔ sobo le tun ka kolofen mira ka a rafarafara, siiɲɔɔ ye na sobo tɔ wo ri ka a kɛ sereya ri. A ti nala wodi bɔla wo rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13" />«Ni mɔɔ do ka kolofen sinkan a siiɲɔɔ ma, kɔni kolofen madiminda a tii kɔ, wala a sara, a tɛrɛ ye mɛn bolo, fɔɔ wo ye a ɲɔɔn sara le. <verse eid="EXO 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />Kɔni ni ko kɛra kolofen na a tii ɲana le, mɛn ka kolofen wo sinkan a tii ma, wo ti nala a ɲɔɔn sarala. Ni kolofen tii tun ka wodi sɔrɔn ka kolofen sinkan, ka a tɛrɛn kolofen da sa, fɔɔ a tii ye a wasa don sinkannin wodi wo rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />«Ni cɛɛ ka sunkurun do yen, mɛn da a jɛrɛ kandan, mɛn fanan mamiranin tɛ, ni cɛɛ ka sunkurun wo manɛɛn ka i la a fɛ, fɔɔ a ye furu nanfulu bɔ ka sunkurun wo furu. <verse eid="EXO 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />Ni sunkurun wo fa ka i ban a dila cɛɛ wo ma, fɔɔ cɛɛ wo ye furu nanfulu bɛɛ bɔ le hali a ma denmuso sɔrɔn. Mɔɔilu ye jate mɛn bɔla ka sunkurun wo ɲɔɔn furu, mɛn kɔnin da a jɛrɛ kandan, fɔɔ cɛɛ ye jate wo bɔ.<verse eid="EXO 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />«Muso mɛn ye suwaya kɛla, ai kana sɔn wo ye to ɲenemaya rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />«Ni mɔɔ do ni kolofen dɛra, ai ye mɔɔ wo faa.<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />«Mɛn wa batofen do sɔ, mɛn kɔnin tɛ nde Allabatala ri, wo tii ye faa.<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />«Ai kana kojuu kɛ londanilu la ka ii tɔrɔ kojuuya, baa ai fanan kɛra londanilu le ri Misiran jamana rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />«Ai kana kojuu kɛ cɛsamusoilu ni faratanninilu la. <verse eid="EXO 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" />Ni ai ka ko kɛ ii la, ii wa ii makasi nde yɛ ko n ye ii dɛmɛn, n di n tolo malɔ ii kan na. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" />N di duɲa ai kanma wo rɔ. N di a kɛ ai ri faa fanmuru la. Ai musoilu ri kɛ cɛsamusoilu ri. Ai denilu ri kɛ faratanninilu ri.<verse eid="EXO 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />«Ni ai ka julu don dɛsɛbatɔ do la, ni a ye n na jama mɔɔ do ri, ai kana fen la wodi wo jate kan ka a kɛ ai la tɔnɔ ri. Julumuntii ye tɔnɔ ɲininna ten de. <verse eid="EXO 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />Ni ai ka ai siiɲɔɔ na durukiba ta julu kun kɔrɔ, wura wura ai ye a lasɛ a ma, <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" />baa wo kelen pe le ye a bolo. A wa a la su rɔ, a ri nfen kɛ a la birinkan di ni wo tɛ? Nba, ni a ka a makasi nde yɛ ko n ye a dɛmɛn, n di n tolo malɔ a kan na, baa hinatii le nde ri.<verse eid="EXO 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />«Ai kana Alla mananin. Ai kana ai la kuntii danka.<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />«Ai wa suman ni rɛsɛnji mɛn sɔrɔn, ai ye n ta fan bɔ ka a kɛ saraka di. Ai kana kundasumaya wo kɛla.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:28">«Ai ye ai den fɔlɔilu di nde Allabatala ma.<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />«Ai ye ai la nisiden fɔlɔilu fanan di n ma wo ɲa, a ni ai la saaden fɔlɔilu. Ai ye a to kolofen den fɔlɔ woilu ye to ii nailu fɛ tele wɔrɔnwula kɔrɔ. Ii sɔrɔn tele seyin, ai ye ii di nde ma. <verse eid="EXO 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />Ai ri kɛ n na mɔɔ sɛnimanilu le ri. Wo rɔ, waa rɔ sobo wa kolofen mɛn rafarafara, ai kana wo sobo dɔɔn. Ai ye wo lafili wuluilu kɔrɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s">Ai ye mɔɔilu mira telenbaya la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />«Ai kana wuya lajɛnsɛn mɔɔilu tɛma. Ai wa kɛ sere ri kiti diya, ai kana wuya fɔ ka mɔɔ juu dɛmɛn. <verse eid="EXO 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" />Ai kana ai bila jama kɔ ka wa kojuu kɛ. Ai wa kɛ sereilu ri kiti diya, ai kana ai la sereya jɛnkɛ ka ai bila jama kɔ ka wuya fɔ. <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />Ni bolokolon nara kiti diya, ai kana wuya fɔ a la ko kininkinin kosɔn ka a dɛmɛn.<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />«Ni ai bɛnda ai juu la nisi ri, wala a la sofali ri, mɛn da tunun a ma, ai ye a mira ka wa a ri a tii ma. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />Ni ai ka ai juu yen sila la, a la sofali beni a donin gbilin kɔrɔ, ai kana a to ye. Ai ye ai juu dɛmɛn a la sofali a lawulila.<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />«Bolokolon wa na kiti diya, fɔɔ ka wo la kiti tɛɛ telenbaya la. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" />Ai kana wuya la ai mɔɔɲɔɔ la kiti diya. Ai kana kiti gboya mɔɔ jalakibali la, wala mɔɔ telennin na, ka woilu faa, baa mɛn wa kojuu wo kɛ, n ti nala yafala wo ma. <verse eid="EXO 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />Ai kana surɔfen mira, ka a masɔrɔn surɔfen de ye a kɛla mɔɔilu tɛ sɔn tuɲa yenna. Mɔɔ telenni ye kititɛɛ mɛnilu kɛla, surɔfen ye woilu tiɲanna.<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />«Ai kana londanilu tɔrɔ. Ai jɛrɛ ka a lɔn londanya ye ɲa mɛn ma, baa ai tɛrɛ ye londan de ri Misiran jamana rɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">San wɔrɔnwulana ni lon wɔrɔnwulana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />«Ai ye sɛnɛ kɛ san wɔɔrɔ kɔrɔ, ka lanni kɛ ka suman nadon. <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />Kɔni a san wɔrɔnwulana, ai ye ai la duu wo to ye, ai kana a sɛnɛ. Bolokolon mɛnilu ye ai tɛma, woilu ri balo do sɔrɔn ye, baa suman doilu ri fɛrɛn a jɛrɛ ma. Bolokolonilu fanan wa mɛn to ye, waa rɔ soboilu ri wo dɔɔn. Ai ye wo ɲɔɔn kɛ ai la rɛsɛnfɛilu fanan dɔ, a ni ai la olibiye fɛilu rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />«Baara kɛta mɛn wa kɛ ai ma, ai ye wo kɛ tele wɔɔrɔ kɔrɔ. Kɔni tele wɔrɔnwulana lon, ai kana baara si kɛ. Wo rɔ, ai la nisi ni ai la faliilu ri ii ɲɔɲɔ, a ni i la jɔnmuso la dencɛ ni londan mɛnilu siini ai wara.<verse eid="EXO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />«N ka mɛnilu bɛɛ fɔ ai yɛ, ai ye woilu bɛɛ labato fewu. Ai kana batofen gbɛrɛilu si bonya muumɛ. Mɔɔilu kana woilu tɔɔ mɛn ai da rɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dina sali lon ba sawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />«San san ai ye sali sawa kɛ ka n bonya.<verse eid="EXO 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />«A waati wa se Abibu karo la, ai ye Buru Fununbali Sali kɛ, ka buru fununbali dɔɔn tele wɔrɔnwula kɔrɔ ikomin n ka a fɔ ai yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. Ai ye a kɛ ten, baa ai bɔra Abibu karo le la Misiran. Kɔni ai kana na n bato diya ni niilifen ma na ai bolo. <verse eid="EXO 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />Ai ri Sumanka Sali kɛ san san. Wo tuma, ai ri ai la suman kura fɔlɔilu kɛ saraka ri, ai ra mɛnilu sɔrɔn ai la sɛnɛ rɔ. Ai wa ban sɛnɛ baarala san san ka suman nadon, ai ye Suman Nadon sali kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />San san, ai la cɛɛilu bɛɛ ye na sali sawa ɲin kɛ n ɲakɔrɔ ka n bato, nde mɛn ye ai Maari Allabatala ri.<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />«Ai wa kolofen kɛ saraka ri ka wo jeli di n ma, ai kana buru fanan di n ma, lɛbɛn ye mɛn dɔ. Ai wa kɛ kolofen bɔla n yɛ sali tumana, wo kɛn kana su si. <verse eid="EXO 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />San san ai wa suman kura fɔlɔ mɛnilu ka, ai ye na wo ɲuma ɲumailu ri ai Maari Allabatala a la bon na.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:19">«Ai kana badennin sobo tibi a na nɔnɔ la.»<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla ri a la jama dɛmɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />«N di mɛlɛka lawa ai ma, mɛn di wa ai ɲɛ ka ai lakandan sila la. A ri ai lana jamana rɔ, n ka mɛn dabɛn ai yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" />Ai ye ai tolo malɔ mɛlɛka wo la ka a kumakan mira ka wo kɛ, baa a ye ko bɛɛ kɛla n tɔɔ le rɔ. Ai kana a masɔsɔ. Ni ai ka a sɔsɔ a ti nala yafala ai ma. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />Kɔni ni ai ka ai tolo malɔ a la koɲuma ka n kumakan bɛɛ latelen, ai juuilu ri kɛ n juuilu ri, ai kɛlɛɲɔɔnilu ri kɛ n kɛlɛɲɔɔnilu ri.<verse eid="EXO 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" />«N na mɛlɛka ri wa ai ɲɛfɛ ka ai ladon jamana wo rɔ. Amɔrikailu siini ye, a ni Hɛti bɔnsɔnilu ni Peresikailu ni Kanaankailu ni Hifikailu ni Jebusikailu, kɔni n di woilu halaki. <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />Ai kana i majii ii la batofenilu ɲɛ ka woilu bato. Ai kana i ladɛn ii la dina ko kɛɲailu rɔ. Ai ye ii la batofen bisikilu ratiɲan fewu. Ai ye ii la kaba lalɔni batotailu rakadikadi. <verse eid="EXO 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" />Ni ai ka ai Maari Allabatala bato, n di balo ɲuma ni ji siyaman di ai ma, ka jankarɔ mabɔ ai la. <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />Ai muso si kɔnɔ ti tiɲan ai la jamana rɔ. Muso si tɛ kɛ densɔrɔnbali ri. N di si jan di ai ma ka ai sabati.<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />«N di a kɛ, jamanailu bɛɛ mɔɔilu wa ai na ko mɛn, ii ri silan kosɛbɛ. Ai wa se yɔrɔ yɔrɔ, ye mɔɔilu ri kɔndafili ai ɲɛ kojuuya. Ai juuilu bɛɛ ri i bori ai ɲɛ. <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />N di dondoli kunbailu lawa ai ɲɛ ka Hifikailu ni Kanaankailu ni Hɛti bɔnsɔnilu gbɛn. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" />Kɔni n ti nala woilu gbɛnna ai ɲɛ san kelen kɔrɔ, sa jamana rakolon kana to, baa waa rɔ soboilu kana siyaya ai ma ka ai tɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />N di to mɔɔilu gbɛnna ai ɲɛ dɔɔnin dɔɔnin haan ai ye siyaya ka jamana wo bɛɛ mira ka a kɛ ai ta ri. <verse eid="EXO 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" />N di ai la jamana dan sii. A dan di bɔ Kɔɔji Fararɔbin ma ka wa se fɔɔ Filisitiilu la kɔɔji ma, ka bɔ Sinayi kiɲɛ fufu ma ka wa se fɔɔ Efirati Ba ma. N di jamana wo duurenilu don ai bolo, ka ii gbɛn ai ɲɛ. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />Ai kana teriya don ai ni woilu tɛma, wala ai ni ii la batofenilu tɛma. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" />Ai kana sɔn mɔɔ woilu ye i sii ai la jamana kɔndɔ sani ii ri ai lɔ nde Allabatala hakɛ tala, baa ni ai ka ii la batofenilu bato, a ri kɛ ikomin ai ra mira miralifen na.»<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s">Allabatala ka teriya sidi Isirayɛlika yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye na yɛlɛ koyinkɛ kan ka i madon n na, i ni Haruna ni Nadabu ni Abihu ni Isirayɛlika mɔɔbakɔrɔ biwɔrɔnwula (70). Ai kana ai madon bakɛ ka yɔrɔ janin to an tɛma ka ai tinbirin ka nde bato. <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />Wo kɔ rɔ, ile kelen ye yɛlɛ koyinkɛ kun tɛma, ka i madon n na. A tɔilu kana na i madon n na. Jama fanan kana yɛlɛ koyinkɛ kan i kɔfɛ.»<verse eid="EXO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Musa wara ka Allabatala la kuma ni jamariliilu bɛɛ lase jama ma. Mɔɔ bɛɛ ladɛnnin ka a fɔ ko: «Allabatala ka mɛn fɔ, an di woilu bɛɛ kɛ.» <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Allabatala tun ka kuma mɛnilu fɔ, Musa ka wo bɛɛ sɛbɛ. Wo duu sa gbɛ, Musa wulira sɔɔma jonna ka saraka bɔ diya lɔ koyinkɛ kɔrɔ, ka ban ka kaba tan ni fila lalɔ, Isirayɛlika la kabila kelen kaba kelen. <verse eid="EXO 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />A ka Isirayɛlika kanberen doilu lɔ saraka janintailu a ni jususuma saraka bɔla. Ii ka saraka janintailu bɔ ka woilu kɛ buuri ri, ka tora doilu bɔ ka woilu kɛ duɲɔɔya saraka ri Allabatala yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Musa ka saraka woilu jeli rafara fila ri, ka fan kelen kɛ bafata kɔndɔ, ka fan kelen sadisadi saraka bɔ diya kan. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Alla tun ka teriya mɛn sidi ii yɛ, Musa ka wo kitabu ta ka a karan kan ba la jama ɲana. Jama ka a fɔ ko: «Allabatala ka mɛnilu fɔ, an di woilu bɛɛ latelen.»<verse eid="EXO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" />Musa tun ka jeli mɛn kɛ muran kɔndɔ, a ka wo ta ka a sadisadi mɔɔilu kan. A ka a fɔ ko: «Allabatala ka teriya mɛn sidi a ni ai tɛ jamarili ɲinilu fɛ, jeli ɲin de ye wo siila.»<verse eid="EXO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Nba, Musa ni Haruna wara yɛlɛ koyinkɛ kan, a ni Nadabu ni Abihu ni Isirayɛlika mɔɔbakɔrɔ biwɔrɔnwula (70). <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" />Ii ka Isirayɛlika Maari Alla yen. Fen do tɛrɛ ye a sen kɔrɔ. A kɛni ikomin wo rabɛnni kuru bulemanilu le rɔ, mɛnilu tɔɔ ko safiri. Woilu nɔɔrɔ tɛrɛ ye ikomin san jɛrɛ nɔɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" />Alla ma kojuu kɛ Isirayɛlika la ɲɛmɔɔ woilu la. Ii ka Alla yen, ka dɔɔnnin kɛ ka ii min ye.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa mɛnda koyinkɛ kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye yɛlɛ koyinkɛ kan, ka na i madon n na ka to ye. N di kaba walanilu don i bolo, n na sariya jamariliilu sɛbɛni mɛnilu kan, sa i ri jama karan woilu la.»<verse eid="EXO 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" />Musa ni a dɛmɛnba Josuwe wulira bɔ kanma ye. Musa yɛlɛra Alla la koyinkɛ kan. <verse eid="EXO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Kɔni sani a ye bɔ ɲɛmɔɔilu fɛ, a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye an makɔnɔ yan, haan an wa na. Haruna ni Huri ri to ai fɛ. Ni sɔsɔli su su donda mɔɔilu tɛma, ii ye wa Haruna ni Huri tɛrɛn.»<verse eid="EXO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15" />Awa, Musa yɛlɛra koyinkɛ kan tuma mɛn na, duru munuɲa ka koyinkɛ latunun. <verse eid="EXO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16" />Allabatala la gbiliya jiira Sinayi koyinkɛ kan ka to ye. Duru munuɲa ka koyinkɛ latunun tele wɔɔrɔ kɔrɔ. A tele wɔrɔnwulana ma, Allabatala tora banda rɔ ka Musa kili. <verse eid="EXO 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" />Isirayɛlika mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye daa makɛ diya, woilu ka Allabatala la gbiliya yen koyinkɛ kun na. Wo kɛni ii ɲana ikomin ta ba ra koyinkɛ kun mira. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Musa donda duru munuɲa rɔ, a yɛlɛra koyinkɛ kun tɛma. A ka su binaanin (40) ni tele binaanin (40) kɛ ye.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s">Isirayɛlika ye niilifen mɛnilu bɔla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" />«I ye a fɔ Isirayɛlika yɛ ko ii ye na niilifenilu di n ma. Mɔɔ mɔɔ ye a fɛ ka fen do di, i ye wo mira n yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />Ii la niilifenilu ka kan ka kɛ mɛnilu ri, woilu le ɲin: sanin, wodigbɛ, sulanɛɛ, <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />kari buleman, kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ, kari wulenman kadikadi, a ni makisali ɲuma, baa si, <verse eid="EXO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />a ni saaji gbolo kolone wulenman ni gbolo kolonin ɲuma <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sobo su gbɛrɛilu mɛn sɛbɛni yan wo kɔrɔ ye sobo su mɛn ye kɔɔji rɔ</char></note>su gbɛrɛilu ni kasiya jiri. <verse eid="EXO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />Ii ye na olibiye tulu ri, mɛn di kɛ fitinailu rɔ. Ii ye na sumadiyalanilu fanan di, mɛnilu ri kɛ wusulan ni suwandili tulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Suwandili tulu wo ye kɛla mɔɔ wala fen kan ka woilu bila a dan na Allabatala yɛ. </char></note> rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" />Kabakuru mɛn tɔɔ ko onikisi, ai ye na wo ri, a ni kuru ragbɛlɛn gbɛrɛilu. Kaba woilu ri kara n sarakalasela la kɔkanbila durukini kan, a ni a la sisirɔ bɔrɔni kan. <verse eid="EXO 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" />Isirayɛlikailu ye faaninbon sɛniman do ladan n yɛ, sa n di n daa makɛ ii tɛma. <verse eid="EXO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />N di n daa makɛ faaninbon wo ni a kɔndɔ fenilu sawura yiraka i la. I ri a bɛɛ ladan ikomin sawura wo ye ɲa mɛn ma.»<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Teriya tɔɔmasere kankira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />«Ai ye teriya tɔɔmasere kankira ladan kasiya jiri rɔ. A yanyan ye kɛ nunkan ɲa fila ni tala ri, a kɔndɔ ye kɛ nunkan ɲa kelen ni tala ri, a lɔ ye kɛ nunkan ɲa kelen ni tala ri. <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Ai ye sanin jɛrɛwolo la a kɔndɔla ni a kɔkanna bɛɛ kan ka a jiri bɛɛ latunun. Ai ye a da kirinkirin bɛɛ kɛ sanin di. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Ai ye sanin gbarangbaran naanin nadan, ka woilu bila kankira sen naanin na, sen kelen gbarangbaran kelen. Wo rɔ, gbarangbaran fila ri kɛ kankira fan kelen fɛ, a tɔ fila ri kɛ fan kelen do fɛ. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />Ai ye gbelekeilu rabɛn kasiya jiri rɔ, ka sanin la woilu ma ka a jiri bɛɛ latunun. <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />Ai ye woilu don gbarangbaranilu rɔ teriya tɔɔmasere kankira fan fila bɛɛ rɔ, sa kankira ri se madoninna. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" />Gbeleke woilu donni ye to gbarangbaranilu rɔ. Ai kana woilu labɔ. <verse eid="EXO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />N kɛtɔ sereya mɛn sɛbɛla, i ye wo bila teriya tɔɔmasere kankira kɔndɔ.<verse eid="EXO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" />«Ai ye julumun kafari dalatuun nadan sanin jɛrɛwolo la. A yanyan ye kɛ nunkan ɲa fila ni tala ri. A kɔndɔ ye kɛ nunkan ɲa kelen ni tala ri. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />Ai ri serubɛn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Serubɛn ye Alla la mɛlɛka su do le ri.</char></note> bisiki kelen kelen nadan dalatuun na a kun fila la. Ai ri woilu ladan sanin gbasinin dɔ. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />Ai ye serubɛn bisiki kelen nadan kankira datuun na a kun kelen na, ka a tɔ kelen nadan dalatuun kun do wo la. Serubɛn bisiki fila ni kankira dalatuun bɛɛ ye ladan ka a kɛ fen kelen di. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />Serubɛn sawura fila ri ɲabɛn ɲɔɔn ma, ka ii ɲa lɔni to julumun kafari datuun na. Ii kawailu ri layɛlɛ san ma, ka birin kankira datuun na kun na. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />N kɛtɔ kaba walan fila mɛn dila ile ma, i ri woilu bila teriya tɔɔmasere kankira kɔndɔ ka a dalatuun ii ma. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" />N kɛtɔ n jɛrɛ yirakala i la teriya tɔɔmasere kankira datuun na sanma ye, serubɛn bisiki fila tɛma. N ye a fɛ Isirayɛlikailu ye taama ɲa mɛn ma, n di wo sariyailu bɛɛ di i ma ye le.»<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla daa makɛ faaninbon tabali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />«Awa, ai ye tabali kelen nadan kasiya jiri rɔ. A yanyan ye kɛ nunkan ɲa fila ri, a kɔndɔ ye kɛ nunkan ɲa kelen di, a lɔ ye kɛ nunkan ɲa kelen ni tala ri. <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Ai ye sanin jɛrɛwolo la tabali wo bɛɛ ma ka jiri bɛɛ latunun, ka a da kirinkirin bɛɛ kɛ sanin di. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />Ai ye gbingbiilu kankan tabali la tabali fan bɛɛ la. Gbingbi woilu bonya ri bɛn bolo koyini naanin bonya ma. Ai ye sanin manyɛrɛ la gbingbi woilu ma. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />Ai ye gbarangbaran naanin nadan sanin dɔ, ka woilu kelen kelenna don tabali tonkon naanin na a sen kelen kelenna dafɛ. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Gbarangbaranilu ye lasudunya fɛrɛnilu la. Tabali ta gbelekeilu ri don gbarangbaran woilu rɔ sa tabali ri se madoninna. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />Ai ye gbeleke fila ladan kasiya jiri rɔ, ka sanin la woilu kan ka jiri bɛɛ latunun. Gbeleke woilu ri kɛ tabali madoninfenilu ri. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Muran mɛnilu ri bila tabali kan, ai ye woilu ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo la. Wo doilu ri kɛ ikomin pileti ni kalamailu ni jilafɛilu ni daailu. N sarakalaselailu ri rɛsɛnji kɛ bafata woilu kɔndɔ ka a labɔn ka a kɛ niilifen di. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" />Saraka buru ri bila tabali ɲin kan. Saraka buru ka kan ka kɛ n ɲakɔrɔ ye tuma bɛɛ.»<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fitinasiifen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />«Ai ye fitinasiifen ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo gbasinin dɔ. A sen ni a kala ye kɛ fen kelen di, a ni a fitinasii daaninilu ni a kuruilu ni a fɛrɛn bisikilu bɛɛ. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Bolon wɔɔrɔ ri bɔ a kala ma. Bolon sawa ri kɛ bolokinin fɛ, bolon sawa ri kɛ bolomaran fɛ. <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />Ai ye daani sawa ladan bolon kelen kelenna bɛɛ la, ka woilu kɛ amande<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amande ye jiriden dɔɔnta le ri.</char></note> jiriden munuɲa ri, bɛɛ ni a kuruilu, bɛɛ ni a fɛrɛnilu. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Ai ye daani naanin nadan fitinasiifen kala la, ka woilu fanan kɛ amande jiriden munuɲa ri, bɛɛ ni a kuruilu, bɛɛ ni a fɛrɛnilu. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Bolon fila fila ye farala kala la yɔrɔ sawa mɛnilu rɔ, ai ye kuru kelen nadan kala la yɔrɔ woilu kelen kelenna bɛɛ kɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Fitinasiifen ni a kuruilu ni a bolonilu bɛɛ ri i ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo gbasinin dɔ. Wo bɛɛ ye kɛ fen kelen di.<verse eid="EXO 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" />«Ai ye fitina wɔrɔnwula ladan ka woilu sii fitinasiifen kan, sa ii ri a ɲɛfɛla layelen. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />Ai ye fitina rabɔfenilu ni buurigbɛ kɛ fenilu ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />Fitinasiifen ni a muranilu bɛɛ ye ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo kilo bisawa (30) la. <verse eid="EXO 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" />Musa, i ye a kɛ koɲuma. I ye baara ɲin bɛɛ kɛ ka a bɛn sawura ma, mɛn ye yirakala i la koyinkɛ kan yan.»<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s">Alla daa makɛ faaninbon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />«Ai ye n daa makɛ faaninbon nadan faanin jan tan na. Faanin woilu ye kɛ makisali ɲuma ri, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi ye mɛn na. Mɛn kusan faanin sɔɔla kosɛbɛ, wo ye serubɛn sawurailu ta ii kan. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Faanin tan woilu bɛɛ ye kanya. Ii yanyan ye kɛ nunkan ɲa muwan ni seyin (28) di. Ii kɔndɔ ye kɛ nunkan ɲa naanin (4) di. <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />Ai ye faanin loolu kara i ɲɔɔn na, ka a tɔ loolu fanan kara i ɲɔɔn na. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" />Faanin loolu mɛn karani i ɲɔɔn na, ai ye wooyanilu bila faanin looluna wo dagbolo la. Ai ye wo ɲɔɔn kɛ faanin tɔ loolu fanan na, mɛnilu karani i ɲɔɔn na. Ai ye ton woilu ladan kari buleman dɔ, <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />ka wooyan biloolu biloolu (50) bila faanin fila wo dagbolo la, ka ii ɲa bɛn i ɲɔɔn ma. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Ai ye sanin fendamirafen biloolu (50) ladan, ka woilu kelen kelenna bɛɛ don wooyan fila fila rɔ ka faanin fila woilu tuun i ɲɔɔn na. Wo rɔ, faaninbon muumɛ ri tuun i ɲɔɔn na ka kɛ fen kelen di.<verse eid="EXO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />«Ai ye faanin jan tan ni kelen (11) nadan baa si la, ka ii kɛ faaninbon kunnabirin di. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Faanin tan ni kelen woilu bɛɛ ye kanya. Ii yanyan ye kɛ nunkan ɲa bisawa (30) ri. Ii kɔndɔ ye kɛ nunkan ɲa naanin di. <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />Ai ye faanin loolu kara i ɲɔɔn na, ka faanin tɔ wɔɔrɔ kara i ɲɔɔn na. Faanin wɔɔrɔna ye rakunbɛn fila ri kunnabirin wo ɲɛfɛla rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Faanin loolu mɛnilu karani i ɲɔɔn na, ai ye wooyan biloolu (50) bila faanin wo looluna dagbolo la. Faanin tɔ wɔɔrɔ mɛnilu fanan karani i ɲɔɔn na, ai ye ton biloolu (50) bila wo wɔɔrɔna dagbolo la. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />Ai ye sulanɛɛ fendamirafen biloolu (50) ladan, ka woilu don faaninilu wooyanilu rɔ. Wo rɔ, faaninilu ri tuun i ɲɔɔn na ka kɛ fen kelen di. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />Faanin tan ni kelen (11) wo yanyan ri tamin bon yanyan kan. Faanin kelen talantɛ mɛn di to, ai ye a to wo ye jii bon kɔfɛ. <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Faanin tan ni kelen (11) wo bonya ri tamin bon bonya kan fanan. Faanin nunkan ɲa kelen di to faanin fan fila bɛɛ fɛ. Ai ye a to wo ye jii bon fan fila bɛɛ fɛ ka a bɛɛ datuun.<verse eid="EXO 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />«Ai ye faaninbon kunnabirin nadan saaji gboloilu la, mɛnilu ra wulen, ka kunnabirin gbɛrɛ fanan nadan gbolo kolonin ɲumailu su gbɛrɛ la. Kunnabirin filana wo ri la saaji gbolo ta kan ka to a san fɛ.<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />«Ai ye kasiya jiriilu ta ka faaninbon damira jiriilu ladan, mɛnilu ri lalɔ ka faaninbon mira. <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />Woilu kelen kelenna bɛɛ yanyan ye kɛ nunkan ɲa tan di. Ii bonya ye kɛ nunkan ɲa kelen ni tala ri. <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />Ai ye tɛmala jiri fila bila jiri woilu tɛma, ka tɛmala jiri woilu ɲabɛn i ɲɔɔn ma. Faaninbon damira jiriilu bɛɛ ye ladan wo ɲa. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18-19" />Faaninbon damira jiri muwan (20) di lalɔ faaninbon tele kankan bolokinin dɔ. Ai ye woilu ladan, ka wodigbɛ siifenju binaanin (40) fanan nadan, mɛnilu bilatɔ damira jiri woilu ju kɔrɔ, damira jiri kelen siifenju fila, baa sen fila mɛnilu ye damira jiriilu bɛɛ ma, woilu bɛɛ ye don siifenju rɔ, sen kelen siifenju kelen. <verse eid="EXO 26:18-19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20-21" />Faaninbon damira jiri muwan (20) di lalɔ faaninbon tele kankan bolomaran dɔ fanan. Ai ye woilu ladan, ka wodigbɛ siifenju binaanin (40) fanan nadan, jiri kelen siifenju fila. <verse eid="EXO 26:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />Faaninbon damira jiri wɔɔrɔ (6) ri lalɔ faaninbon telebe rɔ, bon kɔ ma kɔnin. Ai ye woilu ladan, <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />ka jiri fila fanan nadan, mɛnilu ri lalɔ bon kɔ ma ka kɛ faaninbon tonkonilu ri. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />Tonkon jiri fila ɲinilu bɛɛ ye ladan jiri fila fila la, mɛnilu tansanni duu ma ka bɛn i ɲɔɔn ma san fɛ. Jiri fila kunilu ri mira i ɲɔɔn na koyina kelen na. Ai ye tonkon jiri fila bɛɛ ladan ten. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Wo rɔ, faaninbon damira jiri seyin (8) kɛtɔ lalɔla le bon kɔfɛ la bɛɛ rɔ. Wodigbɛ siifenju tan ni wɔɔrɔ (16) kɛtɔ bilala woilu kɔrɔ, jiri kelen siifenju fila.<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />«Ai ye gbeleke ladan kasiya jiri rɔ, mɛnilu ri kankan faaninbon damira jiriilu kan ka woilu ramira. Gbeleke loolu ri kankan faaninbon fan kelen damira jiriilu kan. <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />Gbeleke loolu ri kankan faaninbon fan do damira jiriilu kan. Gbeleke loolu fanan di kankan faaninbon kɔfɛ la damira jiriilu kan, bon telebe fan fɛ kɔnin. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Kankan gbeleke mɛnilu ri kɛ gbeleke loolu loolu woilu tɛma ta ri, ai ye woilu ladan sa ii ri bɔ faaninbon fan kelen tonkon do la ka wa se fan wo tonkon do ma. Ii ri don sanin koyinailu rɔ damira jiriilu talantɛ rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Ai ye sanin la faaninbon damira jiriilu kan ka jiri bɛɛ latunun, ka sanin la gbeleke kankantailu fanan kan ka jiri bɛɛ latunun. Ai ye sanin gbarangbaranilu ladan ka woilu kɛ faaninbon damira jiriilu ma. Gbeleke kankantailu ri don woilu rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />Nba, Musa, n ka mɛn yiraka i la koyinkɛ kan yan, i ye n na faaninbon lɔ ka a bɛn wo ma.<verse eid="EXO 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />«Ai ye bon tatɛɛfaanin nadan makisali ɲuma la, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi. Mɔɔ mɛn kusan faanin sɔɔla kosɛbɛ, wo ri serubɛn sawurailu ta a kan. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Ai ye tatɛɛfaanin dun tarama naanin nadan kasiya jiri la, ka sanin la woilu kan ka jiri bɛɛ latunun. Ai ye sanin sɔɔlanilu kɛ tarama woilu la, ka tarama sii wodigbɛ siifenju naanin kan, tarama kelen siifenju kelen. Ai ye tatɛɛfaanin dun sɔɔlan woilu la. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" />Ai ye tatɛɛfaanin wo dun taramailu la fendamirafenilu kɔrɔ, ka teriya tɔɔmasere kankira sii faanin kɔfɛ. Faanin wo ri kɛ yɔrɔ sɛniman ni yɔrɔ sɛniman fisamantɛ danna fara bɔ ri. <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" />Ai ye julumun kafari dalatuun sii teriya tɔɔmasere kankira kan yɔrɔ sɛniman fisamantɛ kɔndɔ. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />Ai ye tabali sii tatɛɛfaanin ɲɛfɛ faaninbon tele kankan bolomaran fan fɛ, ka fitinasiifen lɔ faaninbon tele kankan bolokinin fan fɛ ka a ɲabɛn tabali la.<verse eid="EXO 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />«Faanin mɛn di dun faaninbon donda la, ai ye wo ladan makisali ɲuma la, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi. Mɛn kusan faanin sɔɔla, wo ye a sɔɔ ka a ɲa. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />Ai ye kasiya jiri loolu ladan, ka sanin la woilu kan ka jiri bɛɛ latunun. Ai ye sulanɛɛ siifenju loolu ladan, jiri kelen siifenju kelen. Ai ye sanin sɔɔlanilu kɛ jiriilu la, ka donda faanin dun woilu la.»<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s">Sarakabɔdiya ladan ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />«Ai ye saraka bɔ diya kelen nadan kasiya jiri rɔ, ka a lɔ kɛ nunkan ɲa sawa ri. A fan naanin bɛɛ ye kanya, ka a bonya ni a yanyan bɛɛ kɛ nunkan ɲa loolu ri. <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" />Ai ye saraka bɔ diya tonkon kelen kelenna bɛɛ ladan ka ii kɛ kolofen kere la munuɲa ri. Ai ye sulanɛɛ la saraka bɔ diya yɔrɔ bɛɛ kan, ka a jiri bɛɛ latunun. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />Ai ye buurigbɛ kɛ muranilu ladan, a ni buurigbɛ ta fenilu ni jeli kɛ bafatailu ni sobo sɔɔlanilu ni takisɛ kɛ fenilu. Ai ye saraka bɔ diya muran woilu bɛɛ ladan sulanɛɛ la. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Ai ye sulanɛɛ sansan nadan, ka sulanɛɛ koyina kelen kelen nadan a tonkon naanin na. <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />Ai ye sulanɛɛ sansan wo la dagbolo kɔrɔ saraka bɔ diya kɔndɔ, sa a ri bɔ saraka bɔ diya ju kɔrɔ kosa a ye se a lɔ tɛmala rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />Ai ye gbelekeilu rabɛn kasiya jiri rɔ saraka bɔ diya madonnin kanma, ka sulanɛɛ la woilu yɔrɔ bɛɛ kan. <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />Ai wa kɛ saraka bɔ diya madoninna, ai ri gbeleke woilu don sulanɛɛ gbarangbaranilu rɔ saraka bɔ diya fan fila bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />Ai ye saraka bɔ diya lɔ jiri fɛrɛnilu la ka a kɔndɔ rakolon to. Ii ye a lɔ ikomin n ka a yiraka i la ɲa mɛn ma ka i to koyinkɛ kan yan.»<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla daa makɛ faaninbon lukɔndɔla laminin ɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />«Awa, ai ye n daa makɛ faaninbon naminin makisali ɲuma le la ka lukɔndɔla labɔ. Faaninbon tele kankan bolokinin fan fɛ, faanin yanyan ri kɛ nunkan ɲa kɛmɛ (100) ri. <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />Faanin woilu ri damira tarama muwan (20) bolo, mɛnilu siini sulanɛɛ siifenju muwan (20) kan. Wodigbɛ sɔɔlanilu ni faanindun wodigbɛ koyinailu ye kɛ taramailu ma. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Faaninbon tele kankan bolomaran fan fanan ye rabɛn wo ɲa kelen ma. A laminin faaninilu yanyan ye kɛ nunkan ɲa kɛmɛ (100) ri. Faanin woilu ri damira tarama muwan (20) bolo, mɛnilu kelen kelenna bɛɛ siini a sulanɛɛ siifenju kan. Wodigbɛ sɔɔlanilu ni faanindun wodigbɛ koyinailu ye kɛ taramailu ma. <verse eid="EXO 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />Faaninbon telebe fan fɛ, faanin yanyan ye kɛ nunkan ɲa biloolu (50) ri. Faanin woilu ri damira tarama tan bolo, mɛnilu kelen kelenna bɛɛ siini a siifenju kan. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Faaninbon telebɔ fan fɛ, faanin yanyan ye kɛ nunkan ɲa biloolu (50) ri. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14-15" />Lukɔndɔla donda ri kɛ fan wo fɛ. Donda fan fila bɛɛ fɛ, faaninilu yanyan ri kɛ nunkan ɲa tan ni loolu ri. Faanin woilu ri damira tarama sawa sawa bolo, mɛnilu kelen kelenna bɛɛ siini a siifenju kan. <verse eid="EXO 27:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />Faanin mɛn di bila lu donda jɛrɛ la, wo yanyan ye kɛ nunkan ɲa muwan (20) di. Mɛn kusan faanin sɔɔ la, wo ye faanin wo rabɛn makisali ɲuma la, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi. Faanin wo ri damira tarama naanin bolo, mɛnilu kelen kelenna bɛɛ siini a siifenju kan. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Wodigbɛ sɔɔlanilu ni faanindun wodigbɛ koyinailu ye kɛ lukɔndɔla laminin taramailu bɛɛ ma. Woilu kelen kelenna bɛɛ ye sii a sulanɛɛ siifenju kan. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Lukɔndɔla yanyan ye kɛ nunkan ɲa kɛmɛ (100) ri. A bonya ye kɛ nunkan ɲa biloolu (50) ri. A laminin faaninilu lɔ ye kɛ nunkan ɲa loolu ri. Woilu ye ladan makisali ɲuma la. Tarama siifenju ye dan sulanɛɛ la. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Faaninbon muranilu bɛɛ ye ladan sulanɛɛ la. Faaninbon ni a laminin faaninilu ri sidi bɔlɔ mɛnilu la duu ma, woilu fanan ye kɛ sulanɛɛ ri.»<verse eid="EXO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tulu mɛn di kɛ fitinailu kɔndɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />«I ye Isirayɛlikailu jamari ko ii ye na olibiye tulu ɲuma ɲuma ri, sa fitinailu ri se lamɛlɛnna waati bɛɛ. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" />Haruna ni a dencɛilu ye fitinasiifen sii n daa makɛ faaninbon kɔndɔ. Ii ri a sii tatɛɛfaanin ɲɛfɛ, teriya tɔɔmasere kankira siini mɛn kɔfɛ kɔnin. Fitinailu ye mɛlɛn n ɲakɔrɔ ye lon lon ka bɔ wura fɛ fɔɔ sɔɔma da la. Sariya le wo ri, Isirayɛlikailu ka kan ka mɛn nataama haan ka wa kadawu.»<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s">Alla la sarakalaselailu la faanin dontailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />Alla ka a fɔ ko: «Musa, i ye i kɔrɔcɛ Haruna kili ko a ye na, a ni a dencɛilu Nadabu ni Abihu ni Elasari ni Itamari. I ri ii bɔ Isirayɛlikailu rɔ ka ii bila a dan na, sa ii ri kɛ n sarakalaselailu ri ka wo baara kɛ n yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" />Ai ri faanin ɲuma ɲuma kara i kɔrɔcɛ Haruna yɛ, mɛn di bonya di a ma. Faanin wo ri kɛ fen sɛniman di. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" />Mɛnilu kusan karalila kosɛbɛ, n ka wo famunyali di mɛnilu ma kɔnin, i ye woilu kili. I ye a fɔ ii yɛ ko ii ye Haruna la faaninilu kara, a ri mɛnilu bila a kan na a lasii lon. Wo kɔ rɔ, a ri woilu bila a kan na ka n saraka baara kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />Ii ye sisirɔ bɔrɔni ni kɔkanbila durukini kara, a ni durukiba ni wo duruki kɔrɔbila sɔɔni ni jalamu ni tɛsidilan. Ii ye faanin sɛniman woilu kara i kɔrɔcɛ Haruna ni a dencɛilu yɛ, baa woilu ri n na sarakalasela baara kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />Ii ye faanin woilu kara makisali ɲuma la, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi la, a ni sanin na.<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />«Mɛnilu kusan bololabaara kɛla kosɛbɛ, woilu ye kɔkanbila durukinin nadan. Ii ye a ladan makisali ɲuma la, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi la, a ni sanin na. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />Kanbankun julu kelen kelen ye kɛ kɔkanbila durukini tonkon fila la, sa a ɲɛfɛla yɔrɔ ni a kɔfɛla yɔrɔ ri se tuunna i ɲɔɔn na. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Ii ye tɛsidilan sɔɔni ɲuma kɛ kɔkanbila durukini la. Tɛsidilan ni kɔkanbila durukini ri kɛ fen kelen di. Ii baaraɲa fanan ye kanya. Ii ye tɛsidilan nadan makisali ɲuma la, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi la, a ni sanin na. <verse eid="EXO 28:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9-10" />Kabakuru mɛn tɔɔ ko onikisi, ai ye wo kabakudun fila ta ka Isirayɛli dencɛilu tɔɔ sɛbɛ woilu kan ka bɛn ii si kasabi ma. Ai ye tɔɔ wɔɔrɔ sɛbɛ kabakudun fɔlɔ kan, ka a tɔ wɔɔrɔ sɛbɛ kabakudun filana kan. <verse eid="EXO 28:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11" />Ai ye Isirayɛli dencɛilu tɔɔ sɛbɛ kabakudun fila woilu kan ikomin sɛbɛli ye kɛla kabakudun kan ɲa mɛn ma ka a kɛ ɲanɔɔ ri. Wo kɔ rɔ, ai ye kabakudun fila wo don sanin fendamirafenilu rɔ, kabakudun kelen fendamirafen kelen. <verse eid="EXO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12" />Wo wa kɛ, ai ye ii bila kɔkanbila durukini kanbankun julu fila la. Kabakudun woilu ri kɛ hankili bila fenilu ri Isirayɛlikailu la ko rɔ. Haruna wa faanin wo don, Isirayɛlikailu tɔɔ ri kɛ a kanbankun kan ka kɛ hankili bila fen di nde Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13" />Ai ye sanin fendamirafen fila ladan, kabakudun fila wo ri bila mɛnilu rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14" />Wo wa kɛ, ai ye sanin jɔlɔkɔ fila ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo la. Ai ye woilu mɔrɔmɔrɔ ikomin julukisɛ ye mɔrɔmɔrɔla ɲa mɛn ma, ka ban ka ii nara kabakudun woilu fendamirafenilu ma.»<verse eid="EXO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sisirɔ bɔrɔni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" />«Mɛn kusan bololabaara kɛla kosɛbɛ, wo ye ko latɛɛ sisirɔ bɔrɔni ladan. A ye a ladan sanin na, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi la, a ni makisali ɲuma la ikomin kɔkanbila durukini. <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />A wa lakadi ka a la ɲɔɔn kan a fan naanin bɛɛ ri kanya. A yanyan ni a bonya bɛɛ ri kɛ sinbiri ɲa kelen di. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />A ye a masidi kabakudun sɔnkɔgbɛlɛnilu la, ka woilu nara a la safa naanin na. A safa fɔlɔ ye kɛ saridiwan kuru ri, a ni topase kuru ni emerada kuru. <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />A safa filana ye kɛ karibunkili kuru ri, a ni safiri kuru ni jaman kuru. <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />A safa sawana ye kɛ jasinti kuru ri, a ni akate kuru ni ametisi kuru. <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />A safa naaninna ye kɛ kirisaliti kuru ri, a ni onikisi kuru ni jasipe kuru. Kuru woilu bɛɛ ye don sanin fendamirafenilu rɔ, kuru kelen fendamirafen kelen. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Kabakuru bɛɛ ladɛnnin ye kɛ tan ni fila ri, ka a bɛn Isirayɛlikailu la kabilailu jate ma. Ii tɔɔilu ye sɛbɛ nɛɛ la kabakudunilu kan, kabakudun kelen tɔɔ kelen. Tɔɔilu ye sɛbɛ ikomin tɔɔ ye sɛbɛla ɲa mɛn ma ɲanɔɔ kan.<verse eid="EXO 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22" />«Ai ye sanin jɔlɔkɔ fila ladan, mɛnilu ri bila sisirɔ bɔrɔni la. Ai ye ii ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo la, ka ii mɔrɔmɔrɔ ikomin julukisɛ ye mɔrɔmɔrɔla ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23" />Ai ye sanin gbarangbaran fila ladan, ka ii sidi sisirɔ bɔrɔni sanfɛ tonkon fila la. <verse eid="EXO 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24" />Ai ye sanin jɔlɔkɔ woilu kunilu don gbarangbaran kelen kelenna rɔ sisirɔ bɔrɔni tonkon fila la, <verse eid="EXO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25" />ka ii kun gbɛrɛilu don fendamirafenilu la, ni a ye kanbankun julu fila la kɔkanbila durukini ɲɛfɛla rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />Ai ye sanin gbarangbaran fila gbɛrɛ ladan ka woilu sidi sisirɔ bɔrɔni kɔfɛ yɔrɔ la a duuma fan tonkon fila la. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />Ai ye sanin gbarangbaran fila gbɛrɛ ladan ka woilu sidi kɔkanbila durukini kanbankun julu fila ɲɛfɛla la. Ai ye ii sidi julu woilu ju kɔrɔ kara diya dafɛ tɛsidilan kun dɔ. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Ai ye sisirɔ bɔrɔni gbarangbaranilu ni kɔkanbila durukini gbarangbaranilu bila i ɲɔɔn ma juluɲala bule la, sa sisirɔ bɔrɔni ri to a nɔ rɔ kɔkanbila durukini kan tɛsidilan kun dɔ.<verse eid="EXO 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" />«Haruna wa kɛ donna yɔrɔ sɛniman kɔndɔ tuma tuma, ko latɛɛ sisirɔ bɔrɔni ri kɛ a sɔn kan. Isirayɛli dencɛilu tɔɔ sɛbɛni kuruilu kan bɔrɔni wo kan. Tɔɔ woilu ri kɛ hankilibilafen di nde Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ kadawu. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" />I ye Urima ni Tumima bila sisirɔ bɔrɔni kɔndɔ, sa ii ri kɛ Haruna jusu kan a don tuma Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ yɔrɔ sɛniman kɔndɔ. Urima ni Tumima ye n kiti ɲinin fenilu le ri Isirayɛlikailu bolo. Haruna wa na a lɔ Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ tuma tuma yɔrɔ sɛniman kɔndɔ, fo woilu ye kɛ a sɔn kan.»<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla sarakalaselailu la faanin tɔilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />«Awa, Haruna ri kɔkanbila durukini bila durukiba mɛn kan, ai ye wo bɛɛ ladan faanin buleman na. <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />Ai ye kun don woo bɔ a tɛmala rɔ, ka faanin gbiliman kara woo laminin dɔ ka a kɛ dagbolo ri, sa durukiba ti nala farala. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Ai ye kerenati jiridenilu sawura ta kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi la durukiba sen kɔrɔlailu dagbolo muumɛ kan. Ai ye sanin talan denninilu bila bila jiridenilu sawura tɛma. <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />Sanin talan dennin kelen ye tuun kerenati jiriden sawura kelen kelenna bɛɛ la dagbolo muumɛ kan. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Haruna wa wuli n na sarakalasela baara kɛla, fo a ye durukiba wo bila a kan na. A don tuma ni a bɔ tuma yɔrɔ sɛniman kɔndɔ nde Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ, talan mɛnilu ye durukiba dagbolo la, woilu mankan di bɔ. Wo ɲa ma, Haruna ti nala faala.<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />«Ai ye saninfɛdɛ do ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo la, ka sɛbɛli do kɛ a ka a fɔ ko: ‹A bilanin a dan na Allabatala yɛ.› Ai ye wo sɛbɛ ikomin sɛbɛli ye kɛla tɔɔ ɲanɔɔ kan ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />I ye saninfɛdɛ wo sidi bitiran ɲɛfɛla rɔ julu buleman na. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" />Wo le rɔ, Haruna wa don yɔrɔ sɛniman kɔndɔ tuma tuma nde Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ, saninfɛdɛ wo ri kɛ a tin na. Wo ri a yiraka ko Haruna ye a lɔla Isirayɛlikailu la kojuuilu kunko la, ii ka mɛnilu kɛ ii la sarakailu bɔ tuma. Ikomin saninfɛdɛ ni a sɛbɛli wo ri kɛ Haruna tin na, n di sɔn Isirayɛlikailu la sarakailu rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 28:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />«Ai ye duruki kɔrɔbila ni bitiran rabɛn makisali ɲuma la. Mɛn kusan faanin sɔɔla, wo ye tɛsidilan dabɛn ka a sɔɔ ka a ɲa. <verse eid="EXO 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" />Ai ye duruki kɔrɔbila ni tɛsidilan ni fula ɲumailu ladan Haruna dencɛilu yɛ, mɛnilu ri bonya di ii ma. <verse eid="EXO 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" />I ye faanin woilu bila i kɔrɔcɛ Haruna ni a dencɛilu kan na ka tulu mun ii kun na, ka ii lasii n na sarakalasela baara la. I ri ii bila a dan na ten sa ii ri n na sarakalasela baara kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />Ai ye kurusi kurunniilu ladan ii yɛ makisali la. Kurusi woilu ye bɔ ii soro rɔ ka na dan ii woro rɔ. Ii ri woilu don ii la durukiilu kɔrɔ sa ii ri ii jɛrɛ sutura. <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />Haruna ni a dencɛilu wa don n na faaninbon kɔndɔ, wala ii wa ii madon saraka bɔ diya la ka baara kɛ yɔrɔ sɛniman kɔndɔ, fɔɔ ii ye faanin woilu bila ii kan na. Ni wo tɛ, ii ri jalaki ka sa. Sariya le wo ri, mɛn ka kan ka latelen Haruna ni a bɔnsɔnilu bolo kadawu!»<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s">Alla la sarakalaselailu lasii ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ka kan ka Haruna ni a dencɛilu latɔ ii dan na ɲa mɛn ma n na kosa ii ye sarakalasela baara kɛ. I ye tora bulan kelen mira, a ni saaji fila, fɛɛ tɛ mɛnilu la. <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" />I ye farinin muun ɲuma ta, ka buru labɛn a la a ni katɔ ni dɛba, lɛbɛn ti mɛn na, ka tulu mun a ma. <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />I ye woilu bɛɛ bila see kelen kɔndɔ. I wa na tora ni saaji fila ri ii kannatɛɛ diya, i ye na see wo fanan di.<verse eid="EXO 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" />«I ye Haruna ni a dencɛilu lana n na faaninbon da la, ka ii ko ji la. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />Wo wa kɛ, i ye duruki kɔrɔbila ni durukiba bila Haruna kan na, a ni kɔkanbila durukini ni sisirɔ bɔrɔni, ka ban ka kɔkanbila durukini sidi a ma tɛsidilan na, jesedanna kusan ka mɛn nadan. <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />I ye bitiran kɛ Haruna kun na, ka kuntiiya tɔɔmasere sɛniman sidi bitiran kan. <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" />I ye suwandili tulu mun a kun na ka a bila a dan na n na baara kanma. <verse eid="EXO 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />Wo wa kɛ, i ri Haruna dencɛilu lana ka duruki kɔrɔbila bila ii kan na. <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />I ye ii tɛsidi tɛsidilanilu la, ka ban ka bitiran kɛ ii kun na. N na sarakalasela baara ri kɛ Haruna ni a bɔnsɔnilu ta ri kadawu. Sariya rabilabali le wo ri. Wo wa kɛ, i ri Haruna ni a dencɛilu latɔ ii dan na baara wo kanma.<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />«I ye tora lana n na faaninbon da la. Haruna ni a dencɛilu ye ii boloilu la a kun kan. <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />I ye tora kannatɛɛ nde Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ n na faaninbon da la ye. <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />I ye i bolo koyini su tora jeli rɔ ka a mun saraka bɔ diya tonkon kereilu la, ka a jeli tɔilu bɛɛ labɔn saraka bɔ diya ju fɛ. <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" />Wo wa kɛ, kɛn mɛn ye tora kɔnɔ rɔ, i ye wo bɛɛ ta, a ni farafara mɛn ye jusu ma ni kɔrɔkudu fila ni woilu kɛnilu bɛɛ. I ye wo bɛɛ la saraka bɔ diya kan ka ii janin ka kɛ buuri ri. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" />Kɔni i ye tora sobo ni a gbolo ni a noo bɛɛ janin ta rɔ jama daa makɛ diya kɔfɛ. Wo le ri kɛ saraka ri, mɛn di n sarakalaselailu la julumunilu labe.<verse eid="EXO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" />«I ye saaji fila wo kelen mira. Haruna ni a dencɛilu ye ii bolo la wo kun kan. <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />I ye saaji kannatɛɛ ka a jeli ta ka a sadisadi saraka bɔ diya fan bɛɛ kan. <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />I ye saaji boso ka a tɛɛtɛɛ. I ye a kɔnɔrɔfenilu ni a senilu rako, ka woilu bila sobo kudukudu ni kunkolo kan. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" />I ye saaji bu bɛɛ janin saraka bɔ diya kan saraka janinta la. Saraka janinta le a ri, mɛn di bɔ nde Allabatala yɛ ka a janin ta la. Wo suma duman n yɛ.<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />«Wo wa kɛ, i ye saaji filana ta. Haruna ni a dencɛilu ye ii boloilu la a kun na. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />I ye a kannatɛɛ ka a jeli do ta ka wo mun Haruna ni a dencɛilu bolokinin tolo nun na, ka do fanan mun ii bolokinin bolo kunkuruba kan, a ni ii bolokinin sen kunkuruba. I ye jeli tɔ sadisadi saraka bɔ diya fan bɛɛ kan. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" />Jeli mɛn sadisadini saraka bɔ diya kan, i ye wo do ta, ka suwandili tulu do fanan ta ka woilu sadisadi Haruna ni a dencɛilu kan, a ni ii la faaninilu bɛɛ kan. Wo le rɔ, Haruna ni a dencɛilu ni ii la faaninilu ri bila a dan na ka kɛ fen sɛniman di.<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />«Saaji filana wo ye saraka ri, mɛn ye bɔla ka Haruna ni a dencɛilu bila ii dan na n na baara kanma. Wo rɔ, i ye saaji kɛn ta, a ni a kɔ ni farafara mɛn ye jusu ma ni a kɔrɔkudu fila bɛɛ ni kɛn mɛn ye woilu lamininna ni kɛn mɛn ye kɔnɔrɔ nooilu laminin bɛɛ rɔ. I ye bolokinin ma woro fanan ta. <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />I ye buru fununbali kelen ni buru kelen mɛn dabɛnni tulu la ni burunin kelen ta see kɔndɔ, mɛn bilanin nde Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />I ye fen woilu bɛɛ don Haruna ni a dencɛilu bolo, ko ii ye woilu kɔrɔta nde Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ ka a yiraka ko ii ye a bɛɛ dila n ma. <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />Wo wa kɛ, i ye fen woilu bɔ ii bolo ka woilu bila saraka bɔ diya kan ka ii janin. Sarakailu le ii ri, mɛnilu ri bɔ nde Allabatala yɛ ka janin ta la. Wo suma duman n yɛ.<verse eid="EXO 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />«I ye Haruna lasii saaji sisi kɔrɔta Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ, ka a yiraka ko i ye a bɛɛ dila nde Allabatala ma. Sisi wo ye ile niiyɔrɔ le ri. <verse eid="EXO 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27" />N sarakalasela lasii saaji sisi ni a woro mɛnilu kɔrɔtara n ɲakɔrɔ, ko woilu bilanin a dan na ka kɛ n ta ri. Ko Haruna ni a dencɛilu niiyɔrɔ le woilu ri. <verse eid="EXO 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28" />Isirayɛlikailu wa jususuma saraka bɔ tuma tuma, ii ye niimafen wo sisi ni a woro di nde Allabatala ma. Woilu ri kɛ Haruna ni a bɔnsɔnilu niiyɔrɔ ri.<verse eid="EXO 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />«Haruna la faanin sɛniman di kɛ a bɔnsɔnilu ta ri a sani kɔ rɔ. Suwandili tulu muntɔ a nɔrɔbila kan lon mɛn na ka wo lato a dan na n na baara kɛ kanma, a nɔrɔbila wo ri Haruna la faanin wo bila a kan na. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Haruna dencɛ mɛn wa bila a nɔ rɔ n na sarakalasela baara la, wo wa don n na faaninbon na ka n na sarakalasela baara damira yɔrɔ sɛniman kɔndɔ, a ri faanin woilu bila a kan na tele wɔrɔnwula kɔrɔ.<verse eid="EXO 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />«Nba, saaji mɛn kɛra saraka ri ka Haruna ni a dencɛilu sii n na sarakalasela baara la, i ye wo sobo ta ka a tibi yɔrɔ sɛniman do rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" />Haruna ni a dencɛilu ri sobo wo dɔɔn, a ni buru mɛnilu ye see kɔndɔ. Ii ye woilu dɔɔn n na faaninbon da la. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" />Saraka woilu bɔra ka ii solonna ka ii latɔ ii dan na ii lasii tuma n na sarakalasela baara la. Ii ye woilu dɔɔn. Kɔni mɔɔ gbɛrɛ si kana fen woilu dɔɔn, baa fen woilu sɛniman. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />Ni sobo wo tɔ siira haan sɔɔma da la, wala buru tɔ, wo ye janin ka kɛ buuri ri. A kana a dɔɔn, baa a sɛniman.<verse eid="EXO 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />«N ye mɛnilu fɔla i yɛ, i ye woilu bɛɛ kɛ Haruna ni a dencɛilu yɛ, ka ii latɔ ii dan na n na sarakalasela baara rɔ. I ye wo bɛɛ kɛ lon lon tele wɔrɔnwula kɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" />I ye tora kelen bɔ lon lon ka kɛ julumun saraka ri. I ri saraka bɔ diya solonna wo ɲa. Wo wa kɛ, i ri tulu mun a kan ka a bila a dan na ka a kɛ n ta ri. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" />I ye wo bɛɛ kɛ ten lon lon tele wɔrɔnwula kɔrɔ. Wo bolo ma, saraka bɔ diya wo ri kɛ fen sɛniman ba ri. Fen fen wa a maa a la, wo fanan di kɛ fen sɛniman di.»<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saraka mɛnilu ka kan ka bɔ lon lon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />«Ai ye san kelen saa bulan fila bɔ saraka bɔ diya kan lon lon kadawu. <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />Ai ye saa bulan kelen bɔ sɔɔma, ka kelen bɔ wura fɛ. <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />Ai ye farinin ɲuma kilo fila ni olibiye susunin tulu litiri kelen ta ka woilu ɲaamin i ɲɔɔn na, ka wo bɔ saa bulan fɛ sɔɔma. Ai ye rɛsɛnji litiri kelen nabɔn, ka wo fanan kɛ saraka ri. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" />Ai ye saa bulan filana bɔ wura fɛ, ka farinin ni olibiye tulu ni rɛsɛnji la a kan ikomin sɔɔma ta. Saraka janinta le a ri, mɛn di bɔ nde Allabatala yɛ ka janin ta la ka kɛ buuri ri. Wo suma duman n yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 29:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />Ai ni ai bɔnsɔnilu ye saraka janinta woilu bɔ tuma bɛɛ. Ai ye ii bɔ nde Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ kunbɛn faaninbon da la. N kɛtɔ n na jama kunbɛnna ye le ka kuma i yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 29:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" />N di Isirayɛlikailu kunbɛn ye le. N nɔɔrɔ ri yɔrɔ wo bila a dan na ka a kɛ n ta ri. <verse eid="EXO 29:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />N di n na faaninbon ni saraka bɔ diya bila a dan na ka ii kɛ n ta ri. N di Haruna ni a dencɛilu fanan bila ii dan na n na baara kanma, sa ii ri n na sarakalasela baara kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 29:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" />N di n makɛ Isirayɛlikailu tɛma ka kɛ ii Maari ri. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Ii ri a lɔn ko nde le ii Maari Allabatala ri, mɛn ka ii labɔ Misiran jamana rɔ sa n di n makɛ ii tɛma. N ye ii Maari Allabatala le ri.»<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s">Wusulanjanin saraka bɔ diya ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />«Ai ye wusulan janin saraka bɔ diya ladan kasiya jiri la. <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />Wo fan naanin bɛɛ ye kanya, ka a yanyan ni a bonya bɛɛ kɛ nunkan ɲa kelen kelen di. A lɔ ye kɛ nunkan ɲa fila ri. Kere munuɲa ye kɛ a tonkon naanin bɛɛ la, kɔni kereilu ni saraka bɔ diya bɛɛ ye kɛ fen kelen de ri. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />Ai ye sanin jɛrɛwolo la a sanfɛ a ni a kɛrɛfɛ naanin yɔrɔ bɛɛ a ni a kereilu bɛɛ kan, ka da kirinkirin bɛɛ kɛ sanin di a fan naanin bɛɛ la. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Ai ye sanin gbarangbaran fila ladan da kirinkirin wo kɔrɔ saraka bɔ diya fan fila fɛ, fan kelen gbarangbaran fila. Saraka bɔ diya ta gbelekeilu ri don gbarangbaran woilu rɔ, sa saraka bɔ diya ri se madoninna. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />Ai ye gbelekeilu rabɛn kasiya jiri la ka sanin la ii yɔrɔ bɛɛ kan. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Ai ye saraka bɔ diya wo sii tatɛɛfaanin ɲɛfɛ. Teriya tɔɔmasere kankira ni a julumun kafari dalatuun ye tatɛɛfaanin wo kɔfɛ. Tuma tuma n kɛtɔ i kunbɛnna yɔrɔ wo le rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />«Haruna wa fitinailu rabɛn sɔɔma sɔɔma, a ye wusulan suma duman janin saraka bɔ diya wo kan. <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />A wa fitinnailu lamɛlɛn wura wura, a ye wusulan suma duman janin ikɔ tuunnin. Wusulan ye to janinna wo ɲa ma nde Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ tuma bɛɛ. Ai bɔnsɔnilu bɛɛ ye a kɛ ten haan ka wa kadawu. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" />Ai kana wusulan su gbɛrɛ janin wusulanjanin saraka bɔ diya kan. Ai kana sarakailu bɔ a kan, mɛnilu ri janin ka kɛ buuri ri. Ai kana suman kɛ saraka ri ka a bɔ a kan. Ai kana rɛsɛnji kɛ saraka ri ka wo labɔn a kan. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />San san, kolofen mɛn bɔnin ka a kɛ julumun saraka ri ka a solonna, Haruna ye wo jeli ta ka a kɛ saraka bɔ diya kereilu kan. Haruna ri saraka bɔ diya sɛninya ten siɲa kelen san san. Ai bɔnsɔnilu ye a kɛ ten haan ka wa kadawu. Sarakabɔdiya wo bilanin a dan na ka kɛ nde Allabatala ta ri. A sɛniman ba le.»<verse eid="EXO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jama ye kunkali wodi mɛn bɔla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ikɔ tuunni ko: <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" />«I wa tɔɔ sɛbɛli kɛ ka Isirayɛlikailu jate lɔn, ii kelen kelenna bɛɛ ye ii jɛrɛ nii kunka wodi bɔ ka a di nde Allabatala ma, sa tɔrɔya kana ii sɔrɔn tɔɔ sɛbɛli waati la. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13" />Mɛnilu tɔɔ wa sɛbɛ, ii kelen kelenna bɛɛ ye wodigbɛ karamun wɔɔrɔ bɔ. Karamun wɔɔrɔ ye Alla batobonba sɛkɛli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛkɛli ye sumannin fen de ri mɛn ɲa kelen ye bɛnna karamun tan ni fila ma</char></note> tala le. Wo ri kɛ niilifen di ka a di nde Allabatala ma. Yɔrɔ sɛniman jateli bɛnnin karamun tan ni fila le ma. <verse eid="EXO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu sɔrɔn da san muwan (20) bɔ, i ri woilu ni woilu kɔrɔilu bɛɛ tɔɔ sɛbɛ. Woilu bɛɛ ye niilifen wo di nde Allabatala ma. <verse eid="EXO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" />Ii wa karamun wɔɔrɔ wo di nde Allabatala ma ka kɛ solonnali fen ii yɛ, nanfulutii kana foyi la a ta kan, bolokolon kana foyi bɔ a ta la. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />I wa solonnali wodi wo sɔrɔn Isirayɛlikailu la, i ri a kɛ n na faaninbon dabɛnfen di. Wodi wo ri kɛ hankilibilafen di ka nde Allabatala hankili bila a la ko Isirayɛlikailu nii da kunka.»<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Koli yagbawara la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />«Ai ye sulanɛɛ yagbawara ladan koli kanma, ka a sulanɛɛ siifenju fanan nadan. Ai ye a sii kunbɛn faaninbon ni saraka bɔ diya tɛma, ka ji kɛ a kɔndɔ. <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" />Haruna ni a dencɛilu ye ii boloilu ni ii senilu mako ji wo la. <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20-21" />Ii wa kɛ donna kunbɛn faaninbon na tuma mɛn na, ii ye ii boloilu ni ii senilu ko ji woilu la sa ii ti nala faala. Ka a la wo kan, ii wa kɛ ii madonna saraka bɔ diya la tuma mɛn na ka saraka janin ta la Allabatala yɛ, ii ye ii boloilu ni ii senilu mako sa ii ti nala faala. Jamarili le wo ri Haruna ni a bɔnsɔnilu bɛɛ ma haan ka wa kadawu.»<verse eid="EXO 30:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Suwandili tulu ladan ɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ikɔ tuunni ko: <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23-24" />«I ye sumadiyalanilu bɛɛ rɔ ɲuma doilu ta. I ye muri latikɔlɔn jilama kilo wɔɔrɔ ta, a ni kanɛli sumaduman kilo sawa, ni sinamɔnɛ sumaduman kilo sawa, ni kase sumaduman kilo wɔɔrɔ. Woilu bɛɛ ka kan ka bɛn yɔrɔ sɛniman na jateli ma. I ye olibiye tulu litiri naanin fanan ta. <verse eid="EXO 30:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />Latikɔlɔn nadanna do ye woilu bɛɛ basan ka a kɛ suwandili tulu sɛniman di, mɛn suma duman. Tulu wo ri kɛ fen sɛniman de ri, mɛn ye kɛla fen wala mɔɔ kan ka wo bila a dan na. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" />I ye tulu wo ta ka dɔɔnin mun kunbɛn faaninbon ni teriya tɔɔmasere kankira kan, <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />a ni tabali ni a muran, a ni fitinasiifen ni a muran bɛɛ, a ni wusulan janin saraka bɔ diya, <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />a ni saraka janinta bɔ diya ni a muran bɛɛ, a ni yagbawara ni a siifenju fanan. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />I ri fen woilu bila a dan na ten, ka ii kɛ n ta ri fasayi. Ii ri kɛ fen sɛnimanilu ri. Ni fen fen ka a maa woilu la, wo fanan di kɛ fen sɛniman di.<verse eid="EXO 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />«I ye tulu dɔɔnin mun Haruna ni a dencɛilu kan ka ii bila a dan na n na baara kanma. Ii ri n na sarakalasela baara kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />I ye a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ ko n na suwandili tulu le ɲin di. Ko a sɛniman haan ka wa kadawu. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Mɔɔ si kana a ta ka a fari mamun a la. Mɔɔ si kana fenilu ladan, mɛnilu ri kɛ a su ri. A sɛniman de. Ai ye a jate fen sɛniman di. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Mɔɔ mɔɔ wa a ɲɔɔn nadan, wo tii ri gbɛn a la jama tɛma. Mɔɔ mɔɔ wa tulu wo kɛ mɔɔ gbɛrɛ kan, mɛn tɛ n sarakalasela ri, wo tii ri gbɛn a la jama tɛma.»<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wusulan nadan ɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «Sumadiyalan mɛnilu tɔɔ ko sitaki ni ɔnkile ni kalibanun, a ni wusulan sumaduman jɛrɛwolo, i ye wo ta ka a bɛɛ rakanya. <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />Sumaduman nadanna do ye woilu bɛɛ ni kɔɔ basan ka a kɛ wusulan jɛrɛwolo ri, mɛn suma duman. Ai ye a jate fen sɛniman di, mɛn bilanin a dan na n na baara kanma. <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />I ye wusulan wo do ta ka a rasisi ka a kɛ muun di, ka a bila teriya tɔɔmasere kankira ɲɛfɛ kunbɛn faaninbon kɔndɔ. N ye i kunbɛnna ye le. Ai ye wusulan wo jate fen sɛniman ba ri. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />Ai kana sumadiyalan woilu ta ka wusulan do ladan ai jɛrɛ yɛ, mɛn ni ɲin bɛɛ ka kan. Ai ye a jate fen sɛniman ba ri, mɛn ye Allabatala ta ri. <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Mɔɔ mɔɔ wa wusulan wo ɲɔɔn nadan sa a ri sɛwa wo sumaduman dɔ, wo tii ri gbɛn a la jama tɛma.»<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s">Bon lɔlailu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" />«N da Juda kabila Uri mamaren Besalɛli, Huri dencɛ kɔnin, suwandi baara ɲin kanma. <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" />N da n Nii lajii Besalɛli rɔ. Wo rɔ, a hankili duman, a la lɔnnin ka bon. A seni bololabaara su bɛɛ kɛla. <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4" />A senin fen keɲimantailu ladanna sanin na, a ni wodigbɛ la, a ni sulanɛɛ la. <verse eid="EXO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5" />A seni kabakudun kisɛilu lɛsɛla, ka ii bila fendamirafenilu la. A seni jiri fanan lɛsɛla. A kusan bololabaara su bɛɛ kɛla. <verse eid="EXO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" />N da Ahisamaki dencɛ Oholiyabu fanan suwandi ka a kɛ Besalɛli dɛmɛnba ri. Oholiyabu ye Daan kabila mɔɔ do le ri. N da famunyali di bololabaarala gbɛrɛilu fanan ma n na baara kanma. Wo rɔ, n ka a fɔ i yɛ ko ai ye fen mɛnilu ladan, ii ri se wo bɛɛ ladanna. <verse eid="EXO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />Ii ri se n na faaninbon nadanna, a ni teriya tɔɔmasere kankira a ni a julumun kafari dalatuun ni faaninbon muranilu bɛɛ. <verse eid="EXO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />Ii ri se tabali ni a muranilu bɛɛ ladanna, a ni sanin jɛrɛwolo fitinasiifen ni a muranilu bɛɛ, a ni wusulan janin saraka bɔ diya. <verse eid="EXO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />Ii ri se saraka bɔ diya fanan nadanna, sarakailu ri janin mɛn kan ka kɛ buuri ri. Ii ri saraka bɔ diya wo muranilu bɛɛ fanan nadan, a ni yagbawara ni a siifenju. <verse eid="EXO 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />Ii ye faanin keɲi bailu fanan nadan, n sarakalasela Haruna la faanin sɛnimanilu ni a dencɛilu la faaninilu kɔnin. Haruna ni a dencɛilu ri faanin woilu bila ii kan na ka n na sarakalasela baara kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />Ii ri suwandili tulu ladan, a ni wusulan suma duman, mɛn di janin yɔrɔ sɛniman kɔndɔ. Awa, ii ri fen woilu bɛɛ ladan ikomin n ka a ɲafɔ i yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.»<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲɔɲɔ Lon ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: <verse eid="EXO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13" />«I ye a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ ko ii ye Ɲɔɲɔ Lonilu bɛɛ bonya, baa Ɲɔɲɔ Lon ye tɔɔmasere le ri kadawu ii ni nde tɛma. A ri a yiraka ii la ko Allabatala le nde le ri, mɛn ye ii bilala a dan na ka ii kɛ n ta ri. <verse eid="EXO 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" />Ii ye Ɲɔɲɔ Lon bonya, baa lon sɛniman de wo ri ii bolo. Ni mɔɔ mɛn ma sɔn lon wo bonyala fo ka baara do kɛ wo lon, ii ye a labɔ a badenmailu tɛma ka a faa. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Ii ye baara kɛ tele wɔɔrɔ kɔrɔ, kɔni tele wɔrɔnwulana le Ɲɔɲɔ Lon dafanin de ri, mɛn bilanin a dan na Allabatala bonya kanma. Mɔɔ mɛn wa baara su su kɛ Ɲɔɲɔ Lon kɔndɔ, ii ye wo faa. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />Ii ni ii bɔnsɔnilu bɛɛ ka kan ka Ɲɔɲɔ Lon nabato ka a bonya, baa teriya banbali le kadawu. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Ɲɔɲɔ Lon ye tɔɔmasere le ri n ni Isirayɛlikailu tɛma kadawu, baa nde Allabatala le ka san ni duu dan tele wɔɔrɔ kɔrɔ, kɔni tele wɔrɔnwulana lon, n ka baara lalɔ ka n dafɔɲɔ.» <verse eid="EXO 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />Awa, Allabatala banda kumala Musa yɛ Sinayi koyinkɛ kan tuma mɛn na, a ka teriya tɔɔmasere kaba walan fila don Musa bolo, Alla jɛrɛ ka sariyailu sɛbɛ mɛnilu kan.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s">Sanin Nisiden Bisiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />Awa, mɔɔilu ka a yen ko Musa ra mɛn a ma jii ka bɔ koyinkɛ kan, ii ka i ɲɔɔn nadɛn Haruna kanma, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I wuli, i ye batofenilu ladan an yɛ, mɛn di lɔ an ɲɔrɔ! An ma a lɔn mɛn ka Musa sɔrɔn, mɛn ka a lɔ an ɲɔrɔ ka an nabɔ Misiran.» <verse eid="EXO 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" />Haruna ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye wa sanin tololafenilu ta, mɛnilu ye ai musoilu ni ai dencɛilu ni ai denmusoilu toloilu la. Ai ye na woilu di n ma.» <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Mɔɔilu bɛɛ ka ii la sanin tololafenilu bɔ ii toloilu la ka na woilu di Haruna ma. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" />Haruna ka tololafenilu mira, ka ii yelen ka lɛsɛlifen do ta ka nisiden sawura ladan. Mɔɔilu ka a yen tuma mɛn na, ii ka a fɔ ko: «Isirayɛlikailu, an na batofenilu le ɲin di, mɛn ka an nabɔ Misiran.» <verse eid="EXO 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Haruna ka wo yen tuma mɛn na, a ka saraka bɔ diya lɔ nisiden bisiki ɲɛ ka a fɔ ko: «Sini ri kɛ sali ri ka Allabatala bato.» <verse eid="EXO 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" />Wo duu sa gbɛ, ii sorira ka saraka janintailu a ni jususuma sarakailu bɔ. Wo kɔ rɔ, ii ka ii sii ka dɔɔnnin kɛ ka ii min, ka ban ka ii lawuli ii lamaa kanma.<verse eid="EXO 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />Wo rɔ, Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I kaliya, i ye jii koyinkɛ kɔrɔ sisɛn, baa i la mɔɔilu ra julumun ba kɛ, jama mɛn bɔra Misiran i bolo kɔnin. <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" />Ii ra bɔ sila kan jonna, n ka mɛn yiraka ii la. Ii ra nisiden sawura ladan sanin yelenni la, ka ii birin wo kɔrɔ. Ii ra wo bato ka sarakailu bɔ a yɛ ka a fɔ ko: ‹Isirayɛlikailu, an na batofenilu le ɲin di, mɛn ka an nabɔ Misiran.›»<verse eid="EXO 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «N da jama wo yen. Ii ye mɔɔ kun gbɛlɛnilu le ri. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />Sisɛn, i kana n nalɔ. N mɔnɛni ii kanma kojuuya. N di ii halaki, ka ban ka jama ba bɔ ile rɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" />Musa ka a Maari Allabatala matara kosɛbɛ ko: «Allabatala, i ka i la jama labɔ Misiran sebaya ba la, a ni fanka ba la. Nfenna i ri duɲa ii kanma kojuuya? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />Ni i ka ii halaki, Misirankailu ri a fɔ ko i ka an nabɔ ye sa i ri kojuu kɛ an na. Ko i tun ye a fɛ ka an nana koyinkɛ ma yɔrɔ rɔ ka an faa, ka an si latunun ka bɔ dunuɲa rɔ. I ye i la duɲa masuma. I ye a fɛ ka kojuu ba mɛn kɛ i la mɔɔilu la, i ye wo bila. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" />I ye i hankili to i la jɔnilu rɔ, an benbailu Iburahima ni Isiyaka ni Isirayɛli kɔnin. I ka i kali i jɛrɛ tɔɔ rɔ woilu yɛ ko i ri ii bɔnsɔnilu siyaya ikomin sankolo loloilu. Ko i ri jamana di ii bɔnsɔn woilu ma ka a kɛ ii cɛ ri kadawu.»<verse eid="EXO 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" />Allabatala ka masilannikan mɛn fɔ ko a ri a la jama halaki, a ka wo to ye.<verse eid="EXO 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Musa jiira ka bɔ koyinkɛ kan. Teriya tɔɔmasere kaba walan fila ye a bolo, Alla la sariya sɛbɛni mɛnilu kan. Sariya woilu sɛbɛni walanilu fan fila kan, ii kɔfɛla ni ɲɛfɛla. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" />Walanilu tɛrɛ Alla la baara nɔ le ri. Sɛbɛli mɛn tɛrɛ ye ii kan, wo tɛrɛ Allabatala bolo nɔ le ri.<verse eid="EXO 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />Awa, Josuwe ka jama mankan mɛn tuma mɛn na, a ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «Kɛlɛ mankan ye daa makɛ diya ye.» <verse eid="EXO 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: «Se sɔrɔnba kan tɛ wo ri, se sɔrɔnbali fanan kan tɛ. Mɛn ye n tolo la, wo ye donkilila kan de ri.»<verse eid="EXO 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Musa seni daa makɛ diya tuma mɛn na, a ka nisiden sawura wo yen, ka jama yen don kɛla. A mɔnɛra kojuuya, fɔɔ ka kaba walan fila lafili ka ii rakadikadi koyinkɛ kɔrɔ. <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Ii tun ka nisiden sawura mɛn nadan, Musa ka wo ta ka a bila ta rɔ ka a janin, ka ban ka a muumuu. A ka muun wo kɛ ji rɔ ka ji wo di jama ma ko ii ye a min.<verse eid="EXO 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Musa ka a fɔ Haruna yɛ ko: «Jama ka nfen kɛ i la fɔɔ i ka ii bila julumun ba rɔ ten?» <verse eid="EXO 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Haruna ka a fɔ ko: «N fa, i kana duɲa. I jɛrɛ ka a lɔn ko julumun kɛ duman ba le mɔɔ ɲinilu yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />Ii ka a fɔ n yɛ ko: ‹I ye batofenilu ladan an yɛ, mɛn di lɔ an ɲɔrɔ. Ka a masɔrɔn, an ma a lɔn mɛn kɛni wo cɛɛ Musa la mɛn ka an labɔ Misiran.› <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Wo rɔ, n ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko sanin ye mɔɔ mɔɔ bolo, ko woilu ye a labɔ. Nba, ii ka woilu labɔ ka a di n ma. N ka a ta ka a bila ta rɔ. Nisiden sawura ɲin bɔra a rɔ!»<verse eid="EXO 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />Musa ka a yen ko Haruna ka mɔɔilu to ii jɛrɛ diyanan ko kɛla. Ko wo le kosɔn, ii juuilu ra ii jate mayɛlɛfen di. <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />Musa wara a lɔ daa makɛ diya donda la. A ka a kan nabɔ ko: «Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye Allabatala fɛ, wo bɛɛ ye na yan.» Lebi kabila mɔɔilu bɛɛ wara ii lɔ a laminin dɔ. <verse eid="EXO 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" />A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Isirayɛlikailu Maari Allabatala ka a fɔ ko cɛɛilu bɛɛ ye ii la fanmuru ta ka daa makɛ diya yɔrɔ bɛɛ rataamataama. Ii ye tamin mɔɔilu sii diya bɛɛ la, ka ii badenma cɛɛilu faa, a ni ii duɲɔɔilu ni ii siiɲɔɔilu.» <verse eid="EXO 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />Musa ka mɛn fɔ, Lebi kabila mɔɔilu ka wo bɛɛ kɛ. Mɔɔ waa sawa (3,000) ɲɔɔn faara Isirayɛlikailu rɔ wo lon kelen. <verse eid="EXO 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Musa ka a fɔ Lebi kabila mɔɔilu yɛ ko: «Bi, ai ra lato a dan na Allabatala la baara kanma, baa ai ma ai ban wulila ai dencɛilu ni ai badenma cɛɛilu kanma. Allabatala ra baraka don ai la ko rɔ bi.»<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />Wo duu sa gbɛ Musa ka a fɔ jama yɛ ko: «Ai ra julumun ba kɛ. Sisɛn, n di yɛlɛ koyinkɛ la ka wa Allabatala kunbɛn. Tumadɔ n di solonnali kɛ ai yɛ ten ai julumunilu la ko kosɔn.»<verse eid="EXO 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Musa yɛlɛra koyinkɛ kan ka wa Allabatala labɛn, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Aa, Allabatala. Jama ɲin ka julumun ba le kɛ! Ii ka batofenilu ladan sanin dɔ. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" />Sisɛn, n ye i madiyala, i ye yafa ii ma. Ni i ma sɔn wo ma, i ye n tɔɔ bɔ i la kitabu kɔndɔ, i ka mɛn sɛbɛ.» <verse eid="EXO 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «Mɔɔ mɛnilu ka julumun kɛ n na, n ye woilu le tɔɔ bɔla n na kitabu kɔndɔ. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" />I ye wa sisɛn. N ka yɔrɔ mɛn ko fɔ i yɛ, i ye lɔ jama ɲɔrɔ ka wa ii ri ye. N na mɛlɛka ri wa i ɲɛfɛ, kɔni n na waati wa se, n di n hakɛ bɔ ii rɔ ii la julumun ko kosɔn.»<verse eid="EXO 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />Nba, Allabatala ka a hakɛ bɔ jama rɔ ka a masɔrɔn ii le ka a fɔ Haruna yɛ ko a ye nisiden sawura wo ladan ii yɛ.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="s">Isirayɛlikailu bilara sila kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye wuli ka bɔ yan, i ni jama mɛn nara i bolo ka bɔ Misiran. N ka n kali Iburahima ni Isiyaka ni Yakuba yɛ ko n di jamana mɛn di ii bɔnsɔnilu ma, i ye wa ye. <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />N di n na mɛlɛka lawa ai ɲɛfɛ. N di Kanaankailu gbɛn ka ii labɔ jamana wo kɔndɔ, ka Amɔrikailu fanan gbɛn, a ni Hɛti bɔnsɔnilu ni Peresikailu ni Hifikailu ni Jebusikailu. <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" />Ai ye wuli ka wa ye. Dɔɔnnita duman ye bɔla jamana wo rɔ a ɲa jɛrɛ jɛrɛ ma, li ni nɔnɔ a bɛɛ ye bɔla ye. N kɔnin ti nala wala ai fɛ, sa n kana ai halaki sila la, baa ai ye mɔɔ kun gbɛlɛnilu le ri.»<verse eid="EXO 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />Mɔɔilu ka kunnagboya kuma wo mɛn tuma mɛn na, ii jusukasira. Mɔɔ si ma sɔn masidifenilu bilala a ma, <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />baa Allabatala tun ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ ko ii ye mɔɔ kun gbɛlɛnilu le ri. Ko ni n wara ii fɛ hali waati kuru ɲin kelen kɔrɔ, n di ii halaki. Ko ii ye ii la masidifenilu bɛɛ bɔ ii ma sisɛn. Ko wo kɔ rɔ, ko n ka kan ka ii mira ɲa mɛn ma, n di wo latɛɛ.» <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />Isirayɛlikailu bɔ mɛn kɛni Horɛbu koyinkɛ kan, ii ka ii la masidifenilu bɔ ii ma.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla Kunbɛn Diya Faaninbon dɔɔmanni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />Nba, Musa tɛrɛ ye faaninbon do tala ka wa a lɔ kɔkan, ka a yɔrɔ mataa daa makɛ diya la. A ka a fɔ wo ma ko Alla kunbɛn faaninbon. Mɔɔ mɔɔ tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka ii la kunko yiraka Allabatala la, woilu tɛrɛ ye bɔla ka wa Alla Kunbɛn Diya Faaninbon na daa makɛ diya kɔkan. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Musa tun wa kɛ wala faaninbon wo la tuma tuma, mɔɔilu bɛɛ ri i wuli ka i lɔ ii jɛrɛ la faaninbon da la ka Musa watɔla ragbɛ fɔɔ a wa ban donna faaninbon na tuma mɛn na. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" />Musa wa don faaninbon kɔndɔ tuma mɛn na, duru munuɲa ri jii ka a lɔ faaninbon da la. Allabatala ri kuma Musa yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />Ni mɔɔilu ka duru munuɲa wo lɔni yen faaninbon da la tuma mɛn na, ii bɛɛ ri i lɔ ii la faaninbon da la, ka ban ka i ɲakɔrɔ bɛn duu ma ka Alla bato. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" />Allabatala tun di kuma Musa yɛ ɲa ni ɲa ikomin mɔɔ ye kumala a teri yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. Wo kɔ rɔ, Musa ri a kɔsɛ daa makɛ diya. Kɔni a la dɛmɛnba Josuwe tora faaninbon kɔndɔ ye. Josuwe tɛrɛ ye kanberen de ri. A fa tɔɔ ko Nun.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Allabatala ka a fɔ ko a ri to a la jama fɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />Musa ka a fɔ Allabatala yɛ ko: «A ragbɛ, ile le ka a fɔ n yɛ ko: ‹Na jama ɲin di›, kɔni i kɛtɔ mɛn lɔla n fɛ ka n dɛmɛn, i ma wo tii fɔ n yɛ. I ka a fɔ ko: ‹N ka i tɔɔ lɔn›, a ni, ‹I la ko duman n yɛ.› <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" />Ni n da i la hina sɔrɔn, i sɔn i ye i la silailu yiraka n na kosa n ye i lɔn ka to i la hina sɔrɔnna. Jama ɲin fanan jate ko i la jama le ai ri.» <verse eid="EXO 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" />Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «N nɔɔrɔ ri wa i fɛ ka i rafɔɲɔ.» <verse eid="EXO 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Musa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ni i jɛrɛ tɛ wala an kɔfɛ, i kana a fɔ an yɛ ko an ye bɔ yan. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" />Na i ma wa an kɔfɛ, mɔɔ si tɛ a lɔn ko n na ko ni i la jama la ko duman i yɛ. Na i ma wa an kɔfɛ, foyi tɛ andeilu faranfaasi duukolo kan siya tɔilu ma.» <verse eid="EXO 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ka mɛn tara, n di wo kɛ, baa i la ko duman n yɛ. N da i tɔɔ lɔn.»<verse eid="EXO 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Musa ka a fɔ ko: «Awa, i la nɔɔrɔ yiraka n na.» <verse eid="EXO 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «N di tamin i ɲakɔrɔ ka n na ɲumaya yiraka i la, ka n tɔɔ fɔ i yɛ ko Allabatala. N ye a fɛ ka ɲumaya kɛ mɔɔ mɛn yɛ, n di ɲumaya kɛ wo yɛ. N ye a fɛ ka hina mɔɔ mɛn na, n di hina wo la. <verse eid="EXO 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" />Kɔni i ti se n ɲakɔrɔla yenna, baa mɔɔ si ti se n ɲakɔrɔla yenna ka a to ɲenemaya rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />Yɔrɔ do ye n tɔrɔfɛ yan. I ri se i lɔla farakolo kan ye. <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" />N na nɔɔrɔ wa kɛ taminna tuma mɛn na, n di i don farakolo falan kɔndɔ ka n bolo birin i kun na fɔɔ n wa ban taminna. <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" />Wo kɔ rɔ, n di n bolo bɔ ye, i ri n kɔ yen. Kɔni mɔɔ ti nala n ɲakɔrɔla yenna.»<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s">Kaba Walan kurailu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: «I ye kaba walan fila lɛsɛ ka ii kɛ ikomin fɔlɔmantailu, i ka mɛnilu rakadikadi. Kuma mɛnilu sɛbɛni tɛrɛ walan fɔlɔmantailu kan, n di woilu sɛbɛ walan kurailu fanan kan. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />I ye i jɛrɛ rabɛn sisɛn sini sɔɔma. Ni duu sa gbɛra, i ye yɛlɛ Sinayi koyinkɛ kun na ka i lɔ n ɲakɔrɔ ye. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Mɔɔ si kana yɛlɛ ka na i kɔfɛ. Mɔɔ si kana a madon koyinkɛ yɔrɔ si la fanan. Hali saailu ni bailu ni nisiilu fanan kana tamin koyinkɛ kɔrɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Nba, Musa ka kaba walan fila lɛsɛ ka woilu kɛ ikomin fɔlɔmantailu. Sɔɔma jonna, a sorira ka yɛlɛ Sinayi koyinkɛ kan ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ a yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. Walan fila wo tɛrɛ ye a bolo. <verse eid="EXO 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />Allabatala jiira duru munuɲa rɔ, ka na i lɔ Musa tɔrɔfɛ ye, ka a jɛrɛ tɔɔ fɔ ko Allabatala. <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" />Allabatala taminda a ɲakɔrɔ ka a fɔ ko: «Allabatala ye Allabatala le ri. N ye Alla le ri, mɛn ye kininkinin tii ri, mɛn fanan ye ɲumaya kɛla mɔɔilu yɛ. N tɛ mɔnɛla jonna. N na kaninteya ni n na kankelentiiya ka bon. <verse eid="EXO 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" />N ye n na kaninteya yirakala n na mɔɔilu la haan ii bɔnsɔn farɔkɛ waailu. N ye telenbaliya ni murunti ni kojuu yafala mɔɔilu ma. Kɔni n tɛ kojuu kɛlaba jalakibali to ye. N ye failu la julumun hakɛ bɔla ii denilu le rɔ, a ni ii mamarenilu rɔ, a ni ii tolomirailu rɔ, a ni woilu fanan denilu rɔ.»<verse eid="EXO 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Musa ka a ɲakɔrɔ bɛn duu ma i kɔrɔ ka Alla bato. <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />A ka a fɔ ko: «Maari Alla, ni n na ko duman i yɛ, n ye i madiyala i ye wa an kɔfɛ. N ka a lɔn ko mɔɔ kun gbɛlɛnilu le ɲinilu ri. Kɔni n ye i madiyala, i ye an na telenbaliya koilu ni an na julumunilu kafari, ka an mira ikomin i la jama.»<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Allabatala ka teriya sidi kokura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />Allabatala ka a fɔ ko: «A ragbɛ, n ye teriya sidila ai ma. N di kabannakoilu kɛ i la jama bɛɛ ɲana, mɛnilu ɲɔɔn ma kɛ fɔlɔ dunuɲa yɔrɔ si rɔ, mɛnilu ɲɔɔn ma kɛ fɔlɔ siya gbɛrɛilu si tɛma. I laminin mɔɔilu bɛɛ ri n na kɛwali makabanibailu yen, n kɛtɔ mɛnilu kɛla ka fara ile la. <verse eid="EXO 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />N ye mɛn fɔla i yɛ bi, i ye woilu mira ka a latelen. N di Amɔrikailu gbɛn ai ɲɛ, a ni Kanaankailu ni Hɛti bɔnsɔnilu ni Peresikailu ni Hifikailu ni Jebusikailu. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Ai ye a kɛ koɲuma. Ai kana teriya si don ai ni jamana wo mɔɔilu tɛma, sani a ri kɛ ikomin ai ra mira miralifen na. <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" />Ai ye ii la saraka bɔ diyailu te, ka ii la kaba lalɔni batotailu rakadikadi, ka ii la Asera lɔkudun tɛɛ. <verse eid="EXO 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" />Ai kana batofen gbɛrɛ si bato, baa Allabatala le nde ri, mɛn tɛ sɔn mɔɔilu ye fen gbɛrɛ bato. N tɔɔ ko Alla keleyatɔ. <verse eid="EXO 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" />Ai ye a kɛ koɲuma. Ai kana teriya don ai ni jamana wo mɔɔilu tɛma. Ni wo kɛra, ii wa ii madon ii la natala ii jusu rɔ ii la batofenilu la ka saraka bɔ woilu yɛ, ii ri ai kili. Wo rɔ, ai ri wa ii la sarakailu do dɔɔn. <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" />Ni ai ka duɲɔɔya don ai ni ii tɛma, ai ri ii denmusoilu furu ka ii di ai dencɛilu ma. Denmusoilu wo wa ii madon ii la natala ii jusu rɔ ii la batofenilu la, ii ri ai dencɛilu manɛɛn, ka a kɛ sababu ri woilu fanan di batofen woilu bato.<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />«Ai kana nɛɛ yelen ka batofen nadan.<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />«Ai ye Buru Fununbali Sali kɛ. Ni a waati latɛɛni sera Abibu karo la, ai ye buru fununbali dɔɔn tele wɔrɔnwula kɔrɔ ikomin n ka a fɔ ai yɛ ɲa mɛn ma, baa ai bɔra Misiran Abibu karo wo le la.<verse eid="EXO 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />«Den fɔlɔilu bɛɛ ye n ta le ri, hali ai la kolofen bonbailu ni ai la kolofen mɛsɛnilu den fɔlɔ cɛmanilu. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Kɔni ni fali den fɔlɔ le, ai ye saaden wala badenni di n ma wo nɔ rɔ ka wo kunka. Ni ai ma a kunka ten, fo ai ye a kan kadi ka a faa. Ai ye ai dencɛ fɔlɔilu bɛɛ kunka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">«Mɔɔ si kana na n bato diya ni niilifen ma na ai bolo. <verse eid="EXO 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />Ai ye baara kɛ tele wɔɔrɔ kɔrɔ, kɔni tele wɔrɔnwulana lon, ai ye baara lalɔ ka i ɲɔɲɔ. Hali sɛnɛkɛ waati ni sumanka waati, ni tele wɔrɔnwulana lon sera, ai ye baara lalɔ ka i ɲɔɲɔ.<verse eid="EXO 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" />«Ai ri Lɔɔkun Sali kɛ san san. Wo tuma, ai ra binbiriba tɔnsɔn mɛnilu fɔlɔ ka, ai ri woilu kɛ saraka ri. Ai wa ban sɛnɛ baarala san san ka suman nadon, ai ye Suman Nadon Sali kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23" />San san ai la cɛɛilu bɛɛ ye na n ɲakɔrɔ siɲa sawa ka n bato, nde mɛn ye Isirayɛlikailu Maari Allabatala ri. <verse eid="EXO 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24" />N di siyailu gbɛn ka a mabɔ ai ɲɛ ka do kafu ai la jamana la bonya ma. San san, ai wa kɛ wala ai Maari Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ ka a bato siɲa sawa, n tɛ sɔn mɔɔ si ye a nata la ai la jamana kan ka a mira ai kɔ.<verse eid="EXO 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />«Ai wa kolofen bɔ ka a kɛ n yɛ saraka ri, ai kana wo jeli ni buru la a ɲɔɔn kan ka a di n ma, lɛbɛn ye buru mɛn dɔ. Ai wa kolofen bɔ ka a kɛ Taminkunna Sali saraka ri, ai kana sɔn wo sobo tɔ ye su si.<verse eid="EXO 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" />«San san ai wa suman kura fɔlɔ mɛnilu ka, ai ye na wo ɲuma ɲumailu ri ai Maari Allabatala la bon na.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:26">«Ai kana badennin tibi a na nɔnɔ la.»<verse eid="EXO 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ikɔ tuunni ko: «I ye kuma ɲinilu sɛbɛ, baa n da teriya sidi nde ni ile tɛma, a ni nde ni Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ tɛma, ka a bɛn kuma woilu le ma.» <verse eid="EXO 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Musa ka tele binaanin (40) ni su binaanin (40) kɛ Allabatala tɔrɔfɛ ye. A ma dɔɔnnin kɛ. A ma ji min. A ka Allabatala la teriya kumailu sɛbɛ kaba walanilu kan, Allabatala la sariya tan kɔnin.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa jiira ka bɔ koyinkɛ kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />Musa jiira ka bɔ Sinayi koyinkɛ kan. Teriya tɔɔmasere kaba walan fila ye a bolo, Allabatala la sariya sɛbɛni mɛnilu kan. A ɲakɔrɔla tɛrɛ ye mɛlɛnmɛlɛnna ka a masɔrɔn a ni Allabatala kumara i ɲɔɔn fɛ. Kɔni Musa ma lɔn ko a ɲakɔrɔla ye mɛlɛnmɛlɛnna. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Haruna ni Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ ka Musa yen tuma mɛn na, ii ka a yen a ɲakɔrɔla ye mɛlɛnmɛlɛnna. Ii ma sɔn i madonna a la, baa ii silanni. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Kɔni Musa ka ii kili. Awa Haruna ni jama kuntiilu bɛɛ nara a tɛrɛn, wo rɔ Musa kumara ii yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Wo kɔ rɔ, Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ ka i madon a la. Allabatala tun ka Musa jamari mɛnilu la Sinayi koyinkɛ kan, Musa ka wo bɛɛ fɔ ii yɛ.<verse eid="EXO 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" />Musa ban kɔ rɔ kumala ii yɛ, a ka faanin birin a ɲakɔrɔ da la. <verse eid="EXO 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />Ka a ta waati wo ma, ni Musa donda Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ kuma diya, a ri faanin wo bɔ a ɲakɔrɔla la haan a wa bɔ tuma mɛn na. Ni a bɔra ye tuma mɛn na, Allabatala tun ka a jamari ko ko la, a ri wo fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ. <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />Isirayɛlikailu ri a yen ko Musa ɲakɔrɔla ye mɛlɛnmɛlɛnna. Wo kɔ rɔ, Musa ri faanin wo birin a ɲakɔrɔla la ikɔ tuunni, haan a wa don ikɔ tuun Allabatala kan ka kumaɲɔɔnya.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s">Ɲɔɲɔ Lon ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Musa ka Isirayɛlikailu jama bɛɛ ladɛn ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Allabatala ka jamarili mɛnilu di ai ma, ko ai ye woilu kɛ, ii le ɲin. <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" />Ai ye baara kɛ tele wɔɔrɔ kɔrɔ, kɔnin tele wɔrɔnwulana lon ye kɛ ai yɛ lon sɛniman di. Ɲɔɲɔ Lon dafanin de wo ri, mɛn bilanin a dan na Allabatala bonya kanma. Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka baara kɛ wo lon, ai ye wo tii faa. <verse eid="EXO 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />Hali ka ta ladɛn ai la bon do kɔndɔ Ɲɔɲɔ Lon, ai kana wo kɛ.»<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔilu ka kan ka niilifen mɛnilu di Alla daa makɛ faaninbon lɔ kanma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Musa ka a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu jama bɛɛ yɛ ko: «Allabatala ka jamari ko: <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" />‹ai ye fen doilu bɔ ai bolofenilu rɔ ka woilu kɛ niilifenilu ri ka ii di Allabatala ma. Mɔɔ mɛnilu ri sɔn wo ma, ii bɛɛ ye na niilifen di. Ii ye na sanin di, a ni wodigbɛ ni sulanɛɛ <verse eid="EXO 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi ni makisali ɲuma. Ii ye na baa siilu fanan di, <verse eid="EXO 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />a ni saaji gbolo kolonin wulenman ni gbolo kolonin ɲuma su gbɛrɛilu ni kasiya jiri. <verse eid="EXO 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />Ii ye na olibiye tulu ri, mɛn di kɛ fitinailu rɔ. Ii ye na sumadiyalanilu fanan di, mɛnilu di kɛ wusulan ni suwandili tulu rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />Kabakuru mɛn tɔɔ ko onikisi, ii ye na wo ri, a ni kabakudun ragbɛlɛn gbɛrɛilu, ka woilu kara Allabatala la sarakalasela la kɔkanbila durukini kɔkan, a ni a la sisirɔ bɔrɔni kɔkan. <verse eid="EXO 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />Mɛnilu kusan bolo la baarala, ii ye na ka fenilu rabɛn, Allabatala ka mɛnilu bɛɛ ko fɔ. <verse eid="EXO 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" />Ii ri Alla daa makɛ faaninbon nadan, a ni a faaninbon wo kunnabirin. Ii ri Alla daa makɛ faaninbon fendamirafenilu fanan nadan, a ni a damira jiriilu ni a kankan gbelekeilu ni a taramailu ni a siifenjuilu. <verse eid="EXO 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />Ii ri teriya tɔɔmasere kankira fanan nadan, a ni a gbelekeilu ni a dalatuun ni bon tatɛɛfaanin, kankira ri sii mɛn kɔma. <verse eid="EXO 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />Ii ri tabali fanan nadan, a ni a gbelekeilu ni a muranilu bɛɛ. Ii ri saraka buru fanan dabɛn, mɛn di bila tabali kan, mɛn di to Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ tuma bɛɛ. <verse eid="EXO 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />Ii ri fitinasiifen ni a muranilu bɛɛ ladan, a ni a fitinailu ni fitina tulu. <verse eid="EXO 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />Ii ri wusulanjanin saraka bɔ diya ni a gbelekeilu ladan, a ni wusulan suma duman ni suwandili tulu. Ii ri faanin fanan nadan, mɛn di dun faaninbon donda la. <verse eid="EXO 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />Ii ri saraka bɔ diya ladan, sarakailu ri janin mɛn kan ka kɛ buuri ri. Ii ri saraka bɔ diya wo sulanɛɛ sansan fanan nadan, a ni saraka bɔ diya gbeleke ni a muranilu bɛɛ. Ii ri yagbawara ladan, a ni a siifenju. <verse eid="EXO 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />Ii ri lukɔndɔla laminin faanin fanan nadan, a ni woilu lɔ jiriilu ni jiriilu siifenilu, ka lukɔndɔla donda faanin fanan nadan. <verse eid="EXO 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />Faaninbon ni a lukɔndɔla laminin faaninilu ri sidi bɔlɔ mɛnilu la duu ma, ii ri woilu fanan nadan, a ni ii juluilu. <verse eid="EXO 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />Ii ri faanin keɲi bailu fanan nadan, n na sarakalasela Haruna la faanin sɛnimanilu ni a dencɛilu la faaninilu kɔnin. Haruna ni a dencɛilu ri faanin woilu bila ii kan na ka Alla la sarakalasela baara kɛ yɔrɔ sɛniman kɔndɔ.›»<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayɛlikailu nara niilifenilu ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Isirayɛlikailu jama bɛɛ bɔra Musa ɲakɔrɔ ka wa. <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" />A ko donda mɛnilu jusu rɔ ka ii kɛ waninkɛɲumatiilu ri, woilu bɛɛ nara niilifenilu ri Allabatala ma a daa makɛ faaninbon ni a kɔndɔfenilu bɛɛ baara kanma, a ni a sarakalaselailu la faanin sɛnimanilu. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />Cɛɛ waninkɛɲumatiilu ni muso waninkɛɲumatiilu bɛɛ nara fen su bɛɛ ri mɛn nadannin sanin dɔ. Ii nara sanin binsanilu ri, tololafenilu, gbarangbaranilu a ni kanna kɔnɔnilu. Ii bɛɛ nara sanin niilifen woilu ri ka ii kɔrɔta Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ ka ii di a ma. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi ni makisali ɲuma tɛrɛ ye mɛnilu bolo, woilu nara woilu ri, a ni baa siilu ni saaji gbolo kolonin wulenman ni gbolo kolonin ɲuma gbɛrɛilu. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Mɛnilu bɛɛ tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka wodigbɛ wala sulanɛɛ kɛ niilifen di, woilu nara woilu di Allabatala ma. Kasiya jiri tɛrɛ ye mɛnilu bolo, jiri mɛn di Alla daa makɛ faaninbon baara do ɲa kɔnin, woilu nara woilu fanan di. <verse eid="EXO 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" />Muso mɛnilu kusan wurundili kɛla, ii bɛɛ ka kari ladan ten ka na woilu ri. Ii nara kari buleman di, a ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi ni faanin makisali ɲuma. <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />Muso mɛnilu bɛɛ jusu sɔnda a ni mɛnilu kusan baa si wurundila kosɛbɛ, woilu ka wo wurundi. <verse eid="EXO 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />Isirayɛlikailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu nara onikisi kabakudunilu ni kabakudun ragbɛlɛn gbɛrɛilu ri, mɛnilu ri kara kɔkanbila durukini ni sisirɔ bɔrɔni la. <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />Ii nara tulu ni sumadiyalanilu fanan di. Tulu wo fan kelen di kɛ fitina tulu ri. A tɔ fan kelen di kɛ suwandili tulu ri. Sumadiyalan woilu fan kelen kɛra suwandili tulu rɔ. A tɔ fan kelen kɛra wusulan di. <verse eid="EXO 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />Isirayɛlika waninkɛɲumatiilu bɛɛ nara ii la bɔnjɛrɛrɔ niilifenilu ri Allabatala ma baara kɛ kanma, a tun ka baara mɛn bɛɛ ko fɔ ii yɛ ka fara Musa la.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Besalɛli ni Oholiyabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Musa ka a fɔ Isirayɛlikailu yɛ ko: «A ragbɛ. Allabatala ra Uri dencɛ Besalɛli suwandi. Juda kabila mɔɔ le ri. A benba ye Huri le ri, Uri fa kɔnin. <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" />Allabatala ra Besalɛli lawasa Alla la Nii la, a hankili duman, a kusan, a la lɔnnin ka bon. A senin baara su bɛɛ kɛla. <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32" />A senin fen keɲiilu ladanna sanin na, a ni wodigbɛ la, a ni sulanɛɛ la. <verse eid="EXO 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33" />A seni kabakudun kisɛilu lɛsɛla, ka ii bila fendamirafenilu la. A seni jiri fanan lɛsɛla. A kusan bolo labaara su bɛɛ kɛla. <verse eid="EXO 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Allabatala ra se di Besalɛli ni Ahisamaki dencɛ Oholiyabu ma ka mɔɔilu karan sa woilu fanan di baara su woilu kɛ. Oholiyabu ye Daan kabila mɔɔ le ri. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />A ka se di ii ma sa ii di se baara su bɛɛ kɛla. Ii ye bololabaara ɲuma kɛla. Ii ye kolɔnnailu le ri, mɛnilu ye fen ɲatɔnɔmailu ni fen keɲiilu ladanna. Faanin sɔɔlailu le ii ri, mɛnilu ye makisali ɲuma sɔɔla kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi la. Ii kusan jese danna fanan. Ka bolo la baara su bɛɛ kɛ, ii seni wo la kosɛbɛ. Ka fen ɲatɔnɔmailu ni fen keɲiilu ladan, ii seni wo fanan na kosɛbɛ.<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />«Awa, Besalɛli ni Oholiyabu ni mɔɔ mɛnilu kusan bɛɛ ri, woilu ye baara kɛ koɲuma ka a bɛn Allabatala la kuma ma. Allabatala ra se ni famunyali di ii ma sa ii ri se Alla daa makɛ faaninbon ni a kɔndɔfenilu bɛɛ ladanna.»<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔilu nara niilifenilu ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Nba, Musa ka Besalɛli ni Oholiyabu kili baara kanma a ni bolo labaara la gbɛrɛilu Allabatala tun ka sebaya di mɔɔ mɛnilu ma, mɛnilu bɛɛ sɔnda nala ka baara wo kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />Isirayɛlikailu tun nara niilifen mɛnilu di Musa ma Alla daa makɛ faaninbon baara kanma, Musa ka fen woilu don baarakɛla woilu bolo baara kanma. Kɔni Isirayɛlikailu tora nala bɔnjɛrɛrɔ niilifenilu ri sɔɔma sɔɔma. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />Wo kɛra sababu ri, baarakɛla kusan ba woilu mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye Alla daa makɛ faaninbon baara kɛla, woilu ka ii la baara lalɔ. <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" />Ii wara Musa tɛrɛn ye ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Allabatala ka baara ko fɔ. An mako ye fen mɛnilu la ka baara wo kɛ, mɔɔilu ye nala woilu ri fɔɔ ka a dan natamin.» <verse eid="EXO 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />A kɛra ten, Musa ka kela lawa ii daa makɛ diya yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ ko mɔɔ si kana na niilifen di butun Alla daa makɛ faaninbon baara kanma. Wo rɔ, jama ka niilifen di boloka, <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />baa niilifen mɛnilu tun da di, woilu tun di se ka baara laban ka a tɔ to.<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla daa makɛ faaninbon di ladan ɲa mɛn ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />Mɛnilu bɛɛ kusan bolo labaara kɛla kosɛbɛ baarakɛlailu tɛma, woilu ka Alla daa makɛ faaninbon jɛrɛ ladan faanin yanyan tan na. Faanin woilu tɛrɛ makisali ɲumailu le ri, kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi ye mɛnilu la. Mɛn kusan faanin sɔɔla kosɛbɛ, wo ka serubɛn sawurailu ta woilu kan. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Faanin tan woilu bɛɛ kanyara. Ii yanyan kɛra nunkan ɲa muwan ni seyin (28) di. Ii kɔndɔ kɛra nunkan ɲa naanin le ri. <verse eid="EXO 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />Ii ka faanin loolu kara i ɲɔɔn na, ka a tɔ loolu fanan kara i ɲɔɔn na. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Faanin loolu mɛn karani i ɲɔɔn na, ii ka wooyanilu bila wo faanin looluna dagbolo la. Ii ka wo ɲɔɔn kɛ faanin tɔ loolu fanan na, mɛnilu karani ii ɲɔɔn na. Ii ka wooyan woilu ladan kari buleman dɔ, <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />ka wooyan biloolu biloolu (50) bila faanin fila woilu dagboloilu la, ka ii ɲa bɛn i ɲɔɔn ma. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Ii ka sanin fendamirafenilu biloolu (50) ladan, mɛnilu ka wooyan fila fila mira ka faanin fila woilu tuun i ɲɔɔn na. Wo rɔ, faaninbon bɛɛ ka i ɲɔɔn mira ka kɛ fen kelen di.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />Ii ka faanin yanyan tan ni kelen nadan baa si la, ka ii kɛ faaninbon kunnabirin di. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Faanin tan ni kelen woilu bɛɛ kanyara. Ii yanyan kɛra nunkan ɲa bisawa (30) ri. Ii kɔndɔ kɛra nunkan ɲa naanin di. <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />Ii ka faanin loolu kara i ɲɔɔn na, ka faanin tɔ wɔɔrɔ kara i ɲɔɔn na. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Faanin loolu mɛnilu karani i ɲɔɔn na, ii ka wooyan biloolu (50) bila faanin wo looluna dagbolo la. Faanin tɔ wɔɔrɔ mɛnilu fanan karani i ɲɔɔn na, ii ka wooyan biloolu (50) bila wo wɔɔrɔna dagbolo la. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />Ii ka sulanɛɛ fendamirafen biloolu (50) fanan nadan. Faanin fila woilu ri tuun i ɲɔɔn na woilu la, ka a kɛ fen kelen di. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />Ii ka faaninbon kunnabirin nadan saaji gboloilu la, mɛnilu tun da wulen, ka kunnabirin gbɛrɛ fanan nadan gbolo kolonin ɲumailu la. Kunnabirin filana wo ri la saaji gbolo ta kan ka to a san fɛ.<verse eid="EXO 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Ii ka kasiya jiriilu ta ka faaninbon damira jiriilu ladan mɛnilu lalɔtɔ. <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />Woilu kelen kelenna bɛɛ yanyan kɛra nunkan ɲa tan di. Ii bonya kɛra nunkan ɲa kelen ni tala ri. <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />Ii ka tɛmala jiri fila bila jiri woilu tɛma, ka tɛmala jiri woilu ɲabɛn i ɲɔɔn ma. Ii ka faaninbon damira jiriilu bɛɛ ladan wo ɲa le ma. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />Ii ka faaninbon damira jiri muwan (20) nadan. Woilu lalɔtɔ faaninbon tele kankan bolokinin fan fɛ. <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />Ii ka wodigbɛ siifenju binaanin (40) fanan nadan, mɛnilu bilatɔ jiri woilu ju kɔrɔ, jiri kelen siifenju fila, baa sen fila mɛnilu ye jiriilu bɛɛ la, woilu bɛɛ dontɔ siifenju rɔ, sen kelen siifenju kelen. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25-26" />Faaninbon damira jiri muwan (20) mɛnilu ri lalɔ faaninbon tele kankan bolomaran dɔ, ii ka woilu ladan, ka wodigbɛ siifenju binaanin (40) fanan nadan, jiri kelen siifenju fila. <verse eid="EXO 36:25-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />Faaninbon damira jiri wɔɔrɔ (6) mɛnilu ri lalɔ faaninbon telebe rɔ, bon kɔfɛla kɔnin, ii ka woilu ladan, <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />ka jiri fila fanan nadan, mɛnilu lalɔtɔ bon kɔfɛla rɔ ka kɛ faaninbon tonkonilu ri. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />Ii ka tonkon jiri fila ɲinilu bɛɛ ladan jiri fila fila la, mɛnilu tansanni i ɲɔɔn ma duu ma ka bɛn i ɲɔɔn ma san fɛ. Jiri fila kunilu mirani i ɲɔɔn na koyina kelen na. Ii ka tonkon jiri fila bɛɛ ladan ten. <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />Wo rɔ, faaninbon damira jiri seyin (8) di lalɔ bon kɔfɛ la bɛɛ rɔ. Wodigbɛ siifenju tan ni wɔɔrɔ (16) ri bila woilu kɔrɔ, jiri kelen siifenju fila.<verse eid="EXO 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />Ii ka gbeleke kankantailu ladan kasiya jiri rɔ, mɛnilu ri kankan faaninbon damira jiriilu kan ka woilu ramira. Gbeleke loolu ri kankan faaninbon fan kelen jiriilu kan. <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />Gbeleke loolu ri kankan faaninbon fan do damira jiriilu kan. Gbeleke loolu fanan di kankan faaninbon kɔfɛ la damira jiriilu kan, bon telebe fan fɛ kɔnin. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Kankan gbeleke mɛnilu ri kɛ gbeleke loolu loolu woilu tɛma ta ri, ii ka woilu ladan sa ii ri bɔ faaninbon fan kelen tonkon do la ka wa se fan wo tonkon do ma. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Ii ka sanin la faaninbon damira jiriilu kan ka jiri bɛɛ latunun, ka sanin la gbeleke kankantailu fanan kan ka jiri bɛɛ latunun. Ii ka sanin gbarangbaranilu ladan ka woilu kɛ faaninbon damira fenilu ri. Gbeleke kankantailu ri don woilu rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />Ii ka bon tatɛɛfaanin nadan makisali ɲuma la, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi. Mɛn kusan faanin sɔɔla kosɛbɛ, wo ka serubɛn sawurailu ta a kan. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />Ii ka tatɛɛfaanin dun fen tarama naanin nadan kasiya jiri la, ka sanin la woilu kan ka jiri bɛɛ latunun. Ii ka sanin sɔɔlanilu kɛ tarama woilu kan, ka tarama sii wodigbɛ siifenju naanin kan, jiri kelen siifenju kelen. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Faanin mɛn di dun faaninbon donda la, ii ka wo ladan makisali ɲuma la, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi. Mɛn kusan faanin sɔɔla, wo ka a sɔɔ ka ɲa. <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />Ii ka faanin dunjiri loolu ladan, ka sɔɔlanilu kɛ woilu la. Wo kɔ rɔ, ii ka sanin la jiri woilu kun na, a ni faanindun koyinailu kan, mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye jiriilu la, ka ban ka sulanɛɛ siifenju loolu ladan, jiri kelen siifenju kelen.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s">Kankira ladan ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Besalɛli ka teriya tɔɔmasere kankira ladan kasiya jiri rɔ. A yanyan kɛra nunkan ɲa fila ni tala ri. A bonya kɛra nunkan ɲa kelen ni tala ri. A lɔ kɛra nunkan ɲa kelen ni tala ri. <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />A ka sanin jɛrɛwolo la a kɔndɔla ni a kɔkanna bɛɛ ma, ka a jiri bɛɛ latunun. A ka a da kirinkirin bɛɛ kɛ sanin di. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />A ka sanin gbarangbaran naanin nadan, ka woilu kelen kelenna bila kankira sen naanin na. Wo rɔ, gbarangbaran fila bilara kankira fan kelen fɛ, a tɔ fila bilara a fan do fɛ. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />A ka gbelekeilu rabɛn kasiya jiri rɔ, ka sanin la woilu ma ka a jiri bɛɛ latunun. <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" />A ka woilu don gbarangbaranilu rɔ teriya tɔɔmasere kankira fan fila bɛɛ rɔ, sa kankira ri se madoninna.<verse eid="EXO 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />A ka julumun kafari dalatuun nadan sanin jɛrɛwolo la. A yanyan kɛra nunkan ɲa fila ni tala ri. A kɔndɔ kɛra nunkan ɲa kelen ni tala ri. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />A ka serubɛn bisiki kelen kelenna ladan datuun na kun fila ma. A ka woilu ladan sanin gbasinin dɔ. <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />A ka serubɛn bisiki kelen nadan kankira datuun na kun kelen na, ka a tɔ kelen nadan datuun na kun do wo la. Serubɛn bisiki fila ni kankira datuun na bɛɛ kɛra fen kelen de ri. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" />Serubɛn bisiki fila ɲabɛnni i ɲɔɔn na, ka ii ɲa lɔni to kankira datuun na rɔ. Ii kawailu layɛlɛra san ma, ka birin kankira datuun na kun na.<verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabali ladan ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />Besalɛli ka tabali kelen nadan kasiya jiri rɔ. A yanyan kɛra nunkan ɲa fila ri, a kɔndɔ kɛra nunkan ɲa kelen di, a lɔ kɛra nunkan ɲa kelen ni tala ri. <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />A ka sanin jɛrɛwolo la tabali wo bɛɛ ma ka jiri bɛɛ latunun, ka a da kirinkirin bɛɛ kɛ sanin di. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />A ka fɛrɛnilu kankan tabali la tabali fan bɛɛ la. Fɛrɛn woilu bonya bɛnda bolo koyini naanin bonya ma. A ka a da kirinkirin bɛɛ kɛ sanin di fɛrɛn woilu la. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />A ka gbarangbaran naanin nadan sanin dɔ, ka woilu kelen kelenna don tabali tonkon naanin na a sen kelen kelenna dafɛ. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />A ka gbarangbaranilu lasudunya fɛrɛnilu la. Tabali ta gbelekeilu ri don gbarangbaran woilu rɔ sa tabali ri se madoninna. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />A ka tabali ta gbelekeilu rabɛn kasiya jiri rɔ, ka sanin la woilu ma ka a jiri bɛɛ latunun. <verse eid="EXO 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Muran mɛnilu ri bila tabali kan, a ka woilu ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo la. Wo doilu kɛni ikomin pileti ni kalamailu ni jilafɛilu ni daailu. Alla sarakalaselailu ri rɛsɛnji kɛ bafata woilu kɔndɔ, ka a labɔn ka a kɛ niilifen di.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fitinasiifen nadan ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />A ka fitinasiifen nadan sanin jɛrɛwolo gbasinin dɔ. A kala ni a sen, a ni a fitinasii daaninilu ni a kuruilu ni a fɛrɛn bisikilu bɛɛ kɛra fen kelen de ri. <verse eid="EXO 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />Bolon wɔɔrɔ bɔra a kala rɔ. Bolon sawa kɛra bolokinin fɛ, bolon sawa kɛra bolomaran fɛ. <verse eid="EXO 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />A ka daani sawa ladan bolon kelen kelenna bɛɛ la, ka woilu kɛ amande jiriden munuɲa ri, bɛɛ ni a kuruilu, bɛɛ ni a fɛrɛnilu. <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />A ka daanin naanin nadan fitinasiifen kala ma, ka woilu fanan kɛ amande jiriden munuɲa ri, bɛɛ ni a naronilu, bɛɛ ni a fɛrɛnilu. <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />A ka naron kelen kɛ bolon fila fara yɔrɔ kɔrɔ kala la. Fitinnasiifen bolon wɔɔrɔ bɛɛ kɛra ten. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Fitinnasiifen ni a naronilu ni a bolonilu bɛɛ ri ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo gbasinin dɔ. Wo bɛɛ kɛra fen kelen de ri. <verse eid="EXO 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />A ka fitina wɔrɔnwula ladan, a ni a rabɔfenilu ni a buurigbɛ kɛ fenilu. A ka wo bɛɛ ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo la. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />A ka fitinasiifen ni a muranilu bɛɛ ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo kilo muwan ni fila (22) rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wusulan janin saraka bɔ diya ladan ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />A ka wusulan janin saraka bɔ diya ladan kasiya jiri la. Wo fan naanin bɛɛ kanyara. A fan kelen kelen bɛɛ kɛra nunkan ɲa kelen di. A lɔ kɛra nunkan ɲa fila ri. Kere munuɲa kɛra a tonkon naanin bɛɛ la, kɔni kereilu ni saraka bɔ diya bɛɛ tɛrɛ ye fen kelen de ri. <verse eid="EXO 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />A ka sanin jɛrɛwolo la a yɔrɔ bɛɛ kan, a sanfɛ yɔrɔ ni a kɛrɛfɛ yɔrɔilu a ni a kereilu bɛɛ. A ka a da kirinkirin bɛɛ kɛ sanin di a fan naanin bɛɛ la. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />A ka sanin gbarangbaran fila ladan da kirinkirin wo kɔrɔ saraka bɔ diya fan fila fɛ, fan kelen gbarangbaran fila. Sarakabɔdiya ta gbelekeilu tɛrɛ ye donna gbarangbaran woilu le rɔ, sa saraka bɔ diya ri se madoninna. <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />A ka gbelekeilu rabɛn kasiya jiriilu la ka sanin la ii yɔrɔ bɛɛ kan.<verse eid="EXO 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Besalɛli ka wusulan suma duman jɛrɛwolo ladan, ka suwandili tulu sɛniman fanan nadan. A ka woilu ladan ikomin latikɔlɔn nadanna ye latikɔlɔn nadan ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s">Sarakabɔdiya saraka janintailu ladan ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />Awa, sarakailu ri janin saraka bɔ diya mɛn kan ka a kɛ buuri ri, Besalɛli ka wo ladan kasiya jiri la. Sarakabɔdiya fan naanin bɛɛ kanyara. A fan kelen kelenna bɛɛ kɛra nunkan ɲa loolu ri. A lɔ kɛra nunkan ɲa sawa ri. <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />A ka kere kelen kelenna ladan saraka bɔ diya tonkon naanin bɛɛ la. Saraka bɔ diya ni kereilu bɛɛ tɛrɛ ye fen kelen de ri. Besalɛli ka sulanɛɛ la a yɔrɔ bɛɛ kan. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />A ka buurigbɛ kɛ muranilu ladan, a ni buurigbɛ ta fenilu ni jeli kɛ bafatailu ni sobo sɔɔlanilu ni takisɛ kɛ fenilu. A ka saraka bɔ diya muran woilu bɛɛ ladan sulanɛɛ la. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />A ka sulanɛɛ sansan nadan, ka wo bila saraka bɔ diya kɔndɔ. A ka a bila da kirinkirin kɔrɔ saraka bɔ diya lɔ tɛmala rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />A ka sulanɛɛ gbarangbaranilu ladan sansan wo tonkon naanin na, tonkon kelen gbarangbaran kelen. Saraka bɔ diya madonnin gbelekeilu ri don gbarangbaran woilu rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />A ka gbelekeilu rabɛn kasiya jiri la ka sulanɛɛ la woilu yɔrɔ bɛɛ kan. <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />A ka gbeleke woilu don sulanɛɛ gbarangbaranilu rɔ saraka bɔ diya fan fila bɛɛ fɛ, sa mɔɔilu ri se saraka bɔ diya madoninna. A ka saraka bɔ diya ladan jiri fɛrɛnilu la, ka a kɔndɔ rakolon to.<verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagbawara ladan ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />Muso mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye ii ladɛnna faaninbon da la ka faaninbon baara kɛ, woilu ka ii la dubalenilu di. Besalɛli ka woilu ta ka sulanɛɛ yagbawara ni a sulanɛɛ siifenju nadan woilu la.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Faaninbon lukɔndɔla ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />A ka lukɔndɔla laminin faaninilu ladan makisali ɲumailu la. Lukɔndɔla laminin faanin mɛn di dun faaninbon tele kankan bolokinin fan fɛ, wo yanyan kɛra nunkan ɲa kɛmɛ (100) ri. <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />Faanin wo duntɔ tarama muwan (20) de la. Besalɛli ka tarama woilu ladan, a ni ii sulanɛɛ siifenju, tarama kelen siifenju kelen. Wodigbɛ sɔɔlanilu ni faanindun wodigbɛ koyinailu kɛra tarama ma. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Lukɔndɔla laminin faanin mɛn di dun faaninbon tele kankan bolomaran dɔ, wo fanan yanyan kɛra nunkan ɲa kɛmɛ (100) ri. Faanin woilu duntɔ tarama muwan (20) de la, mɛnilu kelen kelenna siini a sulanɛɛ siifenju kan. Wodigbɛ sɔɔlanilu ni faanindun wodigbɛ koyina kɛra tarama ma. <verse eid="EXO 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Faaninbon telebe rɔ, faanin yanyan kɛra nunkan ɲa biloolu (50) ri. Faanin woilu duntɔ tarama tan de la, mɛnilu kelen kelenna siini a siifenju kan. Wodigbɛ sɔɔlanilu ni faanindun wodigbɛ koyinailu kɛra tarama ma. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Faaninbon telebɔ rɔ, lukɔndɔla yanyan kɛra nunkan ɲa biloolu (50) ri. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14-15" />Lukɔndɔla donda kɛra fan wo fɛ. Donda fan fila bɛɛ fɛ, faaninilu yanyan kɛra nunkan ɲa tan ni loolu ri. Faanin woilu duntɔ tarama sawa sawa le la, mɛnilu kelen kelenna siini a siifenju kan. <verse eid="EXO 38:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Lukɔndɔla laminin faaninilu bɛɛ rabɛnni makisali ɲuma la. <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />Tarama siifenju ladanni sulanɛɛ la. Sɔɔlan ni koyina mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye tarama ma, woilu bɛɛ ladanni wodigbɛ la. Wodigbɛ lara tarama bɛɛ kun ma. Wodigbɛ koyina tɛrɛ ye tarama bɛɛ ma. <verse eid="EXO 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Mɛn kusan faanin sɔɔ la, wo ka lu donda faanin dabɛn makisali ɲuma la, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi. Wo yanyan kɛra nunkan ɲa muwan (20) di. A lɔ kɛra nunkan ɲa loolu ri, ikomin lukɔndɔla laminin faaninilu lɔ. <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />A tarama naanin ni woilu siifenju naanin nadanni sulanɛɛ la. Sɔɔlan ni koyina mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye tarama na, woilu bɛɛ ladanni wodigbɛ la. Wodigbɛ lara tarama bɛɛ kun na. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Faaninbon ni a laminin faaninilu ri sidi bɔlɔ mɛnilu la duu ma, woilu fanan nadanni sulanɛɛ la.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sanin ni wodigbɛ ni sulanɛɛ la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21-23" />Allabatala ka mɛn fɔ Musa yɛ, Uri dencɛ Besalɛli ka wo bɛɛ ladan. Juda kabila mɔɔ le a ri. A benba ye Huri le ri, Uri fa kɔnin. Besalɛli dɛmɛnba le tɛrɛ Ahisamaki dencɛ Oholiyabu ri, ni a ye Daan kabila mɔɔ ri. Oholiyabu tɛrɛ ye bololabaara ɲuma le ri. A tɛrɛ ye kolɔnna le ri, mɛn tɛrɛ ye fen ɲatɔnɔmailu ni fen keɲiilu ladanna. Faanin sɔɔla tɛrɛ ye a ri fanan, mɛn tɛrɛ ye makisali ɲuma sɔɔla kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 38:21-23">Nba, Alla daa makɛ faaninbon mɛn ye Alla la teriya tɔɔmasere daa makɛ faaninbon di. Faaninbon wo ladanda fen mɛnilu la, Musa ka a fɔ Lebi kabila mɔɔilu yɛ ko ii ye wo jatebɔ ka a bɛɛ sɛbɛ. Alla sarakabɔla Haruna dencɛ Itamari tɛrɛ ye jatebɔ baara wo kuntii le ri. Ii ka mɛnilu sɛbɛ, woilu le ɲin di.<verse eid="EXO 38:21-23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Isirayɛlikailu ka sanin mɛnilu kɔrɔta Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ ka a di a ma, woilu kɛra kilo waa kelen (1,000) de ri. Woilu bɛɛ donda yɔrɔ sɛniman baara rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25" />Isirayɛlika mɛnilu tɔɔ sɛbɛra jama jatebɔ waati, woilu ka wodigbɛ di wo waati. Ii ka jate mɛn di, wo bɛɛ ladɛnnin kɛra kilo waa sawa ni kilo kɛmɛ naanin ni kilo muwan (3,420) de ri. <verse eid="EXO 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu sɔrɔn tun da san muwan (20) bɔ, woilu ni woilu kɔrɔilu bɛɛ tɔɔ sɛbɛra. Ii bɛɛ ladɛnnin kɛra mɔɔ waa kɛmɛ wɔɔrɔ mɔɔ waa sawa mɔɔ kɛmɛ loolui mɔɔ biloolu (603,550). Ii kelen kelenna bɛɛ ka wodigbɛ karamun wɔɔrɔ bɔ. Yɔrɔ sɛniman jateli bɛnnin karamun tan ni fila le ma. Ii bɛɛ ka wo tala bɔ ten. <verse eid="EXO 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Besalɛli ka wodigbɛ kilo waa sawa kilo kɛmɛ naanin (3,400) ta wo rɔ ka wo yelen ka siifenju kɛmɛ ladan, mɛnilu ri bila faaninbon jiriilu kɔrɔ, a ni faaninbon tatɛɛfaanin tarama kɔrɔ, siifenju kelen, wodigbɛ kilo bisawa kilo naanin (34). <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />Wodigbɛ kilo muwan (20) tora. A ka wo ta ka tarama sɔɔlanilu ni koyinailu ladan, ka do fanan la tarama kun na.<verse eid="EXO 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Isirayɛlikailu ka sulanɛɛ mɛnilu kɔrɔta Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ ka a di a ma, woilu kɛra kilo waa fila kilo kɛmɛ naanin kilo muwan ni kelen (2,421) de ri. <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />A ka siifenju ladan sulanɛɛ woilu la, siifenju mɛnilu ri bila faaninbon donda tarama kɔrɔ. Ii ka sulanɛɛ saraka bɔ diya fanan nadan sulanɛɛ woilu la, a ni a sulanɛɛ sansan ni a muranilu bɛɛ. <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" />A ka siifenju gbɛrɛilu fanan nadan sulanɛɛ woilu la. Siifenju woilu ri bila lukɔndɔla laminin tarama kɔrɔ, a ni lu donda tarama kɔrɔ. Faaninbon ni a laminin faaninilu ri sidi bɔlɔ mɛnilu la duu ma, a ka woilu fanan nadan sulanɛɛ woilu la.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s">Alla la sarakalaselailu la faaninilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Nba, ii ka kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi ta ka faanin keɲi bailu ladan, Alla la sarakalaselailu ri mɛnilu bila ii kan na ii don tuma yɔrɔ sɛniman kɔndɔ ka Alla la baara kɛ. Ii ka faanin sɛnimanilu fanan kara Haruna yɛ ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />Ii ka kɔkanbila durukini ladan sanin na, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi la, a ni makisali ɲuma la. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />Ii ka sanin gbasi kosɛbɛ ka a fɛya, ka a ratɛɛ. Ii ka sanin wo ta ka a don don makisali ɲuma rɔ, ka a don don kari buleman fanan dɔ, a ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi. Mɛnilu kusan bololabaara kɛla kosɛbɛ ri baara wo kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Ii ka kanbankun julu kelen kelen bila kɔkanbila durukini tonkon fila la, sa a ri se tuunna i ɲɔɔn na. <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />Ii ka tɛsidilan ɲuma ɲuma kɛ kɔkanbila durukini la. Tɛsidilan ni kɔkanbila durukini kɛra fen kelen di. Ii la baaraɲa kanyara fanan. Ii ka tɛsidilan kara kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi la, a ni makisali ɲuma la, a ni sanin na, ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6" />Ii ka onikisi kabakudun fila rabɛn ka ii don sanin fendamirafenilu rɔ, kabakudun kelen fendamirafen kelen. Ii ka Isirayɛli dencɛilu tɔɔ sɛbɛ kabakudun woilu kan ikomin sɛbɛli ye kɛla kabakudun kan ɲa mɛn ma ka a kɛ ɲanɔɔ ri. <verse eid="EXO 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7" />Wo kɔ rɔ, ii ka kabakudun woilu bila kɔkanbila durukini kanbankun julu fila la, ka ii kɛ hankili bilafenilu ri Isirayɛlikailu la ko rɔ ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sisirɔ bɔrɔni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />Mɛn kusan bololabaara kɛla kosɛbɛ, wo ka sisirɔ bɔrɔni ladan. A ka a ladan sanin na, a ni kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi la, a ni makisali ɲuma la ikomin kɔkanbila durukini ladanda ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Ni sisirɔ bɔrɔni wo lakadira ka a la i ɲɔɔn kan, a fan naanin bɛɛ ri kanya. A yanyan ni a bonya bɛɛ kɛra sinbiri ɲa kelen di. <verse eid="EXO 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Ii ka a masidi kabakudun sankɔgbɛlɛnilu la, ka woilu nara a la ka kɛ safa naanin di. A safa fɔlɔ kɛra saridiwan kabakudun ri, a ni topase kabakudun ni emerada kabakudun. <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />A safa filana kɛra karibunkili kuru ri, a ni safiri kuru ni jaman. <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />A safa sawana kɛra jasinti kuru ri, a ni akate kuru ni ametisi kuru. <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />A safa naaninna kɛra kirisaliti kuru ri, a ni onikisi kuru ni jasipe kuru. Kuru woilu bɛɛ donda sanin fendamirafenilu rɔ, kuru kelen fendamirafen kelen. <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Kabakuru bɛɛ ladɛnnin kɛra tan ni fila ri, ka a bɛn Isirayɛlikailu la kabilailu jate ma. Ii tɔɔilu sɛbɛra nɛɛ la kabakudunilu kan, kabakudun kelen tɔɔ kelen. Tɔɔilu sɛbɛra ikomin tɔɔ ye sɛbɛla ɲa mɛn ma ɲanɔɔ kan.<verse eid="EXO 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />Ii ka sanin jɔlɔkɔ fila ladan, mɛnilu ri bila sisirɔ bɔrɔni la. Ii ka ii ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo la, ka a mɔrɔmɔrɔ ikomin julukisɛ ye mɔrɔmɔrɔla ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Ii ka sanin fendamirafen fila ni sanin gbarangbaran fila ladan, ka gbarangbaran fila woilu sidi sisirɔ bɔrɔni sanfɛ tonkon fila la. <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />Ii ka sanin jɔlɔkɔ fila woilu kun do don gbarangbaranilu rɔ sisirɔ bɔrɔni tonkon fila la <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />ka ii kun do don fendamirafenilu la, mɛn ye kanbankun julu fila la kɔkanbila durukini ɲɛfɛla rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />Ii ka sanin gbarangbaran fila gbɛrɛ ladan ka woilu sidi sisirɔ bɔrɔni kɔfɛ yɔrɔ la a duuma fan tonkon fila la. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />Wo kɔ rɔ, ii ka sanin gbarangbaran fila gbɛrɛ ladan ka woilu sidi kɔkanbila durukini kanbankun julu fila ɲɛfɛla rɔ. Ii ka ii sidi julu woilu ju kɔrɔ kara diya dafɛ tɛsidilan kun dɔ. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Ii ka sisirɔ bɔrɔni gbarangbaranilu ni kɔkanbila durukini gbarangbaranilu bila i ɲɔɔn na juluɲala bule la, sa sisirɔ bɔrɔni ri to a nɔ rɔ kɔkanbila durukini kan tɛsidilan kun dɔ. Ii ka a kɛ ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla la sarakalaselailu la faaninilu ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Haruna ri kɔkanbila durukini bila durukiba mɛn kan, ii ka wo bɛɛ ladan kari buleman na. Mɛn kusan jese danna ka wo baara kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />Ii ka kun don diya woo bɔ a tɛmala rɔ, ka faanin gbiliman kara woo laminin dɔ, sa durukiba kana fara. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Ii ka kerenati jiridenilu sawura ta ta kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi ni makisali ɲuma la durukiba sen kɔrɔlailu dagbolo kan. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Ii ka talan denninilu ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo la, ka woilu bila bila durukiba sen kɔrɔlailu dagbolo la kerenati jiridenilu sawura tɛma. <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />Ii ka sanin talan dennin do tuun kerenati jiriden sawura kelen kelenna bɛɛ la durukiba dagbolo muumɛ kan. Alla la sarakalasela wa wuli a la baara kɛla, a ri durukiba wo bila a kan na ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27-28" />Ii ka Haruna ni a dencɛilu la duruki kɔrɔbilailu ni kurusi kurunniilu ladan makisali ɲuma la, ka Haruna la bitiran ni a dencɛilu la fula ɲumailu fanan nadan makisali ɲuma la. Mɛn kusan jese danna ka wo baara kɛ. <verse eid="EXO 39:27-28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />Ii ka tɛsidilan nadan makisali ɲuma la, ka a sɔɔ kari buleman ni kari wulenman ɲalagbɛ ni kari wulenman kadikadi la ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. Mɛn kusan faanin sɔɔ la ka wo baara kɛ.<verse eid="EXO 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />Ii ka saninfɛdɛ do ladan, mɛn ye kuntiiya tɔɔmasere sɛniman di. Ii ka a ladan sanin jɛrɛwolo la, ka sɛbɛli do kɛ a kan ikomin sɛbɛli ye kɛla ɲanɔɔ kan ɲa mɛn ma. Sɛbɛli wo ka a fɔ ko: «A bilanin a dan na Allabatala yɛ.» <verse eid="EXO 39:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Ii ka julu buleman sidi saninfɛdɛ wo la, sa a ri se sidila bitiran na mɛn ye a sanfɛ ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 39:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla daa makɛ faaninbon baara banda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Nba, ii banda fenilu bɛɛ baarala ten, mɛnilu ri kɛ Alla daa makɛ faaninbon di, Alla Kunbɛn Diya Faaninbon kɔnin. Isirayɛlikailu ka a bɛɛ kɛ ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" />Ii nara Alla daa makɛ faaninbon fen bɛɛ ri Musa ma. Ii nara faaninilu ri, mɛnilu ri kɛ faaninbon jɛrɛ ri, ka na faaninbon kɔndɔfenilu bɛɛ fanan di. Ka a la woilu kan, ii nara fen ɲinilu ri: fendamirafenilu, faanin damira jiriilu, kankan gbelekeilu, taramailu, a ni siifenjuilu. <verse eid="EXO 39:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />Ii nara faaninbon kunnabirin fila ri. Do ladanni saaji gboloilu la, mɛnilu ra wulen. A tɔ kelen nadanni gbolo kolonin ɲumailu la. Ii nara bon tatɛɛfaanin fanan di, <verse eid="EXO 39:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />a ni teriya tɔɔmasere kankira ni a gbelekeilu ni a julumun kafari dalatuun. <verse eid="EXO 39:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />Ii nara tabali fanan di, a ni a muranilu bɛɛ ni saraka buru mɛn di bila tabali kan, mɛn kɔnin dini Allabatala ma. <verse eid="EXO 39:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" />Ii nara fitinasiifen di, mɛn nadanni sanin jɛrɛwolo la. A fitinailu siini tɛrɛ a kan. Ii nara fitinasiifen muranilu bɛɛ fanan di, a ni fitina tulu. <verse eid="EXO 39:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />Sanin wusulanjanin saraka bɔ diya fanan nara ii bolo, a ni suwandili tulu, a ni wusulan suma duman, a ni faanin mɛn di dun faaninbon donda la. <verse eid="EXO 39:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />Ii nara sulanɛɛ saraka bɔ diya ri, a ni a sulanɛɛ sansan, ni a gbelekeilu a ni a muranilu bɛɛ. Yagbawara nara ii bolo, a ni a siifenju. <verse eid="EXO 39:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" />Ii nara lukɔndɔla laminin faaninilu ri, a ni tarama ni woilu siifenju, ka na faaninbon donda faanin fanan di. Faaninbon lukɔndɔla laminin faaninilu ri sidi bɔlɔ mɛnilu la duu ma, ii nara woilu fanan di, a ni ii juluilu. Ii nara fen bɛɛ ri, mɛnilu bilatɔ Alla daa makɛ faaninbon kɔndɔ, Alla Kunbɛn Faaninbon kɔnin. <verse eid="EXO 39:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />Ii nara faanin keɲi bailu le ri, Alla la sarakalasela Haruna la faanin sɛnimanilu ni a dencɛilu la faaninilu kɔnin. Haruna ni a dencɛilu ri faanin woilu bila ii kan na ka Alla sarakalasela baara kɛ yɔrɔ sɛniman kɔndɔ. <verse eid="EXO 39:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />Isirayɛlikailu ka fen wo bɛɛ baara ikomin Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" />Musa ka fen woilu bɛɛ ragbɛ kosɛbɛ. A ka a yen ko ii ka baara wo bɛɛ kɛ ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma. Wo rɔ, Musa ka duwawu kɛ ii yɛ.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s">Alla daa makɛ faaninbon lɔ ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />Allabatala ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ko: <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />«San karo fɔlɔ tele fɔlɔ lon, i ye n daa makɛ faaninbon lɔ, n daa makɛ faaninbon kɔnin. <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />I ye teriya tɔɔmasere kankira bila a kɔndɔ bon tatɛɛfaanin kɔfɛ. <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />I ye tabali ladon faaninbon kɔndɔ ka buruilu bila a kan, a ni tabali muranilu bɛɛ. Wo kɔ rɔ, i ye fitinasiifen nadon faaninbon kɔndɔ ka fitinailu sii sii a kan. <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />I ye wusulan janin sanin saraka bɔ diya sii teriya tɔɔmasere kankira ɲɛfɛ, ka faanin dun faaninbon donda la.<verse eid="EXO 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />«Saraka ri janin ka kɛ buuri ri saraka bɔ diya mɛn kan, i ye wo sii Alla daa makɛ faaninbon donda la, Alla Kunbɛn Faaninbon kɔnin. <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />I ye yagbawara sii Alla kunbɛn faaninbon ni saraka bɔ diya tɛma ka ji kɛ a rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />I ye laminin faanin dun lukɔndɔla laminin dɔ, ka donda faanin dun lu da la.<verse eid="EXO 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />«I ye suwandili tulu ta ka do mun n daa makɛ faaninbon ma, a ni a kɔndɔfenilu bɛɛ. Wo rɔ, i ri a ni a muran bɛɛ bila a dan na ka ii kɛ fen sɛnimanilu ri, mɛn ye n ta ri. <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />Saraka di janin ka kɛ buuri ri saraka bɔ diya mɛn kan, i ye suwandili tulu do mun wo fanan kan, a ni a muran bɛɛ. Wo rɔ, i ri saraka bɔ diya bila a dan na ka a kɛ fen sɛniman ba ri, mɛn ye n ta ri. <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />I ye suwandili tulu do mun yagbawara fanan ma, a ni a siifenju. Wo rɔ, i ri ii to a dan na ka a kɛ n ta ri.<verse eid="EXO 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" />«I ye Haruna ni a dencɛilu lana n kunbɛn faaninbon da la ka ii ko ji la. <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />Wo wa kɛ, i ye faanin sɛniman woilu bila Haruna kan na, ka suwandili tulu do mun a ma. Wo rɔ, i ri a bila a dan na n na sarakalasela baara kɛ kanma. <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" />I ye a dencɛilu lana ka duruki kɔrɔbilailu bila ii kan na. <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />I ye suwandili tulu mun ii ma ikomin i ka do mun ii fa fɔlɔ ma ɲa mɛn ma, sa ii ri n na sarakalasela baara kɛ. I wa tulu wo mun ii ma ten, ii ni ii bɔnsɔn cɛɛilu ri kɛ Alla la sarakalaselailu ri kadawu.»<verse eid="EXO 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Allabatala ka mɛnilu fɔ Musa yɛ, Musa ka wo bɛɛ kɛ a ɲa ma. <verse eid="EXO 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />San filana karo fɔlɔ, wo tele fɔlɔ lon, a ka Alla daa makɛ faaninbon lɔ. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />Musa kɛra baara bɛɛ kuntii ri. Ii ka siifenju bila bila, ka faaninbon damira jiriilu lɔ, ka kankan gbelekeilu don ii rɔ, ka tarama lɔ. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Ii ka kunnabirin kɛ faaninbon kun na, ka kunnabirin filana la fɔlɔma kan. Ii ka wo kɛ ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Ii ka kaba walan fila bila teriya tɔɔmasere kankira kɔndɔ, ka kankira gbelekeilu don a koyinailu rɔ, ka a julumun kafari dalatuun la a kan. <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />Ii ka teriya tɔɔmasere kankira wo ladon faaninbon kɔndɔ, ka bon tatɛɛfaanin sidi ka kankira ɲamadoon. Ii ka wo kɛ ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Ii ka tabali ladon faaninbon kɔndɔ ka a sii faaninbon tele kankan bolomaran dɔ bon tatɛɛfaanin ɲɛfɛ. <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />Ii ka saraka buruilu sii tabali kan Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ, ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 40:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24" />Wo kɔ rɔ, ii ka fitinasiifen nadon faaninbon kɔndɔ ka a lalɔ faaninbon tele kankan bolokinin dɔ, ka a ɲabɛn tabali la. <verse eid="EXO 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25" />Ii ka fitinailu sii fitinasiifen kan Allabatala ɲakɔrɔ ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26" />Ii ka sanin saraka bɔ diya ladon faaninbon kɔndɔ ka a sii tatɛɛfaanin ɲɛfɛ, <verse eid="EXO 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27" />ka wusulan suma duman janin a kan ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 40:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Wo kɔ rɔ, ii ka donda faanin sidi faaninbon da la. <verse eid="EXO 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />Saraka di janin ka kɛ buuri ri saraka bɔ diya mɛn kan, ii ka wo sii Alla daa makɛ faaninbon da la, Alla Kunbɛn Diya Faaninbon kɔnin, ka ban ka kolofen sarakailu janin saraka bɔ diya wo kan ka ii kɛ buuri ri. Ii ka suman sarakailu fanan bɔ saraka bɔ diya wo kan. Ii ka wo kɛ ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="EXO 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Ii ka yagbawara sii faaninbon ni saraka bɔ diya tɛma, ka ji kɛ a kɔndɔ koli kanma. <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />Musa ni Haruna ni a dencɛilu ka ii boloilu ni ii senilu mako ji wo rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />Ka a ta wo lon ma, ii wa ii don faaninbon na tuma tuma, a ni ii wa kɛ ii madonna saraka bɔ diya la tuma tuma, ii ri ii ko ikomin Allabatala tun ka a fɔ Musa yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="EXO 40:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Ii ka lukɔndɔla laminin faanin dun tarama na ka faaninbon ni saraka bɔ diya laminin, ka donda faanin fanan dun lu da la. Nba, Musa banda baara bɛɛ la wo ɲa le ma.<verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Allabatala la nɔɔrɔ ka faaninbon nafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />Wo kɔ rɔ, duru munuɲa jiira ka birin Alla Kunbɛn Diya Faaninbon kun na, Alla daa makɛ faaninbon kɔnin. Allabatala la nɔɔrɔ ka faaninbon nafa. <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" />Musa ma se donna Alla Kunbɛn Diya Faaninbon kɔndɔ, Alla daa makɛ faaninbon kɔnin, baa duru munuɲa birinni tora a kun na. Ka a la wo kan, Allabatala la nɔɔrɔ tun da a lafa. <verse eid="EXO 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" />Ni duru munuɲa wo tun kɔrɔtara ka bɔ faaninbon kun na tuma tuma, Isirayɛlikailu tun di sila mira ka wa. A kɛra wo ɲa le ma ii la taama bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />Kɔni ni duru munuɲa tun ma kɔrɔta, ii tun tɛ bɔla ii nɔ rɔ. Ii tun di makɔnɔni kɛ fɔɔ duru munuɲa wa kɔrɔta lon mɛn kokura. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" />Allabatala la duru munuɲa tɛrɛ ye faaninbon kun na tele rɔ. Ta tɛrɛ ye mɛlɛnmɛlɛnna duru munuɲa rɔ su rɔ Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ ɲakɔrɔ. A kɛra wo ɲa le ma ii la taama bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>